\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/15: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,572 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin speculators have capitulated, indicating that a large part of the selling may be over for the near term.\par \par \uc2 After years of rejections, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded funds (ETFs) finally {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-approvals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 started trading last week}}}\uc2 . Speculators expected the event to boost Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price, but that did not happen. That led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-speculators-dump-5b-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total sales of about $4.7 billion}}}\uc2 , according to CryptoSlate research and data analyst James Van Straten\par \par \uc2 The Crypto Fear & Greed Index that has been in \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed\u8221\'20\'1D with a score of 76 recently has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fear-greed-index-plummets-neutral-etf-fails-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged to neutral}}}\uc2  at 52. This is a positive sign as it shows that much of the froth may be out of the system.\par \par \uc2 With the "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-sell-news-crypto-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sell the news}}}\uc2 " event out of the way, traders are likely to focus on the macroeconomic data. All eyes are on the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 , which is expected to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-speculators-dump-5b-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 start cutting rates as early as March}}}\uc2 , according to the \uc2 CME Group\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s FedWatch Tool data. If that happens, risk-assets are likely to do well.\par \par \uc2 Is the correction in Bitcoin and altcoins over? Could the major cryptocurrencies resume their uptrend in the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) turned up from the 20-day exponential moving average (4,727) on Jan. 8, indicating that the uptrend remains intact and traders view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/90a82ea6-d4d5-4a08-b03b-57c027045a70.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages indicate that buyers have the upper hand, but the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) warrants caution. If the value maintains above 4,800, the index is likely to ascend to the psychologically important level of 5,000.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 20-day EMA is the first support to keep an eye on. If this level gives way, it will suggest that the buying pressure is reducing. The index may then fall to the 50-day simple moving average (4,601).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) has been consolidating in a downtrend near the 20-day EMA (102) for the past several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/18336a2c-3712-4b57-99d5-f67301b61baf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the index to the critical support at 101.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls are likely to face selling at the 50-day SMA (103). A break and close above the 50-day SMA will suggest the start of a stronger recovery to 104.50. This level may again witness strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed below the support line on Jan. 14, signaling that the bears are trying to make a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1d41ea73-06f2-4aa0-8294-d0fe7d08c17b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($43,693) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near 46, suggesting that the bears hold a slight edge.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it will signal a shift in the sentiment from buying on dips to selling on rallies. The BTC/USDT pair may fall to $40,000 and later to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers overcome the barrier at $44,700, it will suggest that the corrective phase may be over. The pair will then try to reach the psychologically important level of $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is correcting in an uptrend with the bulls trying to keep the price above the immediate support at $2,458.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/6008d59b-64dc-495d-853a-c40b0dc38509.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($2,398) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone indicate that the bulls are in command. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $2,400, it will signal strong buying on dips. The ETH/USDT pair may then rally to $2,717. If this level is scaled, the next stop could be $3,000.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be negated in the near term if the price continues lower and plunges below $2,400. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($2,282) and eventually to $2,100.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the 20-day EMA ($301) on Jan. 12, but the bears could not sustain the price below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $291.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1bf5a612-22a5-4bf0-b28a-35d9305a3e6a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That started a relief rally, which picked up momentum on Jan. 15. If buyers hold the price above $317, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $338 and thereafter dash to $350. The $350 level is likely to attract strong selling by the bears, but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may soar to $400.\par \par \uc2 The important level to watch on the downside is $291 because a slump below it could tug the price to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 Attempts by the bulls to start a recovery in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) stalled near the downtrend line on Jan. 11, suggesting that the bears remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/62645d38-cb94-4f2a-95bc-ed29cd3d76c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.59) and the RSI below 43 suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside. The selling could accelerate if the price plummets below the $0.56 support. That will clear the path for a drop to $0.50 and then to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to prevent the decline, they will have to shove the XRP/USDT pair above the downtrend line. That will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern and start a relief rally to $0.67 and eventually to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) returned from the downtrend line on Jan. 14, indicating that the bears are vigorously protecting the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/d796c593-5e30-443f-813c-998844e17a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($96) has flattened out and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, signaling a balance between supply and demand. If the price skids below the uptrend line, the SOL/USDT pair may tumble to $67.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-happened-in-crypto-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened in crypto today}}}\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the correction may be over. The pair could then travel to $117 and later to $126. Buyers will have to clear this hurdle to signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been falling inside a descending channel pattern for several days, but a minor positive is that the bulls have maintained the price above the breakout level of $0.46.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/6650087b-8ee9-4e23-9710-26a920fdfa01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.55), the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to the downtrend line of the channel. A break and close above the channel will indicate that the downtrend could be over. The pair may then surge to the overhead resistance at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears continue to sell on rallies. That will increase the likelihood of the pair dropping to the support line of the channel, where the buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the breakdown level of $38 since Jan. 12, but the bears have failed to sink the price to the strong support at $31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/b12025bb-220b-459c-8b85-29ea5a1f0fbf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($37.32) is gradually sloping down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a slight advantage to the sellers. If the 50-day SMA ($35.68) support gives way, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may retest the $31 support. A strong bounce off this level may keep the pair rangebound between $31 and $43.50 for some time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move is likely to begin after buyers drive the price above $43.50 or bears pull the pair below the crucial support at $31.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining below the 20-day EMA ($0.08) for the past few days, but the bears have failed to sink the price to $0.07.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c5d46fd4-f688-4cd3-b1b0-a082f8aa8a36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the negative territory indicate an advantage to sellers. If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. Buyers will then try to propel the pair to the stiff overhead resistance zone between $0.10 and $0.11.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvYzc4MGRjYWItYmY1NS00ZWJhLWJjMzItZWYzNzBiMWIwOTU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240115ek1f000jj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
