\par\par \b \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Cede Ground To Emerging Crypto Venture Pullix\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 838 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 January 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum's (ETH) Struggle for Dominance Amidst Rising Challengers}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano's (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Uphill Battle in a Shifting Crypto Environment}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pullix: Redefining Crypto Trading with Hybrid DeFi Innovation}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), two of the leading cryptocurrencies, are facing stiff competition from the emerging crypto venture, Pullix. As the market landscape evolves, these established players are witnessing shifts in their dominance. This article delves into how Ethereum and Cardano are adapting and what Pullix brings to the table in this dynamic market.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum's (ETH) Struggle for Dominance Amidst Rising Challengers\par \par \uc2 Despite a remarkable year-on-year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/ethereum/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growth of 81.86%}}}\uc2 , with its current price at $2,423.79, Ethereum is navigating through a period of intense competition. Its transition to Proof-of-Stake (PoS) and the continuous development of layer 2 solutions have been pivotal in its efforts to maintain market relevance. Analysts, including those from \uc2 JPMorgan\uc2 , foresee Ethereum outperforming Bitcoin in 2024, driven by upgrades aimed at reducing transaction costs and enhancing speeds.\par \par \uc2 The digital currency's DApp volumes, reaching $27.8 billion in the last seven days, illustrate its dominant position in the DApp ecosystem. However, this dominance is being tested as Ethereum faces competition from emerging networks like Pullix. While Ethereum's technological advancements and the potential introduction of a spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  offer promise, the rise of contenders like Pullix, known for its innovative approach and unique offerings in the crypto market, poses a significant challenge to Ethereum's market share.\par \par \uc2 Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Uphill Battle in a Shifting Crypto Environment\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), with its current price at $0.5124, has experienced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 13.85% decline}}}\uc2  over the past month, reflecting a period of challenging market conditions. This downward trend places Cardano in a critical phase of its market journey, where it contends not only with market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  but also with the rising prominence of new entrants like Pullix. Cardano's unique position in the cryptocurrency space, known for its robust blockchain platform and a strong focus on sustainability and security, is now being tested as the market landscape evolves.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano token, despite facing \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals in its technical indicators, including a Moving Average Convergence Divergence (MACD) below the signal line, still holds potential for recovery. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) above 55 indicates a possible turnaround in \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. However, this optimism is tempered by the recent decline in unique wallet addresses and daily transactions on the network, which have dropped significantly since