platforms. The PLX token\u8217\'20\'19s revenue-sharing model is another groundbreaking feature, offering token holders a share in the exchange's daily revenue and a fixed passive income \u8211\'20\'13 a first in the crypto exchange space.\par \par \uc2 Thanks to all these benefits, nearly 70M PLX tokens have been sold so far, helping Pullix raise over $3.6M. Currently, one PLX is worth just $0.08, but experts predict a 100% surge before the presale ends. Once it hits exchanges in Q1 of 2024, a 100x pump may also occur - making PLX the best crypto to buy.\par \par \uc2 For more information regarding Pullix\u8217\'20\'19s presale see links below:\par \par \uc2 Visit Pullix\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/pullix"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The Pullix Communities}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240115ek1f000xf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
