has formed an ascending pattern, indicating a positive trend. However, Ripple (XRP) performance is closely tied to the ongoing legal case with the US SEC, which could significantly impact its price.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) is trading in the range of $0.563 to $0.683. The 10-Day Moving Average is $0.581, and the 100-Day Moving Average is $0.595. Ripple (XRP) has support levels at $0.391 and $0.511, with resistance levels at $0.752 and $0.872.\par \par \uc2 The future of Ripple (XRP) appears cautiously optimistic, with technical analysis suggesting a potential rise. However, the outcome of the SEC case and the current weak buying momentum, as indicated by the Relative Strength Index, are critical factors that could influence its price movement.\par \par \uc2 Emerging Cryptocurrencies to Watch: A Closer Look at Polygon (MATIC), Sui (SUI), Sei (SEI), and Aptos (APT)\par \par \uc2 In the ever-evolving world of cryptocurrencies, it's crucial to keep an eye on emerging coins that show significant potential alongside the established players. Polygon (MATIC), Sui (SUI), Sei (SEI), and Aptos (APT) are four such cryptocurrencies that have been making waves in the market, each with unique features and developments that could shape their future trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) is seeing increased network activity with a rise in daily active addresses, indicating growing adoption. But while more people are hopping on the Polygon (MATIC) train, there's been a dip in the number of transactions and its market value took a hit, painting a complex picture for what's next.\par \par \uc2 Sui (SUI) is gearing up for a potential breakout, with technical indicators showing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) and Average Directional Index (ADX) suggest a strengthening uptrend, while on-chain metrics indicate increasing social dominance and volume.\par \par \uc2 Despite recent price dips, Sei (SEI) holds potential for recovery. Its recent slip in value and market size might just be a brief hiccup on its path to growth. With the crypto market's resilience and potential renewed investor interest, Sei (SEI) outlook remains cautiously optimistic for future growth.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) is preparing for a significant unlocking event, with over 24 million tokens set to enter circulation. With over 8% of its circulating tokens about to hit the market, many are wondering how Aptos (APT) trading patterns might shift. Despite recent price declines and a weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend on the \uc2 RSI\uc2 , the market is watching how this unlocking event will influence Aptos (APT) volume and price action.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 In the ever-shifting crypto landscape, several currencies are emerging as strong investment contenders that even seasoned traders are watching. Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Ripple (XRP), Polygon (MATIC), Sui (SUI), Sei (SEI), Aptos (APT) are currently viewed as the top seven cryptocurrencies with significant growth potential. These cryptocurrencies offer potential yet carry risks.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) drawing more devs and growing its network, really stepping up to Ethereum's game. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has shown a recent price surge, influenced by whale activities, but faces a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sentiment. Ripple (XRP) is on a positive trend, potentially reaching the $1 milestone, but its future is closely tied to the outcome of its legal case with the U.S. SEC. Meanwhile, emerging cryptocurrencies like Polygon (MATIC), Sui (SUI), Sei (SEI), and Aptos (APT) are making significant strides in the market.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240113ek1d000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/12: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,588 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  event is witnessing profit booking in the near term, but that is unlikely to start a longer-term downward move.\par \par \uc2 The United States regulator finally green-lighted the Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) spot exchange-traded fund applications on Jan. 10, and several {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-trading-cboe-nyse-arca-nasdaq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETFs started trading on Jan. 11}}}\uc2 . The outcome was so extensively discussed that the event did not result in a massive spike or a sharp sell-off, suggesting that the approval was largely priced in.\par \par \uc2 Even without any \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tailwind, the Bitcoin ETFs generated enough interest among traders. Data shows that the combined {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-volumes-break-records-blackrock-fidelity-grayscale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading volume in the newly launched Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  touched $4.5 billion on day one of trading.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c64bfefb-aaeb-42fe-b642-4ac613b8f960.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After an initial correction, Bitcoin may enter a range in the near term as traders wait for the institutional flows into Bitcoin ETFs to begin. However, in the long term, Bitcoin ETFs, along with Bitcoin halving in April 2024, are likely to cause a supply squeeze, boosting prices higher.\par \par \uc2 What critical support levels may attract buying in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been volatile in the past few days, as seen from the long tail on Jan. 10 and the long wick on the Jan. 11 candlestick. This suggests buying at lower levels and selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/e0909f3b-3e23-406c-9444-4003021c37ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price below the breakout level of $44,700, signaling that the markets have rejected the higher levels. The bulls will try to arrest the fall at the 50-day simple moving average ($42,404).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will try to kick the price back above the overhead resistance at $44,700. If they can pull it off, the BTC/USDT pair may climb to $49,000 and then to $52,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break below the 50-day SMA could accelerate selling, and the pair may plunge to $40,000 and eventually to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed above the overhead resistance of $2,400 on Jan. 10, signaling the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ef779b09-1682-4e6f-bb07-846c19eca6e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first target on the upside is $2,700, which may tempt short-term traders to book profits. However, if the ETH/USDT does not give up much ground from this level, it will suggest that every minor dip is being purchased. That could improve the prospects of a move to the psychologically important level of $3,000.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is $2,566. If this level is taken out, the pair may drop to $2,500 and then to the breakout level of $2,400.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) pullback stalled at the 20-day EMA ($300) on Jan. 8, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/bf377d40-3bc3-4862-bff9-7f492d7ad129.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls started a recovery on Jan. 10, but they could not maintain the momentum. This suggests that rallies are being sold into. If bears sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA, the selling could intensify, and the BNB/USDT pair may plummet to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price once again bounces off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls remain in control. That will increase the possibility of a rally to $350. If buyers overcome this resistance, the BNB/USDT pair could start its march to $400.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been squeezed between the uptrend line and the downtrend line for the past several days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1caf7b6b-1775-4c4e-90e0-064d2228d23b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($97) and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could dip to the uptrend line. If this support also cracks, the correction may deepen to $67.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, the bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above the downtrend line to gain the upper hand. The pair may then ascend to $117 and subsequently to $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) clawed back above the breakdown level of $0.57 on Jan. 10, indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/df6a7a47-399f-421e-b4ff-f631638ed84d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting that the selling pressure is reducing. The bulls will have to shove and sustain the price above the downtrend line to signal the start of an up move. The XRP/USDT pair may attempt a rally to $0.67 and later to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upward move, they will have to quickly yank the price below the strong support at $0.54. If they succeed, it will clear the path for a further decline to $0.50 and eventually to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the moving averages on Jan. 10, but the bulls could not maintain the momentum and clear the hurdle at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ae52dca2-6183-4d57-8717-eae5fa22821c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.56), which may start a downward move toward $0.46. That may keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair between the downtrend line and $0.46.The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA and pole vaults above the downtrend line. The pair could then retest the overhead resistance at $0.68. If this hurdle is cleared, the pair may rally to $0.90.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50-day SMA ($34.83) on Jan. 10 and rose above the neckline at $38, indicating that the bulls are trying to trap the aggressive bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/76b9f25b-63dd-4af8-9379-ef0eb1af385a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($38.06) is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. A close below the 20-day EMA could sink the AVAX/USDT pair to the 50-day SMA and later to $31.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns up from the current level, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip $38 into support. The pair may then climb to $44, where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-what-to-expect"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spot Bitcoin ETF approved in the US: What to expect next}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Jan. 11, but they could not achieve a close above it. This shows that the bears are viewing the rallies as a selling opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/6d35c786-87ff-4942-ad7a-6c9f487a14b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower, the bears will try to tug the DOGE/USDT pair to the next support at $0.07. Buyers are expected to defend the level with vigor because a failure to do so could sink the pair to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive and sustain the price above the moving averages to indicate that the corrective phase may be over. The pair may then climb to the $0.10 to $0.11 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($7.09) and rose above the overhead resistance of $7.90 on Jan. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/9f9cfac8-217d-4690-bb86-5755c337a0c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to continue the up move on Jan. 11, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels. The bears are trying to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($7.74). If they do that, the DOT/USDT will form a symmetrical triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 Usually, the symmetrical triangle is a continuation pattern, but it behaves as a reversal set up at times. A slide below the support line could start a sharp decline, while a break above the triangle will open the doors for a possible retest of $9.59.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) surged and closed above the moving averages on Jan. 10, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/9d5272b2-e001-4f8e-830b-9d67300bdea4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.88) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, signaling a slight advantage to the buyers. If the price bounces off $0.89, the bulls will try to propel the MATIC/USDT pair to $1.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and skids below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. That may keep the pair range-bound between $0.70 and $1 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvZTBmZDc1MGUtNmE0Ny00Y2E2LWI0MzktYTRkNjQxYjUyODA2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240112ek1c000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
