but also surpassed the $100 resistance point. This resurgence is indicative of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 )'s growing strength and appeal in the crypto world.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Takes a Similar Route\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), as analyzed by expert Ali Martinez, seems to be following a script from 2018 to 2020. His charts hint at \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  consolidating until April, setting the stage for a potential bull run. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  enthusiasts are watching closely, especially as the crypto market enjoys a positive vibe fueled by optimism around a Spot \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2  approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Martinez's observations add to the anticipation surrounding Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), creating a buzz within the crypto community eager to decipher the signals embedded in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's historical patterns.\par \par \uc2 In his post, Martinez highlights the possibility of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) consolidating around its present levels until April, mirroring the historical trend. In addition, the analyst suggests that if this pattern continues, it could set the stage for a potential resurgence in the bull run. Notably, the chart indicates that the start of the bull run in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price could help it reach $7.\par \par \uc2 Pushd (PUSHD): Transforming Online Marketplaces\par \par \uc2 Now, let's talk about the newcomer - Pushd (PUSHD). Picture it as the \uc2 Amazon\uc2  and \uc2 eBay\uc2  of the decentralized world, a one-of-a-kind web3 marketplace. It connects buyers and sellers globally without the hassle of KYC checks.\par \par \uc2 Pushd isn't just another coin; it's positioned as a potential blue-chip cryptocurrency. With team tokens locked