xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins rallied higher. The price breakout resulted in the total market cap reaching a one-year high of $1.8 trillion on Jan. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ebcb735d-e1cd-449c-a652-d7e85ed1dfb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto performance map. Coin360\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three major factors influencing today\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market rally.\par \par \uc2 Attention shifts to potential spot \uc2 Ether ETF\par \par \uc2 On Jan. 10, the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  officially approved {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-approvals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs)}}}\uc2  for ARK 21Shares, Invesco Galaxy, VanEck, \uc2 WisdomTree\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2 , Valkyrie, \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , Grayscale, Bitwise, Hashdex and \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2 . Trading for the products started on Jan. 11, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-spot-bitcoin-etf-in-us-begins-trading-in-pre-market-with-double-digit-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-spot-bitcoin-etf-in-us-begins-trading-in-pre-market-with-double-digit-gains}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-spot-bitcoin-etf-in-us-begins-trading-in-pre-market-with-double-digit-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 iShares Trust gaining 22.5%}}}\uc2  in premarket activity.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of institutional interest in crypto outside of Bitcoin started on Nov. 9, 2023, when {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-enters-race-spot-ethereum-etf-nasdaq-filing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock\u8217\'20\'19s plans for a spot Ether ETF}}}\uc2  were confirmed through a Form 19b-4 filing submitted to the SEC. \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  is the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest asset manager, controlling over $8 trillion in assets under management and a having {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-apply-spot-bitcoin-etf-sec-nasdaq"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong \b  \highlight22ETF approval\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  record, with 576 approvals and only one denial.\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  is not the only institution seeking approval. Other spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  applicants include \uc2 VanEck\uc2 , ARK 21Shares, Hashdex, Grayscale, Invesco Galaxy and Fidelity. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-will-drive-adoption-in-2024-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing institutional investor}}}\uc2  interest is improving sentiment across the market and suggests that Ether\u8217\'20\'19s performance is not just a one-off event and could continue in the near term. The SEC deadline for a decision to approve or deny the application is May 23.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/55d85118-890c-4b57-b6bf-ab0e2a8c0e5b.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  applicants and deadlines. Source: \uc2 Bloomberg\par \par \uc2 While institutions do not believe Ether will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-reach-high-fourth-quarter-2024-binance-lose-leadership-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overtake Bitcoin price}}}\uc2 , a spot \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2  could bring in over $2.4 billion of capital inflows.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/makerdao-defi-summer-2024-rune-christensen-interview/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MakerDAO\u8217\'20\'19s plan to bring back \u8216\'20\'18DeFi summer\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Rune Christensen}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations push short traders out\par \par \uc2 The crypto market rally has fueled a wave of short position liquidations across the market, totaling over $183.6 million in 24 hours. While Bitcoin short liquidations lead the way with $18.7 million in total shorts wiped out, Ether liquidations total $8.2 million.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/7f61d283-4259-4d6a-a8e6-dfc565ef829b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market liquidations. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Despite the short-seller losing streak, 59.56% of the futures market remains short. With the ratio remaining skewed short, a potential opportunity for a short squeeze could lead to further price upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/80e00771-90ee-4635-82e8-fcedf61339c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin short vs. long ratio. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Sentiment and trading volumes spike\par \par \uc2 The positive sentiment in the crypto market is rippling throughout the ecosystem. Bitcoin and altcoin market trading volume reached $60.8 billion on Jan. 10, the second highest daily volume in three months \u8212\'20\'14 behind Jan. 2\u8217\'20\'19s $64.2 billion.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/8f89be6c-b230-4ec8-ae9e-282ca06e3b67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market trading volume. Source: Newhedge\par \par \uc2 By midday of the first day of spot Bitcoin ETFs trading in the U.S., a total of $2.3 billion had been traded across all newly launched products. The large amount of trading broke a first-day record previously set by the \uc2 ProShares Bitcoin Strategy ETF\uc2 , which tracks Bitcoin futures contracts.\par \par \uc2 LATEST: The 10 fresh spot bitcoin ETFs have seen $1.3b in trading volume so far (as a group they already topped {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BITO&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BITO}}}\uc2  's record). If we add in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24GBTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $GBTC}}}\uc2  we get to $2.3b. And if we add in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BITO&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BITO}}}\uc2  (which is having record day too but isn't part of 'spot' race) we get $3.5b for the complex {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/rrKxywg5rU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/rrKxywg5rU}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 Eric Balchunas\uc2  (@EricBalchunas) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/EricBalchunas/status/1745479923958010171?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 January 11, 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-us-cpi-miss-eth-price-20-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin traders weather US CPI miss as ETH price tags 20-month high}}}\par \par \uc2 There is optimism surrounding the newly launched spot Bitcoin ETFs, and the increase in volume is leading to an improvement in sentiment, reflected by the Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear & Greed Index}}}\uc2 , which now shows \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme greed,\u8221\'20\'1D hitting a monthly high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/da1697a7-aef4-4cf4-abf5-ef97e1dfb2ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and altcoins still have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jp-morgan-ceo-jamie-dimon-hypocrite-crypto-criminals-shut-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overhanging risk events}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jp-morgan-ceo-jamie-dimon-hypocrite-crypto-criminals-shut-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/jp-morgan-ceo-jamie-dimon-hypocrite-crypto-criminals-shut-down}}}\uc2  that could impact the price, the increasing institutional interest, potential spot \uc2 Ether ETF\uc2  and improved trading volumes are strong indications the bull market has arrived.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvYTYzMzIzMGQtM2Y5YS00NzQ5LThiYWItMDE3YzRiOTQzNWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240111ek1b000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
