\par\par \b \uc2 Are Polygon (MATIC) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) About to Explode? The  \highlight22\uc2 Bullish \highlight\uc2  Buzz Unveiled!\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,233 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 January 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Price Prediction}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Analysis}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Prediction}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The long-awaited event that has captivated the entire cryptocurrency space has finally unfolded. Spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs}}}\uc2  have secured approval in the U.S., marking a significant milestone. The \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  granted approval on Wednesday for the filings from key market players including \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 , \uc2 Fidelity\uc2  and Grayscale. Concurrently, the daily trading volume for Bitcoin (BTC) across cryptocurrency exchanges surged to $52 billion, reaching its highest point since March 21 of the previous year. Unsurprisingly, altcoins received a notable boost, shattering upside barriers. Among the standout performers in this diverse landscape are Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Polygon (MATIC).\par \par \uc2 Capturing significant attention is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ADAMATIC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA)}}}\uc2 , a project distinguished by its diverse ecosystem and user-friendly interface. Its native MANIA tokens are currently sold at an appealing price during the pre-sale phase, presenting a golden chance for those jumping in early to potentially reap rewards.\par \par \uc2 Ride The Wave Of Innovation With ScapesMania\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/01/cardano-ada-and-polygon-matic-navigate-choppy-waters-will-bitcoin-etf-news-propel-them-to-new-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has recently attracted significant attention in the cryptocurrency investment sphere. Its investment products have recently seen inflows of $3.7 million. Furthermore, Cardano's decentralized finance (DeFi) ecosystem has demonstrated steady growth over time, experiencing a notable surge from approximately $50 million in total value locked to an impressive figure exceeding $400 million last year.\par \par \uc2 As of now, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) maintains a live price range of $0.56 to $0.60, accompanied by a remarkable 100% surge in 24-hour trading volume. This surge has propelled the market cap to a nearly 17% increase. The coin demonstrated a modest increase of 8% in a week, and a surge of nearly 150% over the past three months, which proves its strong \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. These figures underscore the growing interest and confidence among investors and traders in \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 From a technical perspective, the indicators predominantly signal a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) stands at 74.01, and the Stochastic %K at 99.30, both leaning towards the overbought zone, suggesting a potential for profit-taking. Conversely, the Momentum at 0.027232 and the MACD Level at 0.019580 provide buy signals, indicating a favorable outlook.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages further support a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance. Currently, the price is above both the 10-day Exponential Moving Average (EMA) at $0.583924 and the 10-day Simple Moving Average (SMA) at $0.583245, suggesting a potential short-term rise. Looking ahead, the longer-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook is reinforced by the 100-day SMA at $0.522493 and the 100-day EMA at $0.535245.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 The current technical analysis of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) presents a generally positive outlook, with most indicators leaning towards a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The recent inflow of funds, coupled with the strong performance of the market and the favorable technical indicators, suggest that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could continue to grow in the near future. The nearest upside target lies at $0.688886. Upon breaking it, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  may continue its ascend to the level of $0.837741 .\par \par \uc2 However, it is important to remain cautious and watch the price performance around the pivot point of $0.540031. As indicated by the \uc2 RSI\uc2  and the Stochastic %K oscillators, the market might be reaching the overbought territory, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may weaken. In such a case, the key support level may be found at $0.442955.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2024/01/whats-the-best-crypto-for-2024-exploring-6-cryptocurrencies-with-high-growth-potential"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC)}}}\uc2  has recently made significant strides in the cryptocurrency market. Its recent partnership with Nomura, a major financial services group, marks a significant milestone. Announced on January 10th, this collaboration involves Nomura using Polygon's institutional WEB3 network for asset tokenization. This partnership underscores Polygon's expanding influence and potential in the financial sector.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, MATIC price is ranging between $0.88 and $0.95, adding almost 11% in a week. This increase propelled Polygon to become the 13th most valuable cryptocurrency, surpassing Chainlink (LINK) with a market cap of $8.55 billion. This rise is attributed to the growing interest in the Polygon Proof-of-Stake (PoS) ecosystem and its strong correlation with Ethereum (ETH).\par \par \uc2 The Relative Strength Index (RSI) is at 65.31, suggesting that the buying momentum is strong but not yet overbought. This indicates that there is still room for price growth. The Momentum at 0.04220305 is giving a sell signal while the MACD Level at 0.026264005 is calling for buy action.\par \par \uc2 The 10-day Exponential Moving Average (EMA) at $0.926301613 and the 10-day Simple Moving Average (SMA) at $0.919784359 are suggesting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the short term. This outlook is also valid for the longer term as the 100-day EMA is at $0.851897755 and the 100-day SMA is at $0.830668879.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 The current technical analysis of Polygon (MATIC) presents a highly positive outlook. The recent price surge, strategic partnership with Nomura, and strong market performance suggest that MATIC could continue to see growth in the near term. The first upside target is seen at $1.140598341, and if broken, the price may surge higher to $1.417451792.\par \par \uc2 However, as with any cryptocurrency investment, market conditions can change rapidly, and investors should be ready for a possible retracement. Investors should be attentive to the immediate support level at $0.694236244 and consider adjusting stop-loss positions accordingly if the price approaches this threshold.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The world of cryptocurrencies is in a state of flux, especially with the approval of a spot ETF in the US after a decade-long wait. This approval led to a significant increase in Bitcoin's daily trading volume and had a major impact on the market. Other cryptocurrencies, like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Polygon (MATIC), are also getting a boost. Cardano is attracting attention with an investment of $3.7 million and growing in its decentralized finance (DeFi) ecosystem. Meanwhile, Polygon's strategic partnership with Nomura and its recent surge underscore its growing influence.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240111ek1b000ma\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/10: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,567 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  decision may turn out to be a sell the news event, but altcoins are showing notable strength.\par \par \uc2 There was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-volatile-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 high drama on Jan. 9}}}\uc2  as the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  tweeted that spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund applications were approved but later said that the SEC\u8217\'20\'19s social account was hacked and that no ETFs had been approved.\par \par \uc2 After the hacked tweet was sent out, Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fake-bitcoin-etf-approval-sell-the-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 quickly surged to about $48,000}}}\uc2  but then gave back the gains and slipped to $46,000 within a few minutes. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-may-fail-btc-price-breakout-48k-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Noting the muted response}}}\uc2 , trading firm QCP Capital said that the approval is \u8220\'20\'1Cmostly priced in and there may not be a huge rally post the approval.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/fa30f0d5-ec01-4602-8f12-2d144a6b77a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the event may boost \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short term, the long-term trend could remain intact. Even if the markets sell-off after one or more spot Bitcoin ETFs are greenlit, the downside is likely to be limited as the long-term investors may view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 What are the crucial support and resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed above the ascending triangle pattern on Jan. 8, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pattern target of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup is $49,178.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ad561fca-f090-4add-b3e2-bfb601016f9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to pull the price back below the breakout level of $44,700 and trap the aggressive bulls. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair may witness long liquidation and drop to the 50-day simple moving average ($42,078). The selling could accelerate below this support, and the pair may dive to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price rebounds off $44,700, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support. That will improve the prospects of a rally to $49,178 and thereafter to $52,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rose sharply from the 50-day SMA ($2,232) on Jan. 9, indicating solid buying at lower levels. The bulls continued their purchase on Jan. 10 and kicked the price above the overhead resistance of $2,400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/826de26c-4ac7-4590-876e-8f7b98ff8d4d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $2,400, it will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The ETH/USDT pair could jump to $2,700 and then toward the psychologically important level of $3,000.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($2,294). That will suggest a range-bound action between $2,100 and $2,400 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls managed to maintain BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($298) on Jan. 8 and 9 but failed to start a meaningful recovery. This suggests a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4f8a462b-0860-42de-a445-a62e72b9aaa8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price closes below the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair may plunge to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $310 to suggest that the selling pressure is slowing down. The pair could then attempt a rally to $327 and later to the high at $338.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the uptrend line on Jan. 8, but the bulls could not overcome the obstacle at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ba31f119-71d7-4c0a-b00b-3e1d5341540f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($96) has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. This suggests that the SOL/USDT pair may remain stuck between the uptrend and downtrend lines for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the selling could worsen, and the pair may plummet to $67. Alternatively, if the price turns up and breaks above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bulls are back in the game. The pair may then rise to $117.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been oscillating around the $0.57 level for some time, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/8a9450a5-4ab0-4be1-badd-0ef55be19cd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.59) is sloping down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is below 38, indicating that bears hold the edge. If the price skids below $0.54, the selling could pick up, and the XRP/USDT pair may plummet to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to propel the price above the moving averages to indicate strength. The short-term trend could tilt in favor of the buyers after the price rises above the downtrend line. The pair may climb to $0.67 and subsequently to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) sharp bounce off the $0.46 support on Jan. 8 stalled near the 20-day EMA ($0.55), signaling that the bears have not given up.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/14013e14-9135-4789-be17-a1573e7c32b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price could slide to the $0.46 support, which remains the key level to watch out for. Buyers are expected to fiercely guard this level because a break below it may intensify selling and sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to $0.37.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.46, the bulls will again try to overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the downtrend line, where the bulls are likely to encounter strong resistance from the bears.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern on Jan. 9, indicating that the bears are trying to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/0dc757d4-283d-4379-afe2-4cc263a1dc1f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The AVAX/USDT pair could drop to $31, an important level to watch out for. If the $31 support cracks, the selling could intensify, and the pair may descend toward the pattern target of $26.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the $31 level with force, it will suggest that the bulls are vigorously protecting this level. That could keep the pair between $31 and $38 for some time. A break and close above $38 will indicate that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etfs-update"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Spot Bitcoin ETFs: A week of high stakes and expectations}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery attempt on Jan. 9 fizzled out near the 20-day EMA ($0.09), indicating that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/650a9752-b7e3-476b-8940-098a9ef94924.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price to the next support at $0.07. This level may attract buyers, but if the bulls fail to clear the hurdle at the 20-day EMA, the likelihood of a drop to $0.06 increases.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The DOGE/USDT pair may then rise to the $0.10 to $0.11 overhead resistance zone.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the 50-day SMA ($6.96) on Jan. 8, but they could not sustain the lower levels, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4b1be2c4-24b5-4f18-a657-83cbeab55221.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor negative is that the bulls could not maintain the tempo and push the price above the 20-day EMA ($7.58). This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance. If the price dips below the $6.50 support, the DOT/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern. The pair may then tumble to $5.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downward move, they will have to drive the price above the $7.90 resistance. That may open the gates for a rally to $8.80.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.73 on Jan. 8, but the recovery is facing selling near the 50-day SMA ($0.85).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c7417bb3-1698-44dd-beff-4cae9eebde31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.87) and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to the bears. If the price turns down from the moving averages, the MATIC/USDT pair may again slump toward the strong support at $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if buyers drive the price above the moving averages, it will suggest solid demand at lower levels. The pair may then attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $1, which may prove to be a difficult hurdle to cross.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvY2ExMzY4NzQtNDgzOS00ODU0LWIxMDctZjBlNTcyYTQzNmRiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240110ek1a000e4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
