c2  and \uc2 MasterCard\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Stellar's (XLM) market performance shows a promising trend despite some short-term setbacks. Over the past year, it has seen a 43.26% increase, indicating a strong recovery potential. The current market capitalization of $3.215 billion and a 24-hour trading volume of $110.221 million reflect active market participation. Stellar\u8217\'20\'19s technical analysis reveals significant support at $0.0773 and resistance at $0.1629, suggesting potential for price movements within these ranges.\par \par \uc2 Fantom's Sonic Leap: Enhancing Blockchain Efficiency and Poential\par \par \uc2 The Fantom H2 2023 Overview report from Reflexivity Research delves into the significant advancements of the Fantom network, particularly focusing on the Sonic upgrade. This upgrade is expected to enhance transaction processing speed, efficiency, and scale, potentially achieving over 2,000 transactions per second (TPS). The improvements, including the Fantom Virtual Machine (FVM) and Carmen data storage solution, aim to bolster Fantom's capabilities in decentralized finance (DeFi), blockchain gaming, and other high-frequency applications.\par \par \uc2 Considering {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/news-in-crypto/newsbtc:will-fantom-network-activity-give-ftm-price-a-shot-in-the-arm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fantom's}}}\uc2  market data, its performance over the past year shows a promising 56.29% increase, reflecting a positive trend. With a current market capitalization of $1.038 billion and a 24-hour trading volume of $89.281 million, Fantom displays robust market activity. Technical analysis suggests significant pivot points, with support levels starting at $0.1381 and resistance up to $0.7124. These developments, coupled with the potential improvements from the Sonic upgrade, suggest that Fantom could be a worthwhile investment, offering the possibility of significant growth and expansion in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Closing Thoughts\par \par \uc2 Wrapping up this crypto rollercoaster, we've dived into the twists and turns of the market, from the SEC's tweet turmoil stirring Bitcoin, to the steady rise of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) with a 59.31% yearly increase and a $30.152 billion market cap. Stellar (XLM) is not just star-gazing; it's ISO 20022 compliant, ready to shake up financial systems, showing a stellar 43.26% yearly growth with a $3.215 billion market cap. And Fantom is not just a phantom in the crypto world, with the Sonic upgrade on the horizon and a notable 56.29% annual increase, its $1.038 billion market cap is just the beginning.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240110ek1a001gt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
