\par\par \b \uc2 Altcoin Shakeout: Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) And \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Witness 10% Plunge, Pullix (PLX) Presale Resilient in the Face of Downturn\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 683 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 January 2024\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2024, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano's Trading Volume Soars, Hints At \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  Price Rally}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Presale Shows Resilience in the Face of Downturn}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Final Thoughts}}}\par \par \uc2 The altcoin market faced a major pullback after weeks of trending upwards. The top altcoins, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), experienced drops of more than 10%.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Pullix (PLX) showed remarkable resilience in the face of the downtrend. Now the downtrend looks to be over, what's next for these cryptocurrencies?\par \par \uc2 Cardano's Trading Volume Soars, Hints At \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  Price Rally\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) was one of the worst-hit altcoins in the recent market crash. The price of Cardano fell from $0.64 to as low as $0.53 on the daily charge. However, after finding support from this level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price has increased back to $0.55 per coin.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, there are more positive signs for the Cardano coin. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/currencies/ADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 trading volume}}}\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  surged by 49.07% to $631.41 million in 24 hours. A surge in trading volume is often a hint at a potential price surge. Technical indicators have also hinted at a potential price surge.\par \par \uc2 Cardano is at a critical level and would need to break above the resistance zones at $0.60 and $0.67, according to Crypto analyst LuckSide. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cryptorecruitr/status/1740400400984052176"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dan Gambriello has highlighted}}}\uc2  that the Cardanois attempting a symmetrical triangle breakout, which could see \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit $0.80.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Drops Almost 20%, But There's An Upside\par \par \uc2 Among the top altcoins, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) suffered one of the largest losses. During the altcoin market collapse, the price of the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  coin fell by about 20%. The price of XRP plunged to as low as $0.500 as a result of the flash crash.\par \par \uc2 While this is a significant drop, it also represents an opportunity for XRP. The \uc2 Ripple\uc2  coin has now retested a key support level. At this level, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  has created a triple bottom. This is a big \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend that could lead to an increase in the price of XRP.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's Relative Strength Index (RSI) is presently heading north, confirming the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  push. XRP has now reached $0.580. If the price of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  rises beyond the psychological level of $0.600, a 20% increase is possible.\par \par \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Presale Shows Resilience in the Face of Downturn\par \par \uc2 Amidst the downturn in the altcoin market, the Pullix (PLX) presale remained resilient. While other altcoins in the DeFi market plunged, the price of PLX continued to increase, reaching $0.08 in December. Pullix has been on the rise because of the great innovation it brings to the DeFi market.\par \par \uc2 With features from both DEXs and CEXs, Pullix is a hybrid exchange platform that focuses on the community. Pullix offers advantages over traditional exchanges in terms of speed, cost, efficiency, and security because of its hybrid architecture.\par \par \uc2 The fact that this exchange provides access to the international financial market is yet another fantastic aspect. Users can trade FX, ETFs, commodities, and cryptocurrencies on the Pullixplatform. Advanced AI tools have also been integrated into the exchange. By using these tools, users may study markets and make more informed trading decisions.\par \par \uc2 Pullix is among the best cryptos available because of its relationship to the currency market, which opens up access to a market valued at over $632 trillion. Pullix will benefit greatly from this enormous liquidity, but PLX also stands to gain greatly.\par \par \uc2 Final Thoughts\par \par \uc2 The recent altcoin shakeout, marked by a 10% plunge in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), underscores the rising Pullix. While it now trades at $0.08, analysts have forecasted a potential surge of 50x in 2024, making PLX one of the best cryptos to buy.\par \par \uc2 For more information regarding Pullix\u8217\'20\'19s presale see links below:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pr.pullix.io/11ta4i"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Visit Pullix}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/pullix"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The Pullix Communities}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240109ek19000rv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
