tplace that aims to facilitate direct connections between buyers and sellers while eliminating the need for central authority. Pushd has entered its second presale stage after successfully concluding the first one, boasting over 8,000 sign-ups and reflecting investors' keen interest in its innovative features. The platform prioritizes user-friendliness with streamlined registration, enhancing privacy in response to everyday challenges on traditional online marketplaces.\par \par \uc2 Since Pushd will be the first decentralized platform in the e-commerce sector, it will offer several advantages to traders by eliminating high fees, verification hurdles, and fund release delays. Pushd will be able to accomplish all of it since it utilizes blockchain technology for secure, transparent, and immutable transactions. In the context of the global ecommerce sector's projected $6 trillion milestone, Pushddistinguishes itself with a comprehensive ecosystem featuring a debit card, early investor incentives, cryptocurrency swap services, user rewards, and participatory governance. Pushd is priced modestly at $0.048 in stage two of the presale. Hence, investors have a compelling opportunity to become part of a project that is anticipated to rise by 25X or even 100X in the 2024 \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 For more information about the Pushd (PUSHD) Presale, visit their website.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240106ek16000p1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/5: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,547 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to surge following the verdict on the spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  applications.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  has increased in the past two days as traders speculate about the fate of the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) applications. Some analysts said that the ETFs could be greenlighted as early as Jan. 5, but Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart is standing by his belief that an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rumor-mill-heats-hopes-spot-bitcoin-etf-approval-tomorrow"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approval is most likely to happen}}}\uc2  between Jan. 8 and 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/8375a6ef-357b-4487-8e01-642312c4b399.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 A few analysts believe that in a classic case of buy the rumor, sell the news, Bitcoin may fall even if one or more Bitcoin ETFs are approved. But \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2 , creator of the Bollinger Bands \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator, thinks otherwise. In a post on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/march-banking-crisis-rerun-risks-40-bitcoin-price-crash-arthur-hayes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bollinger said he expects}}}\uc2  Bitcoin to \u8220\'20\'1Cbreak higher.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important resistance levels to watch out for in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin climbed back into the ascending triangle pattern on Jan. 3, suggesting that the sharp fall to the 50-day simple moving average ($41,205) may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/0c521ab1-9d3a-4547-8821-c611b425edd1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position by shoving the price above the $44,700 resistance. If they do that, the BTC/USDT pair will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could start a rally to the overhead resistance zone between $50,000 and $52,000.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside move, they will have to drag the price back below the triangle. There is a minor support at $40,000, but if the price skids below this level, the decline could extend to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tried to rise above the 20-day exponential moving average ($2,269) on Jan. 4, but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c614aedf-9ee3-4953-a7eb-b90a567a4e56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the near term. If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could jump to $2,400. A break and close above this resistance could clear the path for a potential rally to $2,700 and then to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is the 50-day SMA and then $2,100. If the supports break down, the pair may drop to $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in an uptrend for the past few days. Barring the sharp intraday dip on Jan. 3, the bulls have managed to keep the price above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $300.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1a4f6f8a-c2a8-4c98-a382-2800da8482ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($295) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the bulls are in control. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will try to kick the BNB/USDT pair to the overhead resistance at $338. If this obstacle is overcome, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $370 and then to $400.\par \par \uc2 A slight negative in favor of the bears is that the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is forming a negative divergence, which indicates a weakening momentum. If the 20-day EMA cracks, the pair may dive to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 20-day EMA ($97) on Jan. 3, but the bears could not achieve a close below it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/52d2ccd5-b864-4160-8e12-d3068be7c124.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to start a relief rally on Jan. 4, but the bears did not relent. The price has again declined to the 20-day EMA, which remains the key short-term level to keep an eye on. If the price closes below the 20-day EMA, the selling could pick up momentum, and the SOL/USDT pair may plunge to the 50-day SMA ($77).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the downtrend line, it will signal that the correction may have ended. The pair could then retest the high at $126.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls did not allow XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) to close below $0.57 on Jan. 3 and are again trying to protect the level on Jan. 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/72d04e21-d232-4902-bd4d-3020079cac51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.61) has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, indicating an advantage to the bears. A bounce off the current level is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the XRP/USDT pair continues lower or turns down from the overhead resistance, it will increase the likelihood of a close below $0.57. That could start a downward move toward $0.50 and then to $0.46. The bulls will have to kick the price above the downtrend line to negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle pattern on Jan. 4, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/659bba17-2d90-4f9a-b206-a66121a61584.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will make one more attempt to sink the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.51). If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to the breakout level of $0.46. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns up and breaks above $0.64. Such a move will suggest aggressive buying at lower levels. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the neckline of the head-and-shoulders pattern on Jan. 4, but they could not overcome the barrier at the 20-day EMA ($39.44).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/ea2f53bf-90fe-4425-9fce-609cba3f7362.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is $36. If this level is taken out, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($32.70). Buyers are expected to vigorously defend the zone between the 50-day SMA and $31.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to signal that the correction may be over. The pair could then rise to $44; if this level is scaled, the pair may ascend to $50.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-much-is-bitcoin-worth-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How much is Bitcoin worth today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) closed above $0.08 on Jan. 3, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. The bulls are maintaining the price above $0.08 but are struggling to start a strong relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/a2b5b3e0-2aa5-414a-8ce4-e9132584cd12.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the negative territory, indicating that the sellers have the upper hand. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($0.09), the bears will attempt to tug the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the moving averages. That will open the doors for a rise to $0.10. The zone between $0.10 and $0.11 is likely to act as a major hurdle for the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) recovery faces selling at the 20-day EMA ($7.90), indicating that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/32680fc1-0968-45a0-b06f-40f6fc7809d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  just below the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The DOT/USDT pair may swing between $6.50 on the downside and $8.80 on the upside.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above $8.80, it will signal that the corrective phase may be over. The pair may then climb to the overhead resistance of $9.59. Contrarily, a drop below $6.50 could start a deeper correction to $5.89.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) took support at the 50-day SMA ($0.85) on Jan. 3, but the bulls failed to push the price above the $0.89 resistance on Jan. 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/98addddb-3ea7-4c2e-873c-3aa40c319820.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears and the bulls are witnessing a tough battle near the 50-day SMA. If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the selling could pick up further, and the MATIC/USDT pair could plummet toward $0.70.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the 50-day SMA holds, the bulls will try to use it as a launchpad and propel the pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.90). If they do that, the pair may start a northward march toward $1.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvZjQ5ZjE1OTAtMzg0OS00MmI4LTljYjYtNzE1YjBiODU5OTAzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240106ek1500004\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
