t and the broader crypto ecosystem could influence its price path. For Polygon (MATIC), staying nimble in the ever-evolving market is vital for its future price.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM): Exploring the Prospects of Interoperability\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) has seen significant price appreciation in recent months, buoyed by the broader bitcoin and altcoin bull market. As the foundational engine for numerous blockchains, Cosmos (ATOM) is benefiting from the successes of its subsidiaries, most notably Osmosis (OSMO), which has seen a notable increase in token value.\par \par \uc2 If Cosmos (ATOM) continues on its current path, the price forecast for 2024 is optimistic. The estimated annual low for Cosmos (ATOM) in 2024 is around $9.93, with a potential high of up to $15.05. Market insiders are betting on Cosmos (ATOM) to rise thanks to a wave of optimism and its cutting-edge technology.\par \par \uc2 Cosmos (ATOM) is betting on its knack for smooth interchain trades and increasing the strength of its system to push its value towards the $13.50 mark soon. However, like all cryptocurrencies, its trajectory will be shaped by market forces and regulatory developments.\par \par \uc2 Sei (SEI): Evaluating Recent Trends and Future Outlook\par \par \uc2 Sei (SEI) has undergone a notable price reversal, with its value experiencing significant fluctuations. Recently, Sei (SEI) has been on a rollercoaster ride, hitting record highs and plunging to sharp lows, really putting the crypto market's wild unpredictability on full display. Amidst the crypto rollercoaster, Sei (SEI) stands out for its innovative traits and strong prospects in the trading game.\par \par \uc2 Should the current trend continue, Sei (SEI) is expected to range between $0.361347 and $0.554751 in 2024, suggesting an upward trend and reflecting optimism about its recent technological developments.\par \par \uc2 The long-term outlook for Sei (SEI) is promising, with predictions pointing to a potential high of $1.8 by 2030. But to hit that mark by 2030, we've got to steer through the current downturn and really capitalize on the network's wins and its growing popularity. Reaching this goal will require skillful management of market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and smart leveraging of the network's growing success.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Looking ahead to 2024, it is clear that a handful of major cryptos are set to lead the charge, transforming how we think about digital currency. Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC), Cosmos (ATOM), and Sei (SEI) will be at the forefront of this evolution. \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is picking up speed and its lightning-fast transactions are positioning it as a key player in the future of the market. With a solid lineup of technical innovations and an uptick in invested funds, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is seriously increasing its presence in the DeFi arena. Polygon (MATIC) is establishing itself in the multi-chain world. Cosmos (ATOM) is also poised for growth, benefiting from the general market upswing and its integral role in powering various blockchains. Although Sei (SEI) has seen some wild swings in value, it is attracting attention for its distinctive features and solid prospects in the trading sphere.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240104ek14000gp\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/3: BTC, ETH, BNB, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,588 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The euphoric crypto market uptrend came to an abrupt halt as a report shook traders' confidence. Is it time to buy the dip?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) led the cryptocurrency markets lower on Jan. 3, indicating the market\u8217\'20\'19s nervousness about the fate of the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) applications. One of the reasons being talked about is the \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  denial report by the crypto financial services platform Matrixport.\par \par \uc2 However, it is prudent to note that the report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-denial-report-did-not-cause-btc-price-crash-analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fails to provide hard evidence}}}\uc2  on why the ETFs will be rejected. In contrast, Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-rejected-possibility-bloomberg-etf-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 maintained a 90% approval odds}}}\uc2  of the ETFs by Jan. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1e2e7ed5-778f-456c-ab9f-61b3cc69dd4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the fall cools down the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment in the short term, it does not alter the prevailing trend. Market observers will keep a close eye on the regulator, and any positive news on the approvals of the Bitcoin ETFs could cause a sharp reversal to the upside.\par \par \uc2 What important support levels may arrest the decline in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the overhead resistance of $44,700 on Jan. 2, but the breakout proved to be a bull trap as the price plunged on Jan. 3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c751de1b-fc29-4827-8f5e-6e70b7ec6153.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers purchased the dip to the 50-day simple moving average ($40,938), indicating that the bulls are vigorously defending the $40,000 level. The flattening 20-day exponential moving average ($42,855) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. The boundaries of the range could be $40,000 and $45,879.\par \par \uc2 If the price plummets below the $40,000 support, it will suggest that the bulls have given up in the short term. That may sink the BTC/USDT pair to the next major support at $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will be back in command after they thrust the price above $45,879. The pair may then surge to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to kick Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the $2,445 resistance on Jan. 2, but the long wick on the candlestick shows selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4f989c6a-d1c9-40e1-8e3e-5a93d4c7662b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply on Jan. 3 and plunged below the moving averages. A minor positive is that the buyers purchased the dip at $2,100 and are trying to hold the price above $2,200.\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days suggests that the ETH/USDT pair may oscillate between $2,100 and $2,400 for a while longer. The bears will have to sink the price below $2,100 to start a deeper correction to $1,900. On the upside, a rise above $2,445 could open the doors for a rally to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rally from the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $309, but the bears sold aggressively and pulled the price near the 61.8% retracement level of $290.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/fbe345f7-9f95-4dfa-9904-dad54db507b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long wick and the long tail on the Jan. 3 candlestick show indecision among the bulls and the bears. The 20-day EMA ($290) remains the essential level to watch out for because a break below it may result in a retest of the neckline.\par \par \uc2 A slight advantage to the bulls is that the 20-day EMA is sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  remains in positive territory. If buyers keep the price above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could climb to the overhead resistance of $338.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled at $117 on Jan. 2, indicating that traders are selling on rallies toward the overhead resistance of $126.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/365635d4-665b-4fc2-8175-d1c1e5739ce3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling accelerated on Jan. 3, and the bears yanked the price below the 20-day EMA ($96). If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could fall to the 50-day SMA ($76).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price maintains above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate solid demand at lower levels. That may start a rally back toward the $117 to $126 resistance zone, where the bears are expected to pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been forming a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a close below $0.57.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/9c544188-2fab-4d34-8011-abe4ad8fcb36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears dragged the price below $0.57 on Jan. 3, but the bulls aggressively bought the dip, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. If the price rises back above $0.57, the bulls will try to start a recovery toward the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price sustains below $0.57, it will signal the completion of the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. The XRP/USDT pair could then nosedive to $0.46 and eventually to the pivotal support at $0.41.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers failed to sustain the breakout above the symmetrical triangle pattern in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) on Jan. 2, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/1980732b-1d77-4d7c-8641-7eef101294b6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on Jan. 3, and the bears pulled the price below the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair dropped to the 50-day SMA ($0.50), but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery attempt is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.59). If the price turns down from this level, it will indicate a change in sentiment from buying on dips to selling on rallies. That may put the 50-day SMA at the risk of a breakdown. If this level gives way, the pair may fall to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a rally above $0.64 will improve the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) recovery fizzled out at $43.44 on Jan. 2, indicating that the bears are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/24abfba8-3302-4489-9e5e-5b5a699ec9ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling accelerated on Jan. 3, and the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair tumbled below the $38 support. This move completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern, signaling the start of a corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 There is strong support at $31, but if this support is taken out, the pair may drop to the pattern target of $26. This negative view will be invalidated in the near term if the price climbs back above $44.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-products-2-2-billion-total-inflows-2023-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto investment products saw $2.2B total inflows in 2023 \u8212\'20\'14 CoinShares}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) support at the 50-day SMA ($0.09) snapped on Jan. 3, indicating that the consolidation resolved in favor of the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/212585d6-4cbe-4be3-9ca4-59391895877f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to start a relief rally, but their attempts are likely to face strong selling at the 20-day EMA ($0.09). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could descend to $0.07. This level is likely to attract buyers, but if the bears prevail, the pair may fall to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and maintain the price above the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone to signal the start of the next leg of the uptrend to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the strong support at $7.90 on Jan. 1, but the higher levels could not be maintained.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/8a27cd0c-fe1a-44b8-a37b-3eb60e249e51.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price reversed direction on Jan. 3 and broke below the formidable support at $7.90. That intensified selling, and the DOT/USDT pair collapsed to $6.50. However, the bulls aggressively bought this dip, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($7.94) is likely to act as a strong resistance on the way up, but if this level is scaled, the pair could jump to $8.80. Contrarily, if the price remains below the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a retest of $6.50 increases.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rose above the overhead resistance at $1 on Jan. 1, but the bulls could not build upon the breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/84eebf2b-be2a-40cc-833c-05df2c5fd76a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price turned down and broke below $1 on Jan. 2. The MATIC/USDT pair witnessed a massive fall on Jan. 3, plunging to $0.74. This sharp decline suggests that the pair remains range-bound between $0.75 and $1 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price back above the 20-day EMA ($0.91) to reduce the selling pressure. That could result in a rally to $1. On the other hand, if the price stays below the 50-day SMA ($0.85), the pair could slide to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvMmM4NDRjZGUtOTI1Ni00ZTFjLTlhMTUtYTYyNTA0MDFiMTljLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240103ek13000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
