trend and the possibility of reaching new heights are backed by technical indicators. However, it's crucial to note that a rejection at the $5.5 resistance level could lead to a significant decline in price.\par \par \uc2 Sui (SUI): Pioneering NFT Integration with Red Bull Formula 1\par \par \uc2 Sui (SUI) has garnered considerable attention with the launch of an NFT collection in collaboration with the Red Bull Formula 1 team. This partnership has resulted in an exclusive NFT that celebrates the team's outstanding performance during the 2023 Formula 1 season. By launching this exclusive NFT, Sui (SUI) not only celebrates \uc2 Red Bull Racing\uc2 's stellar season but also carves out a significant niche for itself in the competitive crypto landscape.\par \par \uc2 If Sui (SUI) continues to follow current trends, the price prediction for 2024 suggests a potential range with a yearly low around $0.794286 and a high near $1.393010. So, the project\u8217\'20\'19s savvy strategies and fresh partnerships could send its price soaring, but let's not forget that market swings are still a big problem in this game.\par \par \uc2 The collaboration with Red Bull Formula 1 and the subsequent NFT release on the Sui (SUI) blockchain are positive indicators for the future price direction of Sui (SUI). Sure, \uc2 Red Bull Racing\uc2 's dive into NFTs on the Sui blockchain is a big thumbs-up for its potential growth, but let's not forget how unpredictable the NFT game can be and just how packed the blockchain arena is\u8212\'20\'14factors that could definitely shake up Sui\u8217\'20\'19s price and standing in the market.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As the crypto market evolves in 2024, marked by significant developments like the first spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  and the Bitcoin halving event, investors are turning their attention to emerging cryptocurrencies. Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Maverick Protocol (MAV), Sui (SUI), and Render (RNDR) stand out as promising options. These cryptos, each with unique strengths and market positions, are poised to benefit from the broader market dynamics and increased institutional interest.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) shows promise with its recovery and market strength, while Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is revolutionizing the DeFi space with significant growth in TVL. Maverick Protocol (MAV) is making strides in the DEX sector, and Render (RNDR) is reaching new milestones with its impressive price surge. Sui (SUI) is pioneering in NFT integration, partnering with high-profile brands like Red Bull Formula 1.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020240101ek11000rt\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 1/1: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,706 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 January 2024\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2024. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Risk appetite remains strong, but Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s continuation of the rally will depend heavily on the outcome of the spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  applications.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets continued their strong performance last week. According to Bespoke, the S&P 500 Index (SPX) and the Nasdaq 100 have risen for nine consecutive weeks, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/stocks/stock-market-winning-streak-best-since-1985-sp500-nasdaq-2023-12"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 best}}}\uc2  performance in unison since 1985 when they had an 11-week win streak. In 2023, the SPX ended with more than 24% gains, indicating that bulls remain firmly in command.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, the U. S. dollar index (DXY) fell about 2% in 2023, its first yearly loss since 2020. Slowing inflation and the forecast of a 75 basis point rate cut by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  in 2024 have kept the dollar index under pressure.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/e7325ecf-a7db-4283-af00-7f3dc31f5569.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The increasing risk appetite of investors and a host of crypto-specific positives boosted Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) by 155% in 2023. In the near future, two events {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/countdown-us-spot-etf-5-things-to-know-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hold the key to continuing Bitcoin's rally}}}\uc2 . First will be the regulator\u8217\'20\'19s ruling on the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund applications expected in the next few days, and the second will be Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving in April.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins correct in the near term or resume their up move? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index remains in a strong uptrend but witnessed profit-booking at 4,793. Although the trend remains up, the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is in the early stages of forming a negative divergence. This suggests weakening momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4dee5233-0c41-4fd1-8c81-b457e4cf53e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to tug the price to the 20-day exponential moving average (4,690), which remains the key short-term level to watch out for. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will improve the prospects of a rally above 4,793. The index may then attempt a rally to the psychologically important level of 5,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls are closing their positions in a hurry. That could start a pullback to 4,650 and then to the 50-day simple moving average (4,502).\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index has been trading inside a wide range between 101 and 108 for several months. The price reached the support on Dec. 27, where the buyers stepped in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/69570f09-2d5b-472d-9ee8-ffe63a59c541.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Any bounce from the current level is expected to face solid resistance at the 20-day EMA (102.26). If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below 101. The index may then collapse to 99.57.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers shove the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The index may then rise to the 50-day SMA (103.88). Such a move will indicate that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has fallen to the support line of the ascending triangle pattern, an important level for the bulls to defend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/7f2f9a09-b0a0-46cb-8886-8bb3d14440e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA ($42,484), the BTC/USDT pair could climb to the overhead resistance at $44,700. This level may attract strong selling by the bears, but if the buyers prevail, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern. This setup has a target objective of $49,178.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the triangle, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair could then tumble to $40,000. This level may act as a strong support, but if broken, the decline may extend to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $2,446 on Dec. 28 and re-entered the descending channel on Dec. 29. This suggests that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/2ff00ab2-6fbc-480c-99f2-2833b35355dd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to dip below the 20-day EMA ($2,270). However, the selling pressure may increase further if buyers do not push the price back above the channel within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 If the 20-day EMA cracks, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($2,177) and then to the support line of the channel near $2,000.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the channel will suggest that the bulls have not given up. Buyers will again try to propel the price above $2,446 and start the next leg of the uptrend toward $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a correction in an uptrend. The bulls are trying to arrest the pullback in the zone between the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $309 and the 50% retracement level of $300.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/3d2782b8-d687-464d-8cd3-c64fe68e3ab1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will try to resume the uptrend. The BNB/USDT pair may rise to $326, where the bulls are likely to encounter strong selling by the bears. If buyers bulldoze their way through the barrier, the pair could soar to $338 and eventually to $350.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price plunges below $300, the pair could weaken to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $291 and then to the neckline.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering near the moving averages for the past few days, indicating a lack of aggressive buying or selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/c1a7a1ae-8050-4fc1-a94a-5c7399de284f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $0.60. If the price rebounds off this level, the XRP/USDT pair may again try to rise above the downtrend line. If that happens, it will suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. The pair may then attempt a rally to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price skids below $0.60, the pair could plummet to the vital support at $0.56. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls because a break below it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The pair may then dive to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading above the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $96.68 for the past few days, but the bulls have failed to resume the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/27340c6d-bafa-4a47-b590-c295a42ed96c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $110. That could open the doors for a retest of the high at $126. If this level is conquered, the SOL/USDT pair may pick up momentum and climb to $156.\par \par \uc2 The critical support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($95). If this level holds, the pair may swing between the 20-day EMA and $110 for a few days. A break and close below the 20-day EMA could indicate the start of a sharper pullback to the 50-day SMA ($74).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-launch-let-down-but-attract-trillions-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETF launch may be a \u8216\'20\'18let down\u8217\'20\'19 but could attract trillions over time}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/4a55a584-ff9e-4d36-abe0-c317d076c772.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the symmetrical triangle usually acts as a continuation pattern, it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout with certainty. Hence, waiting for the breakout to happen is better before taking directional bets.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the support line and rises above the triangle, it will indicate an advantage to buyers. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may rise to $0.68 and subsequently to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a slide below the triangle will indicate that bears are in control. That may start a fall to $0.51.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been successfully defending the $38 support, but they have failed to sustain Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($40)\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/7e5a96b2-35d2-4ab2-9ddc-9359bc9cfbb0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears. If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $45 and thereafter to the recent high at $50.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down and breaks below $38, it will signal that bears are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. That could intensify selling, and the pair may drop to $34 and later to the 50-day SMA ($31.13).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.09) resolved to the downside, and the price reached the 50-day SMA ($0.09) on Dec. 31.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2024-01/a7925cc3-1b25-4780-830f-8d9b3365ead8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The solid rebound off the 50-day SMA on Jan. 1 shows that the bulls are fiercely protecting the level. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could reach $0.10. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense of this level.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may remain stuck between $0.10 and the 50-day SMA for some more time. The bears will come out on top if they sink the pair below the 50-day SMA. That could start a downward move to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjQtMDEvM2U5ZjQ3N2EtMmNmMS00YTkxLThiZjAtZDBmZDg5MTZiMWE1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240101ek11000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
