um. Sei's (SEI) latest revamp is set to seriously cut down on dev stress and boost the number of transactions, with aims to reach an impressive 12,500 per second. The network\u8217\'20\'19s knack for innovation and its growing appeal to devs is a solid bet for its future wins in the blockchain game, thanks to staying sharp on tech and tuning into what the market wants.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto world stands at a crossroads, buzzing with hope yet edged by wariness. With Bitcoin (BTC) facing potential sell-offs and a shift in \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the spotlight turns to altcoins, particularly Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Chainlink (LINK), Algorand (ALGO), and Sei (SEI). Amid Bitcoin's potential downturn, altcoins like Cardano, Chainlink, and Algorand are gearing up to thrive in a market brimming with opportunity. These digital contenders are well-positioned to make some serious waves as the altcoin market is on the cusp of breaking into the trillion-dollar territory.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is making significant strides in the DeFi space, Chainlink (LINK) is enhancing its oracle services, Algorand (ALGO) is expanding its global reach, and Sei (SEI) is innovating for speed and efficiency. These networks are focused on innovation and user experience which makes them strong contenders to lead the crypto scene in the future.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231231ejcv000dy\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 These 3 coins came back from the dead in 2023\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 1,133 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 In 2023, \uc2 Solana\uc2 , Avalanche and Tron recovered more than half of their valuations after plunging over 90% during the bear market.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market underwent a substantial recovery in 2023, with the top cryptocurrency, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), leading the market with 160% year-to-date (YTD) gains.\par \par \uc2 This rising tide lifted many altcoins as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/5-data-points-suggest-crypto-bull-market-began-in-2023-what-s-next-for-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the bull market took off}}}\uc2 , with several experiencing substantial gains. Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a closer look at the biggest price rebounds of 2023.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  stages big comeback\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) made the biggest comeback of 2023, rising nearly 1,215% from its cycle low of $8.27 in December 2022. Additionally, it\u8217\'20\'19s up 485% versus Bitcoin from its cycle low of 0.00004952 BTC on June 5.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ab87957b-d35b-405f-a944-2b90594433e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD daily price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  price had fallen 95% in 2022, one of the biggest losers that year, to under $10, primarily due to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-ceo-says-ftx-fallout-hurt-ecosystem-startups"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 its FTX exposure}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s rise in 2023 can be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-hits-2023-high-whats-behind-the-sol-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-hits-2023-high-whats-behind-the-sol-rally}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-hits-2023-high-whats-behind-the-sol-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 attributed to its resilience}}}\uc2  amid \uc2 FTX\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s bankruptcy asset sales, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-state-of-solana-will-the-layer-1-protocol-rise-again-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-state-of-solana-will-the-layer-1-protocol-rise-again-in-2023}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-state-of-solana-will-the-layer-1-protocol-rise-again-in-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 significant decentralized application usage}}}\uc2  growth, increased market demand and network activity and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-uptime-improves-with-one-outage-this-year"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 better network stability}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-sol-market-cap-flips-xrp-what-is-behind-the-price-surge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emphasis on mobile accessibility}}}\uc2  and efficient transaction capabilities also attracted new users and developers, bolstering its market position and adoption.\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price chart technicals are painting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for the beginning of 2024, however.\par \par \uc2 Notably, \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s weekly relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) remains above 70, thus increasing its potential to undergo a pullback in the coming weeks. In addition, the \uc2 SOL\uc2  sell-off scenario rises as it struggles to close above its 0.5 Fibonacci retracement line near $132.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/f8e31348-60e5-4b7a-a485-c52671a73dc2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The $132 resistance level was instrumental in limiting \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s upside attempts in March 2022, which led to a 94% price crash afterward. \uc2 SOL\uc2  risks a similar pullback in the first half of 2024, with its primary downside target sitting at its multiyear ascending trendline support (around $40).\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the second half of the year may resume the uptrend for \uc2 SOL\uc2  after testing the ascending trendline support. Then, a climb to its previous record high of around $265 could be on the table by the year\u8217\'20\'19s end.\par \par \uc2 Tron up 1,270% since Covid-19 crash\par \par \uc2 Tron ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tron-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TRX}}}\uc2  ) crashed over 98% during the crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s 2018\u8211\'20\'132020 bear cycle. However, TRX/USD is now up over 1,270% since bottoming out near $0.0076 in March 2020, including a 100% rally in 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5871f970-53d8-4b8d-ab6d-f664f0293308.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TRX/USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Tron\u8217\'20\'19s price gains coincide with its strong performance in the decentralized finance (DeFi) sector. Notably, the total value locked (TVL) across the Tron ecosystem has increased from nearly 30 million TRX in April 2020 to over 76 billion TRX (~$8 billion) as of December 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/22a8af1b-796d-4f84-b8db-3deb47c6842c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tron TVL performance chart. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 In addition, Tron has engaged in token-burning activities, thus reducing its active supply against a rising TVL, which should push up the price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24TRX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $TRX}}}\uc2  supply is been decreased since a year and a half now , due to daily burning from transactions\par \par \uc2 Yo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/justinsuntron?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @justinsuntron}}}\uc2  if you can convince {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/trondao?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @trondao}}}\uc2  to burn their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24TRX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $TRX}}}\uc2  reserves , none that only will be a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  thing for tron but also will show how committed we are\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Y8dtxY8o1D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Y8dtxY8o1D}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Dona.inj (@CryptoDona7) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoDona7/status/1738728885783585080?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 24, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Tron has also become the biggest blockchain for stablecoin Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ), which has seen its market cap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-issues-4-billion-usdt-4-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rise in 2023}}}\uc2  as well. Today, more than 50% of all USDT, or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tether.to/en/transparency/#usdt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nearly $49 billion}}}\uc2 , exists on the Tron blockchain.\par \par \uc2 TRX price outlook for 2024\par \par \uc2 On larger-timeframe charts, Tron appears to be reaching the apex of its giant triangle price range. Therefore, the first quarter of 2024 will likely witness TRX\u8217\'20\'19s price fluctuating between the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s upper trendline (~$0.108) and its lower trendline (~$0.095).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4f906f84-8ca7-4f6b-b3d1-83469d5dd5bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TRX/USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, like all cryptocurrencies, Tron\u8217\'20\'19s price trends for the remainder of 2024 will largely depend on broader factors, such as a spot {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etfs-600-billion-tipping-point-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin exchange-traded fund approval}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s halving in April and the global economy in general.\par \par \uc2 The $0.20 target may come within reach by 2024 if TRX decisively closes above the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s upper trendline on the weekly chart.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break below the triangle\u8217\'20\'19s lower trendline risks crashing TRX\u8217\'20\'19s price toward $0.056, a level coinciding with the 0.236 Fibonacci line and the 200-week exponential moving average (200-week EMA; the blue wave).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price up 370%\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) price is up nearly 370% when measured from its cycle low of $8.65 in September 2023. Its rebound comes after a 94.25% crash, one of the biggest during the bear market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/b36b2892-0246-4549-a8f9-eb1ecbe065b1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s rebound came around the unlocking of nearly 19 million AVAX tokens in the second half of 2023. The rising prices indicate that markets easily absorbed the additional supply.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s network metrics show weaker underlying demand. For instance, the TVL across the Avalanche ecosystem has dropped to around 23 million \uc2 AVAX\uc2  in December versus about 55 million AVAX in September, when its price rally started.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/575cc735-0046-4925-aefa-e6b775f0aad3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche TVL performance chart. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2  price outlook for 2024\par \par \uc2 The weakness in \uc2 AVAX\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s uptrend is visible in the growing divergence between its rising prices and declining volumes.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-ada-solana-sol-and-polkadot-dot-soar-is-it-altseason"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ), Solana (SOL) and Polkadot (DOT) soar \u8212\'20\'14 Is it altseason?}}}\par \par \uc2 The rise in price without significant trading volume suggests a lack of strong conviction behind the price movement. It can mean that fewer traders are participating in the market, and those who are may not be fully confident in the sustainability of the price rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/568632db-f7a4-468a-a318-bf27761238dc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USD weekly price chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 As of Dec. 29, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s price has stalled at its 0.618 Fib line near $50.50 as resistance. A correction appears to be already underway toward the next Fib line of $29.50, which may play out in Q1, 2024.\par \par \uc2 A further decline below $29.50 could have \uc2 AVAX\uc2  drop to its 50-week EMA near $20.16 as the next \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  target.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvNGI1YmRjNWItZDVjYS00MGQ4LWI0YzktMjYyYzMwM2VlZDliLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231230ejcu0002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,629 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action has shifted action to altcoins, which are witnessing buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding its yearly gains}}}\uc2  but is finding it difficult to break above its 17-month highs of $44,700 set earlier this month. This suggests that market participants are not loading up aggressively prior to the decision on the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETFs) applications, anticipated in January.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict how traders will respond if one or more spot Bitcoin ETFs are approved. A lack of solid demand for the ETFs after approval could turn it into a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-48k-btc-price-before-etf-sell-the-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Csell the news\u8221\'20\'1D event}}}\uc2 , while a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-inflows-dwarf-150-crypto-etp-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong inflow into the ETFs}}}\uc2  in the first few days could result in a spike in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/58fee775-59c2-45f0-9720-10ba015230fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action has boosted buying interest in altcoins. That is one of the reasons for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance}}}\uc2  from about 55% to 51% in the past few days.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin resume its uptrend or succumb to profit booking? Could altcoins continue their outperformance? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fell below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($42,597) on Dec. 29 but continues to trade inside the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4ce20882-3226-4a50-8b9b-1a9ed82a1eaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has dropped near the midpoint, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. Buyers will have to push the price above $44,700 to complete the triangle and regain control. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the pattern target of $49,178.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a break below the triangle will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could accelerate selling and sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($40,295). The bulls will try to stop the decline at this level, but if they fail, the next support level will likely be $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) closed above the descending triangle pattern on Dec. 27 and tried to start the next leg of the uptrend on Dec. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/a147e5b9-9b58-4ef4-b485-95ce68f60135.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears were in no mood to give up. They sold at $2,445 and pulled the price back below $2,403. The price dropped to the breakout level from the channel where buyers stepped in. This indicates that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair will try to resume the uptrend. The target objective on the upside is $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,269) and start a decline to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line near $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) nudged above its pattern target of $333 on Dec. 28 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests profit-taking by traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5a6bb06c-a2ce-4091-8563-f62c84dced3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Now, the BNB/USDT pair could pull back to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $300, which will likely act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off $300, the bulls will again try to push the price toward the formidable hurdle at $350.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the $300 support cracks, the correction may extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $291 and then to the neckline. The bulls are expected to protect the neckline with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s SOL ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $96 on Dec. 29, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/068f6f12-3367-415c-a7c4-de97dbae370e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the edge. The SOL/USDT pair could rise to the recent high of $126, where the bulls are likely to face strong selling by the bears. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may jump to $156.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($92) to signal a potential trend change in the near term. The pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($71).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rally on Dec. 28, but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/556ff3d0-d2d8-41b1-a8b4-2242d5747beb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has been trading near the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears. The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near the midpoint suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $0.56\u8211\'20\'13$0.67 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above $0.67 to seize control. The pair could then rise to $0.74, which is likely to act as a strong resistance. The short-term trend will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the price plummets below $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Dec. 28 but could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/d6a41dcd-a87c-43b7-868e-387c858a01b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to break below the 20-day EMA. This suggests buying at lower levels. If the price rises above the triangle, the bulls will once again try to overcome the barrier at $0.68. If they succeed, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then climb to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 The triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line remains the crucial level for the bulls to defend because if this support gives way, the pair may start a downward move to $0.50, and thereafter to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The correction in Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s AVAX ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has reached the strong support at $38, an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/03260bd3-bdfa-451c-954d-1a31e5758eb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to defend the $38 support and start a relief rally. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may stay range-bound between $38 and $50 for a while. The flattish 20-day EMA ($40) and the RSI above 57 also point to a possible consolidation in the near term with an upward bias.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price turns down and skids below $38. That may attract further selling, sinking the pair to $34 and eventually to $31.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-reduce-btc-holdings-miner-price-nears-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin miners reduce BTC holdings as 'miner price' nears $65K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.09) for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/e1e850f0-89cf-41dc-a70f-a8c6b7c30e96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the buyers or the sellers. In the near term, the price may remain stuck between the 50-day SMA ($0.09) and the $0.10 resistance.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break above $0.10, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will likely pick up above $0.11. That opens up the possibility of a rally to $0.16. Contrarily, the bears will gain the upper hand if they sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then slump to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The pullback in Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s DOT ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is nearing the breakout level of $7.90, a crucial level to watch out for in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0b56d7f1-dd8d-4138-853c-9bd1cff50475.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing down. The breakout level of $7.90 is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $7.90, the DOT/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $10, where the bears are expected to offer a stiff resistance. Alternatively, if the price slides below the 20-day EMA ($7.78), the correction could deepen to the 50-day SMA ($6.41).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s MATIC ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.09 on Dec. 27 and dipped below the breakout level of $1 on Dec. 29, indicating profit booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4fa845e0-8dbf-4a0a-a72c-1528871b9a9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels attracted strong buying by the bulls. If the price maintains above $1, the likelihood of a retest of $1.09 increases. The rising 20-day EMA ($0.89) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in command. If the $1.09 resistance is taken out, the MATIC/USDT pair may rally to $1.20 and later to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price slips and maintains below $1, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. The bears will have to sink the price below this support to signal a range-bound action between $0.70 and $1.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvNDk5YjEyZjAtNjY0NS00ZGIwLWI1NmUtZjg0NzM0N2EwZTRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231229ejct000jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
