resale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): A Surge in Price Amidst Robust Network Activity\par \par \uc2 Recently, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/is-solanas-sol-surge-about-to-hit-a-wall-why-experts-fear-a-correction-after-an-870-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\uc2  has witnessed a remarkable surge, with its value soaring by over 100%. due to its vibrant network and ability to attract new talent and users. As network activity escalates, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has rapidly emerged as a preferred platform for decentralized applications \u8211\'20\'13 it already hosts successful protocols such as Marinade Finance, Jito and Orca, demonstrating its on-chain prowess with a high Transactions Per Second (TPS) rate and a significant staked supply.\par \par \uc2 Currently, \uc2 Solana\uc2 's (SOL) price fluctuates between $80.36 and $131.36. The 10-day Moving Average is at $104.66, while the 100-day Moving Average rests at $88.7. There's a strong support level at $48.19, but the resistance levels at $150.19 and $201.19 pose potential challenges for future price growth.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) is innovating, for example by introducing Solang for smart contract development, which could be a pivotal factor in its continued growth \u8211\'20\'13 its rapid network and developer-friendly environment may attract more cutting-edge projects, potentially driving its value even higher. However, to reach those higher resistance levels, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) needs to maintain its network's momentum, draw in more users, and navigate market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and competition from other blockchains.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT): The Inscriptions Effect\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/discover-these-3-rising-stars-in-the-crypto-world"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT)}}}\uc2  has experienced a notable increase in transaction volume and network activity, especially after its platform has successfully deployed over 1,000 inscriptions, now boasting a community of more than 32,000 holders. This year has seen a surge in engagement within the Aptos (APT) ecosystem as evidenced by an influx of users and a rise in investments. Significantly, Aptos\u8217\'20\'19s (APT) Total Value Locked (TVL) has reached an impressive $100 million, signaling a strong vote of confidence from investors.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price of Aptos (APT) fluctuates between $7.81 and $10.47. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $9.96, while the 100-day Moving Average is at $8.85, both indicating a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The established support levels at $3.65 and $6.31 offer a foundation for stability, whereas resistance levels at $11.64 and $14.3 could pose challenges to further price increases.\par \par \uc2 The introduction of inscriptions is poised to generate significant excitement, keep users actively engaged, and potentially drive up the Aptos (APT) price. However, the real impact depends on the market's reception of these developments and whether Aptos (APT) can maintain its momentum in a highly competitive industry. To stay ahead, Aptos (APT) should keep innovating and introducing fresh ideas as any pause allows other blockchain platforms to catch up, potentially attracting Aptos\u8217\'20\'19 (APT) user base and developers to their ecosystems.\par \par \uc2 Near Protocol (NEAR): Riding the Wave to New Heights\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/the-top-crypto-picks-if-you-missed-the-last-crypto-boom-solana-near-scapesmania"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Near Protocol (NEAR)}}}\uc2  has recently experienced a significant increase in price, achieving a 440-day high \u8211\'20\'13 this surge, accompanied by strong Relative Strength Index (RSI) figures, has investors perking up and funneling in capital, signaling a robust market uptick.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price of NEAR Protocol is nestled between $2.54 and $4.57. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $3.94 and the 100-day Moving Average is at $3.07, both suggesting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The identified support level at $1.29 forms a solid foundation, whereas the resistance levels at $5.34 and $7.37 represent significant thresholds that the price needs to surpass.\par \par \uc2 The recent price trends and technical indicators for NEAR Protocol (NEAR) point towards a potential continuation of its upward momentum, but while the recent gains are encouraging, the volatile nature of the market and the ongoing efforts to draw in more investors could introduce uncertainties. To keep climbing, NEAR Protocol (NEAR) should keep pulling in fresh projects and hold onto the energy it's got now.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC): Breaking Barriers with a \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Breakout\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) has recently seen a notable breakout, surpassing the $1 mark \u8211\'20\'13 a clear sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sentiment as evidenced by major investors increasingly investing in altcoin and demonstrating their confidence in its potential for further growth.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price of Polygon (MATIC) sits between $0.97 and $1.052. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $0.981 and the 100-day Moving Average is at $1.015, both suggesting a continuing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. The support levels are established at $0.854 and $0.937, offering a strong base, whereas resistance levels at $1.102 and $1.185 pose possible hurdles for further price increases.\par \par \uc2 Polygon's (MATIC) recent price jump and big-money backers suggest it might keep climbing, especially with its platform that\u8217\'20\'19s both scale-friendly and a hit with developers, opening doors for more growth. However, maintaining this momentum requires consistent adoption and market activity; Polygon (MATIC) should strategically navigate the unpredictable nature of the markets and the competition from rivals to maintain and enhance its position.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT): Capturing Growth Amidst Ecosystem Expansion\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT) has experienced a notable surge in value, jumping by 36% in just a week \u8211\'20\'13 this rise coincides with consistent development activities, indicating a focus on continuous innovation. Teaming up with the brains who brought us Pok\u233\'00\'E9mon Go shows not just growth but also that Polkadot's (DOT) network is primed for fresh, cutting-edge developments.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price of Polkadot (DOT) moves between $6.92 and $9.75. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $8.59, while the 100-day Moving Average is at $7.73, both suggesting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the market. Altcoin finds solid support at $2.41 and $5.23 and resistance levels at $10.89 and $13.71 represent significant milestones for future growth.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot's (DOT) got a strong base with all its development and partnerships, but to really break through those tough resistance levels, it'll need some serious innovation and for more folks to jump on board. Polkadot's (DOT) growth is also at the mercy of unpredictable markets and stiff competition from other blockchain technologies.\par \par \uc2 A Few More Selected Cryptocurrencies: Explore Their Growth Potential\par \par \uc2 In addition to the aforementioned must-have cryptos, there are several coins that warrant special attention due to their unique developments and market positions: Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Optimism (OP), Render (RNDR), Arbitrum (ARB) and Sui (SUI) are demonstrating distinctive features and potential for future growth.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is a hub of activity having a passionate team of developers who are constantly breaking new ground with cutting-edge technology. However, a noticeable decrease in network activity and the dwindling number of unique blockchain addresses highlight a need for fresh strategies to keep Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) on the upward path.\par \par \uc2 Optimism (OP) is at a pivotal point - a significant token release is on the horizon and it can potentially shake up altcoin's market value. Given the current market trends and the potential for investors to cash in their gains post-release, there's a chance we might see a 25% dip in its price.\par \par \uc2 Render (RNDR) has seen an impressive 1,100% growth in 2023 and has hit new yearly highs. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum, backed by indicators like the RSI and Elliott Wave analysis, may face resistance around the $5.5 mark, possibly leading to a price correction.\par \par \uc2 Arbitrum (ARB) has hit a major milestone with over 1 million liquidity provider positions on Uniswap v3, which has sparked a 16% surge in its price \u8211\'20\'13 this growth is a testament to Arbitrum's (ARB) expanding influence as it draws in an increasing number of liquidity providers with its scalable blockchain.\par \par \uc2 Sui (SUI) is quickly becoming a name to watch in the DeFi sector, with a marked increase in TVL and the addition of the Solana-based lending protocol Solend to its blockchain \u8211\'20\'13 a strategic bet on Sui's (SUI) growing influence in DeFi, aiming to attract a wider audience and bolster its presence in the market.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The "Santa Claus Rally" has ushered in a notable increase in the value of altcoins, even as Bitcoin's dominance shows a slight decline \u8211\'20\'13 a diverse range of cryptos, including Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Aptos (APT), NEAR Protocol (NEAR), Polygon (MATIC), Polkadot (DOT), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Optimism (OP), Render (RNDR), Arbitrum (ARB) and Sui (SUI) are attracting attention due to their distinctive features, technological innovations, and increasing community support. Each coin demonstrates potential in various areas: for example, \uc2 Solana\uc2 's (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) value is surging amidst robust network activity, while Aptos (APT) is experiencing growth bolstered by the 'inscriptions effect', reflecting a dynamic and evolving crypto market. Moreover, one should acknowledge other altcoins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Optimism (OP), Render (RNDR), Arbitrum (ARB), and Sui (SUI) \u8211\'20\'13 these coins, too, are noteworthy for their innovative developments and distinct positions in the market.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231229ejct000gp\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,618 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s range-bound action has shifted action to altcoins, which are witnessing buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 holding its yearly gains}}}\uc2 , but is finding it difficult to break above its 17-month highs of $44,700 set earlier this month. This suggests that the market participants are not loading up aggressively prior to the decision on the spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) applications in January.\par \par \uc2 It is difficult to predict the response of the traders even if one or more spot Bitcoin ETFs are approved. A lack of solid demand for the ETFs after approval may turn it into a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-48k-btc-price-before-etf-sell-the-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 "sell the news" event}}}\uc2 , while a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-inflows-dwarf-150-crypto-etp-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong inflow into the ETFs}}}\uc2  in the first few days could result in a spike in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/58fee775-59c2-45f0-9720-10ba015230fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty about Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s short-term price action has boosted buying interest in altcoins. That is one of the reasons for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-stuck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance}}}\uc2  from about 55% to 51% in the past few days.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin resume its uptrend or succumb to profit booking? Could altcoins continue their outperformance? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fell below the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,597) on Dec. 29 but continues to trade inside the ascending triangle pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4ce20882-3226-4a50-8b9b-1a9ed82a1eaa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) has dropped near the midpoint, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. Buyers will have to push the price above $44,700 to complete the triangle and regain control. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the pattern target of $49,178.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, a break below the triangle will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could accelerate selling and sink the pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($40,295). The bulls will try to stop the decline at this level, but if they fail, the next support level will likely be $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) closed above the descending triangle pattern on Dec. 27 and tried to start the next leg of the uptrend on Dec. 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/a147e5b9-9b58-4ef4-b485-95ce68f60135.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears were in no mood to give up. They sold at $2,445 and pulled the price back below $2,403. The price dropped to the breakout level from the channel where buyers stepped in. This indicates that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair will try to resume the uptrend. The target objective on the upside is $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,269) and start a decline to the channel\u8217\'20\'19s support line near $2,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) nudged above its pattern target of $333 on Dec. 28 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests profit-taking by traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5a6bb06c-a2ce-4091-8563-f62c84dced3a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Now, the BNB/USDT pair could pull back to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $300, which will likely act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off $300, the bulls will again try to push the price toward the formidable hurdle at $350.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the $300 support cracks, the correction may extend to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $291 and then to the neckline. The bulls are expected to protect the neckline with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $96 on Dec. 29, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/068f6f12-3367-415c-a7c4-de97dbae370e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the edge. The SOL/USDT pair could rise to the recent high of $126, where the bulls are likely to face strong selling by the bears. If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair may jump to $156.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA ($92) to signal a potential trend change in the near term. The pair could then tumble to the 50-day SMA ($71).\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rally on Dec. 28, but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/556ff3d0-d2d8-41b1-a8b4-2242d5747beb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price has been trading near the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears. The flattish moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  near the midpoint suggest that the XRP/USDT pair may extend its stay inside the $0.56 to $0.67 range for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to drive the price above $0.67 to seize control. The pair could then rise to $0.74, which is likely to act as a strong resistance. The short-term trend will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the price plummets below $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the symmetrical triangle pattern on Dec. 28 but could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/d6a41dcd-a87c-43b7-868e-387c858a01b7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to break below the 20-day EMA. This suggests buying at lower levels. If the price rises above the triangle, the bulls will once again try to overcome the barrier at $0.68. If they succeed, it will signal the resumption of the uptrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then climb to $0.80.\par \par \uc2 The triangle\u8217\'20\'19s support line remains the crucial level for the bulls to defend because if this support gives way, the pair may start a downward move to $0.50, and thereafter to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) correction has reached the strong support at $38, an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/03260bd3-bdfa-451c-954d-1a31e5758eb9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to defend the $38 support and start a relief rally. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may stay range-bound between $38 and $50 for a while. The flattish 20-day EMA ($40) and the RSI above 57 also point to a possible consolidation in the near term with an upward bias.\par \par \uc2 This view will be invalidated if the price turns down and skids below $38. That may attract further selling, sinking the pair to $34 and eventually to $31.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-reduce-btc-holdings-miner-price-nears-65k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin miners reduce BTC holdings as 'miner price' nears $65K}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.09) for the past few days, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/e1e850f0-89cf-41dc-a70f-a8c6b7c30e96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the buyers or the sellers. In the near term, the price may remain stuck between the 50-day SMA ($0.09) and the $0.10 resistance.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break above $0.10, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum will likely pick up above $0.11. That opens up the possibility of a rally to $0.16. Contrarily, the bears will gain the upper hand if they sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then slump to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) pullback is nearing the breakout level of $7.90, a crucial level to watch out for in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0b56d7f1-dd8d-4138-853c-9bd1cff50475.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing down. The breakout level of $7.90 is likely to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $7.90, the DOT/USDT pair will attempt a rally to $10, where the bears are expected to offer a stiff resistance. Alternatively, if the price slides below the 20-day EMA ($7.78), the correction could deepen to the 50-day SMA ($6.41).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $1.09 on Dec. 27 and dipped below the breakout level of $1 on Dec. 29, indicating profit booking by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4fa845e0-8dbf-4a0a-a72c-1528871b9a9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels attracted strong buying by the bulls. If the price maintains above $1, the likelihood of a retest of $1.09 increases. The rising 20-day EMA ($0.89) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone suggest that bulls are in command. If the $1.09 resistance is taken out, the MATIC/USDT pair may rally to $1.20 and later to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price slips and maintains below $1, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. The bears will have to sink the price below this support to signal a range-bound action between $0.70 and $1.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvNDk5YjEyZjAtNjY0NS00ZGIwLWI1NmUtZjg0NzM0N2EwZTRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231229ejct000gq\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 10-year throwback\par \b \uc2 Crypto landscape: ten years of growth, change, advances and retreats\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Ezra Reguerra \par \uc2 552 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The top 3 crypto assets by market capitalization a decade ago were Bitcoin, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  and XRP.\par \par \uc2 While some digital assets have stood the test of time, others have tumbled below the thousands of new digital currencies that exist today.\par \par \uc2 Price of Bitcoin on Christmas Day\par \par \uc2 2023: $43,254\par \par \uc2 2022: $16,849\par \par \uc2 2021: $50,888\par \par \uc2 2020: $23,760\par \par \uc2 2019: $7,266\par \par \uc2 2018: $4,021\par \par \uc2 2017: $14,302\par \par \uc2 2016: $894\par \par \uc2 2015: $456\par \par \uc2 2014: $318\par \par \uc2 2013: $669\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 CoinGecko (@coingecko) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/coingecko/status/1739179378578469046?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 25, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 On Dec. 28, the total market capitalization for the crypto space stood at around $1.77 trillion, with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) still leading the charge at $842 million. It\u8217\'20\'19s followed by market leaders like Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ), and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), as well as stablecoins like Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) and USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Projects like XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) are also in the top ten digital assets by market cap and have proved their resilience over the years. In addition, Lido Staked Ether (stETH), which represents staked ETH in the liquid staking protocol Lido and combines the value of the initial deposit and staking rewards, is also in the top ten.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9a161d8a-2e4c-46ac-87e2-c19fe5f2bc0c.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 10 crypto assets by market capitalization on Dec. 28, 2023. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 On Dec. 28, 2013, the top ten tokens by market cap {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://web.archive.org/web/20131228020347/http://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 looked}}}\uc2  very different compared to today. A snapshot from coin data tracker CoinMarketCap shows that the total market cap for crypto was around $12 billion. BTC traded at $726.89, with a total market cap of $8.8 billion. This means that the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  has grown by almost 100 times since then.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-rally-outperform-solana-crypto-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Revenge of the ETH\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Is Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s 9% jump the start of something big?}}}\par \par \uc2 Another token leading the charts ten years ago was \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , now known as XRP. A decade ago, the token followed BTC, taking the number two spot in market capitalization. The token traded at $0.027 with a market cap of $2.6 billion. The next token was \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ), which cost $22.66 at the time and had a $550 million market cap. Both coins had price appreciations and are still some of the most traded tokens today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/fa21bdf8-0049-4056-bd8f-6d01c871f135.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 CoinMarketCap's top 10 tokens by market capitalization on Dec. 28, 2013. Source: The Wayback Machine\par \par \uc2 While the top three tokens have grown in price and total valuation, the same can't be said for the rest of the list. MasterCoin, now known as Omni, used to be in the top four, with a market cap of around $100 million. Today, the token is ranked 2337 at CoinGecko, with a total valuation of $1 million.\par \par \uc2 From the top five up to the top ten tokens a decade ago, the crypto assets have either fallen off into the ranks of thousands or have been delisted from coin-tracking websites altogether. Within the ranks, a token with the same name as Sam Altman\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Worldcoin\uc2  (WLD) can be seen, but it had a different ticker, WDC. The token has no relation to today\u8217\'20\'19s popular {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/worldcoin-launch-sparks-debate-over-data-privacy-and-future-of-ai"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eye-scanning crypto project}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Magazine: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/lushsux-ass-whoopins-nft-street-art-christies-auction/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lushsux: A decade of ass-whoopin\u8217\'20\'19 and skullduggery in a single NFT }}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvZjIzN2M2ODgtOGU3Zi00YjZkLTk3NWMtNWM4YTVhNzk0NzY2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231228ejcs0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
