lenges in the USA, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/analysts-foresee-ripple-xrp-to-achieve-this-key-milestone-by-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  keeps making significant progress with its efficient settlement system and streamlined currency exchange network. Currently being under scrutiny from the SEC, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) has maintained its resilience and achieved notable successes \u8211\'20\'13 one such achievement includes being recognized as a Virtual Asset Service Provider by the \uc2 Central Bank of Ireland\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Currently, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is trading between $0.538 and $0.711. Market trends show the 10-day Moving Average at $0.62 and a more stable 100-day Moving Average at $0.582. Altcoin has support levels at $0.298 and $0.471 and faces resistance at $0.815 and $0.988.\par \par \uc2 While grappling with legal heat in the USA, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is pushing boundaries and facing stiff competition, all while eyeing growth on a global scale. Market watchers like Lark Davis note that \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's (XRP) path to growth is challenged by a crowded field of cryptocurrencies and the emerging popularity of stablecoins. However, they also recognize \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's (XRP) potential to excel in the current market cycle. Should Ripple (XRP) come out on top in its legal tussles and keep up with innovation and building robust alliances, it stands to really boost its clout in the marketplace. But to really make a mark, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) has to overcome tough rivals and navigate the choppy waters of \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Building a Sustainable Blockchain Ecosystem\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/fair-price-for-cardano-ada-should-be-around-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is distinguished by its commitment to intensive research during the development of its blockchain, with a strong focus on eco-friendliness and robust security. Recently, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  )has garnered increasing positivity regarding its platform updates and developments, potentially positioning it for a robust end to 2023.\par \par \uc2 Currently, the price of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) fluctuates between $0.54 and $0.647. The 10-day Moving Average is at $0.607, closely mirroring the 100-day Moving Average at $0.602 and suggesting a stable short-term trend. Support levels are identified at $0.38 and $0.488, while resistance levels are observed at $0.703 and $0.81.\par \par \uc2 At this juncture, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) stands at a pivotal point \u8211\'20\'13 its strong technological foundation and the recent positive developments could catalyze significant growth. With ongoing upgrades and a dedicated community, Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) future appears promising, however, in the face of evolving markets and emerging competitors, it is imperative to sustain its innovative momentum and adapt to changing market conditions. Striking a balance between maintaining a stable and secure network while embracing innovative features will be key to Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) continued success and potential price appreciation.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot (DOT): Fostering Interoperability and Growth\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/year-end-surprise-polkadot-dot-compound-comp-and-algorand-algo-setting-up-for-a-major-breakthrough"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polkadot (DOT)}}}\uc2  is renowned for its interoperability and scalability \u8211\'20\'13 qualities that allow various blockchains to connect seamlessly and function collectively, which is particularly significant in today's evolving environment where multiple chains coexist and collaborate.\par \par \uc2 As of now, the price of Polkadot (DOT) moves between $6.92 and $9.75. The 10-day Moving Average at $8.93 suggests a recent upward trend, whereas the 100-day Moving Average at $7.54 indicates a steadier, moderate long-term trajectory. The support levels are positioned at $2.41 and $5.23, while resistance levels are noted at $10.89 and $13.71.\par \par \uc2 The future of Polkadot (DOT) is closely linked to the widespread adoption of multi-chain architectures \u8211\'20\'13 altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s capacity to enable diverse blockchain networks to communicate effectively could significantly propel its growth in an increasingly interconnected technological landscape. However, Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) success also depends on the general acceptance of integrated blockchain networks: market sentiment, technological developments and competitive dynamics will play crucial roles in determining Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s (DOT) price and market standing.\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI): DeFi Dominance and Market Adaptation\par \par \uc2 Uniswap (UNI) has significantly impacted the decentralized finance (DeFi) space with its automated liquidity protocol. As a prominent player in the DeFi sector, Uniswap (UNI) facilitates smooth decentralized trading and ensures consistent liquidity.\par \par \uc2 Currently, Uniswap (UNI) is hovering in a range of $6.72 to $7.88. Its 10-day Moving Average stands at $7.15 and the 100-day Moving Average is at $7.19, indicating a relatively stable short-term price trend. The support levels for altcoin are established at $4.94 and $6.1, while resistance levels are set at $8.41 and $9.57.\par \par \uc2 The future prospects of Uniswap (UNI) are closely tied to the overall development of the DeFi sector \u8211\'20\'13 with the continued growth and evolution of DeFi, Uniswap (UNI) is poised to capitalize on increasing adoption and ongoing innovation. However, the journey ahead for Uniswap (UNI) is not without challenges: the platform should adeptly navigate the complexities of evolving regulations and maintain its competitive edge against emerging DeFi players by introducing new technologies.\par \par \uc2 NEAR Protocol (NEAR): Simplifying Blockchain Usability\par \par \uc2 NEAR Protocol (NEAR) is garnering attention for its developer-friendly platform and high-performance blockchain capabilities \u8211\'20\'13 altcoin stands out by simplifying the dApp development process and effectively addressing the limitations that hinder traditional blockchains.\par \par \uc2 Currently, NEAR Protocol (NEAR) is oscillating between $2.54 and $4.57. It has the 10-Day Moving Average at $4.26 and the 100-Day Moving Average at $2.87, suggesting a recent uptrend. The support level is at $1.29, with resistance levels at $5.34 and $7.37 indicating a potentially volatile, yet upward-trending market.\par \par \uc2 NEAR Protocol's (NEAR) success rests on its charm to pull in a solid crew of users and devs, since it's not just about the tech but how many people jump on board and start building. However, NEAR Protocol's (NEAR) fate isn't solely determined by its features; it also depends on market dynamics, the speed of user adoption, and token\u8217\'20\'19s ability to distinguish itself amidst numerous competitors.\par \par \uc2 Emerging Tokens: A Closer Look at Potential Market Movers\par \par \uc2 Beyond the crypto world\u8217\'20\'19s giants, emerging cryptos like Filecoin (FIL), Optimism (OP), dYdX (DYDX), Osmosis (OSMO) and Mina Protocol (MINA) are also carving out their niches by offering unique features and promising potential.\par \par \uc2 Filecoin (FIL) is gaining momentum due to redefining data storage with a secure, decentralized network that's catching eyes in the Web3 arena. With its surge in popularity and potential for scaling to new heights, Filecoin (FIL) is quickly becoming a heavyweight in the Web3 space.\par \par \uc2 As an Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s layer-2 scaling solution, Optimism (OP) is turning heads in the gaming sector, potentially boosting its adoption and utility \u8211\'20\'13 altcoin\u8217\'20\'19s knack for streamlining transactions puts it on the radar as a noteworthy endeavor.\par \par \uc2 dYdX (DYDX) enables more complex trading like derivatives and margin. Even though some skeptics doubt the platform's potential, dYdX\u8217\'20\'19s (DYDX) dedication to top-notch security and robust trading features hints at a bright future on the horizon.\par \par \uc2 Osmosis (OSMO), an advanced automated market maker, has recently seen a significant price surge, primarily due to bridging different blockchains with ease and paving the way for a more interconnected ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 Tipping the scales as the lightest contender in blockchain tech, Mina Protocol (MINA) leverages zero-knowledge proofs to ensure top-notch privacy without compromising on efficiency. Mina Protocol\u8217\'20\'19s (MINA) cutting-edge tech and its market performance hint at its big role in making blockchain both more scalable and secure.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 On December 27, the crypto world is riding a rollercoaster, with the global market cap dipping to $1.64 trillion. In the midst of all this, some altcoins are making a real splash with their growth potential and wallet-friendly appeal: take \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), for instance \u8211\'20\'13 it's weathering legal storms and still showing promise for growth; then there's Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), earning kudos for its eco-friendly blockchain vibe; Polkadot (DOT) is turning heads by making different blockchains work together, while Uniswap (UNI) is revolutionizing the DeFi world with its unique approach to liquidity; NEAR Protocol is another name that's buzzing around, winning hearts by simplifying blockchain tech for developers and everyday folks alike.\par \par \uc2 And let's not forget the new kids on the block \u8211\'20\'13 Filecoin (FIL), Optimism (OP), dYdX (DYDX), Osmosis (OSMO) and Mina Protocol (MINA), each bringing something cool to the table, from super-smart storage solutions to cutting-edge financial tools and groundbreaking blockchain tech. Among the latest entrants, ScapesMania is also creating waves: its pre-sale success and focus on gaming hint at exciting possibilities. All these budget-friendly cryptos are more than just numbers on a screen \u8211\'20\'13 they're packed with features and growth potential that make them stand out as we look towards 2024.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231227ejcr0012x\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/27: BTC, ETH, \uc2 SOL\uc2 , BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,609 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are trading near their respective 52-week highs, but the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests the momentum is slowing.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been hanging on to the gains made in early December, indicating that every minor dip is being purchased. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-products-103-million-weekly-inflows-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin funds witnessed an inflow}}}\uc2  of $87.6 million in the week ending Dec. 22.\par \par \uc2 Separately, data from exchange-traded funds (ETFs) research firm ETFGI shows $1.31 billion of inflows into crypto ETFs and exchange-traded products (ETPs) in November, bringing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-inflows-dwarf-150-crypto-etp-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total inflows for the year to $1.60 billion}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/c862cd71-853e-4b1b-93bf-12ef18ef75f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Investors seem to be accumulating Bitcoin before the anticipated approval of a spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  in January. Business Intelligence firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-14620-bitcoins-december-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MicroStrategy added 14,620 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  to increase its total stockpile to 189,150 Bitcoin. The latest acquisition was made at $42,110 per Bitcoin, taking its total average purchase price to about $31,168.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins continue their northward journey in the last few days of the year? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck between the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,513) and the overhead resistance at $44,700.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0f8cc224-07c4-40ed-9f8e-321dcb35c8ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed an ascending triangle pattern that will complete on a break and close above $44,700. The BTC/USDT pair could then start the next leg of the uptrend toward the pattern target of $49,178.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, it will invalidate the positive setup. That may trigger the stops of several traders, pulling the price to the 50-day simple moving average ($40,022) and later to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) had been trading inside a descending channel pattern for the past few days, but a positive sign is that the bulls did not allow the price to sustain below $2,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/cf372fe6-1ca9-474f-b9df-3dcedbe07336.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Solid buying on Dec. 27 propelled the price above the descending channel. If bulls maintain the price above the channel, the possibility of a break above $2,403 increases. The ETH/USDT pair could then ascend to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price re-enters the channel, it will signal that higher levels continue to attract sellers. The break below $2,200 could sink the pair to the support line of the channel. This remains the key level for the bulls to protect because a drop below the channel may start a deeper correction to $1,900 and then $1,750.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past several days. The bulls easily cleared the psychological resistance of $100 on Dec. 23 and pushed the price to $126 on Dec. 25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/52050d64-216f-49fb-aabc-53ce55cebf9f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Profit booking started a pullback on Dec. 26, but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $103. The price has turned down on Dec. 27, indicating that the bears are in no mood to give up.\par \par \uc2 If the price drops below $103, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could decline to the 20-day EMA ($89), near the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level. A break below the 20-day EMA will suggest a change in the short-term trend. The bulls will regain control if they catapult the price above $126.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($262) on Dec. 25 and soared above the neckline on Dec. 26, completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/17c7e985-0524-4235-9249-9faa3c754818.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price down toward the neckline on Dec. 27, but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying on dips. Buyers will try to maintain the momentum and shove the price to the pattern target of $333 and eventually to $350.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to stall the up move near $317 and start a correction. Sellers will have to tug the BNB/USDT pair below the neckline to make a comeback.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.56 and $0.67 for the past few days, signaling a balance between buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5b048c1e-ba9f-4132-a110-b5b6e6c4bd77.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting that the range-bound action may continue for a while longer. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $0.67. The XRP/USDT pair may then rise to $0.74, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and keep the price below $0.56 to seize control. The pair could then slide to the solid support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in an uptrend. The price action of the past few days has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9b4954bc-3ed5-4a76-8abc-5a66fdaf7e49.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory signal advantage to buyers. A break and close above the triangle will suggest that the bulls have absorbed the supply. That could propel the price to $0.69 and later to the pattern target of $0.80.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the triangle, it will suggest that the bears remain active at higher levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then collapse to the strong support at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $49.96 on Dec. 24, indicating that the traders booked profits near the psychological level of $50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/f6360677-ce83-4630-8ba5-a1c9e6b22626.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up on Dec. 26, pulling the price to the 20-day EMA ($40.31). The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bulls continue to view the dips as a buying opportunity. Buyers will have to push the price above $50 to resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view is that the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is showing signs of forming a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence. This suggests that the positive momentum may be weakening. That signals a minor correction or consolidation in the near term. The selling could pick up if the AVAX/USDT pair skids below the 20-day EMA. The pair may then slump to $34.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-up-95-december-avax-inj-near-even-higher"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana is up 95% in December \u8212\'20\'14 But why are AVAX, INJ, NEAR surging even higher?}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Dec. 26, but the long tail on the candlestick shows strong buying at the 50-day SMA ($0.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/590ad1a0-2f51-4e08-8ecb-78b4112ad227.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This equilibrium could shift in favor of the bears if they sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. The pair may then tumble to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to gain the upper hand, they will have to drive the price above the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is correcting in an uptrend. The price turned down from $9.59 on Dec. 26, indicating that the bears are defending the overhead resistance at $10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ea95d9b4-9c7f-442c-bc90-ec68d9708b53.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair is likely to correct to the breakout level of $7.90. If the price rebounds off this support, it will imply that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the obstacle at $10 and start the journey to $12.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the upside is that the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is forming a negative divergence. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be slowing. The pair may spend some time inside the range between $7.90 and $9.59 in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.87) on Dec. 25 and rose above the stiff overhead resistance of $1 on Dec. 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0112db9a-59dd-41cf-ad0a-4bb53f63d13e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to extend the up move on Dec. 27 but may face selling near $1.20. If the price turns down the overhead resistance, the MATIC/USDT pair could drop to $1. If bulls flip this level into support, it will signal strength. The bulls will then try to overcome the barrier at $1.20 and push the price to $1.50.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bears pull the price below $1, it may trap the aggressive bulls. That could accelerate selling and pull the pair to the $0.89 support.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvMjdkY2I2NjMtZjAyNC00NjE4LWE5NzctNjM4M2MyODE5NzM1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231227ejcr000gr\p