cles such as market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and regulatory challenges. A failure to maintain support levels could trigger additional declines, forcing 1inch Network (1INCH) to test lower bounds that have remained unseen for a long time.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE): Navigating the Waters Towards $0.10 Amid Whale Movements\par \par \uc2 Recently, there has been a noticeable shift in the Dogecoin (DOGE) market due to significant whale activities, including a substantial transaction involving the transfer of 514 million tokens. This not only contributes to the wider market's recovery efforts, but also aligns with Dogecoin's (DOGE) goal of reaching the $0.1 mark. Despite a recent 5% decline in value, there are clear signs of resurgence in this popular meme coin, indicating a potential recovery from its December lows.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) is currently trading within a price range of $0.086 to $0.103, with the 10-day Moving Average lounging at $0.0925 and the 100-day Moving Average chilling at $0.0953. Meme coin has identified support levels at $0.0619 and $0.0793, while facing resistance at $0.1139 and $0.1313.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin (DOGE) is eyeing the future filled with both opportunities and obstacles \u8211\'20\'13 the market is cautiously optimistic and holds the potential to break out further, if the broader crypto domain sustains its recovery. Nevertheless, the meme coin is not immune to inherent risks like its dependence on social media sentiment and whale activities.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB): A Volatile Journey \u8211\'20\'13 Can the \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trend Resume?\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) has recently experienced wild \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with a notable 23% surge closely followed by a 14.39% decline. Despite this, the meme coin still maintains a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bias stemming from Bitcoin's performance.\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu (SHIB) is hanging between $0.00000898 and $0.00001176. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $0.00001036 and the 100-day Moving Average is at $0.00001002. Shiba Inu (SHIB) has support levels at $0.00000489 and $0.00000767, with resistance levels found at $0.00001323 and $0.00001601.\par \par \uc2 The future for Shiba Inu (SHIB) is cautiously optimistic, but it\u8217\'20\'19s not without the challenges \u8211\'20\'13 the meme coin's recent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  highlights its sensitivity to market movements and the importance of support levels in maintaining its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. If Bitcoin remains stable and Shiba Inu (SHIB) manages to defend its support levels, potential recovery and growth might be in sight.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As 2023 draws to a close, the crypto market is riding a wave of optimism, with Bitcoin's notable performance positively influencing a range of altcoins: Solana (SOL), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), 1inch Network (1INCH), Dogecoin (DOGE) and Shiba Inu (SHIB) all present unique opportunities and challenges in this evolving landscape. ScapesMania is another facet of diversity that exhibits potential innovation already at its nascent phase.\par \par \uc2 Each of these cryptocurrencies, from \uc2 SOL\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s robust growth and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s potential surge to 1INCH\u8217\'20\'19s innovative strides and the widespread appeal of both DOGE and SHIB, offers a distinct narrative in the investment landscape. While the prospects for substantial growth are evident, they come with the inherent \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unpredictability of the crypto market \u8211\'20\'13 so the future trajectory of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), 1inch Network (1INCH), Dogecoin (DOGE), and Shiba Inu (SHIB) will be shaped by market dynamics, technological developments, and regulatory changes.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231223ejcn0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/22: BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOGE, DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,617 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls are chasing after the $45,000 resistance level, but will it break before the end of 2023?\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is hovering near the $44,700 overhead resistance, indicating a mild resistance from the bears. However, the downside looks protected as traders expect one or more spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds (ETFs) to be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-january-10-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved by the regulator in January}}}\uc2 . The event is expected to provide a massive boost to the crypto space.\par \par \uc2 The spot \uc2 Bitcoin \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2  approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if it comes, will cause an initial knee-jerk reaction, but after that, traders are likely to shift their focus to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-traders-48k-btc-price-before-etf-sell-the-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 actual demand for the ETFs}}}\uc2 . Trading firm QCP Capital said in its market update that the \u8220\'20\'1Cdemand for the BTC Spot ETF at the start will fall short of market expectations.\u8221\'20\'1D That could tempt traders to book profits, starting a retretracement.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1e3fe135-d794-423c-b715-6dac3a8701f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 It is always difficult to predict the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 market reaction\b0 \highlight\uc2  to pivotal events, but there is a tendency for speculators to book profits. Sometimes, the profit booking happens just after the event, and on other occasions, after a spike. But after the initial pullback, the prevailing trend generally resumes.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins break above their recent local highs and extend their uptrend, or will profit-booking pull prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has reached the overhead resistance at $44,700, where the bears are posing a tough challenge. A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded much ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/db91d250-17a9-4345-b8b1-b89bcb7ab54f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) warrants caution. The first sign of weakness will be a close below the 20-day exponential moving average ($42,103). The BTC/USDT pair could then collapse to $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or the 20-day EMA and rises above $44,700, it will indicate the start of the next leg of the uptrend. The pair could rally to $48,000 and eventually to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) back above the 20-day EMA ($2,221) on Dec. 21, indicating that the correction may have ended.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/8596cf11-8fc9-45c6-8c3f-797a3b6e5161.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price maintains above $2,332, the next stop is likely to be the 52-week high at $2,403. This is an important zone for the bears to protect because a break and close above it could start the next leg of the uptrend. The ETH/USDT pair may then ascend to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could retest the vital support at $2,200. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $2,200 to weaken the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($74) on Dec. 18 and soared to $100 on Dec. 22, indicating aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/290f5509-adcb-4cc4-9936-f1830ddb4b9c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair is likely to witness selling near $100, but if bulls do not give up much ground, the prospects of the continuation of the uptrend remain high. If buyers drive the price above $100, the pair could start its journey toward $143.\par \par \uc2 Although the recent rise has invalidated the negative divergence, the \uc2 RSI\uc2  remains in the overbought territory. This suggests the rally is overheated in the near term and could result in a minor correction or consolidation. The first support on the downside is $80, and then the 20-day EMA. A slide below this level will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) pierced the overhead resistance of $260 on Dec. 20, signaling that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/8c5f69e8-a4d1-4798-b749-87ce59a9588c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their purchase and pushed the price to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern on Dec. 21. This level is likely to witness strong selling by the bears, but if the bulls prevail and propel the price above the neckline, the BNB/USDT pair will complete the inverse H&S pattern. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $333.\par \par \uc2 The nearest support on the downside is $260, and then the 20-day EMA ($248). The bears will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been swinging between $0.56 and $0.74, indicating indecision between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/8fae9e95-431c-4b95-8eb5-c2094d200a47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting that the range-bound action may extend for a few more days. If the bulls push the price above the moving averages, the pair may rally to $0.67 and thereafter to $0.74. The bears are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are selling on minor rallies. The XRP/USDT pair could then decline to the crucial support at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the minor resistance of $0.62 on Dec. 21. Buyers will next try to push the price above the 52-week high of $0.68.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/434422f4-f406-4cdb-a1c7-0fc87b0886bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not yet given up. They are trying to stall the recovery at $0.65. Sellers will have to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.55) to signal a potential trend change. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then slump to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls remain in control. A break above $0.68 will open the doors for a possible rally to $0.78.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rose above the resistance at $45.33 on Dec. 16, indicating the start of the next leg of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1b4b1aa3-dead-4d0f-b270-b3e81c40cef9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up-move is likely to face a minor hurdle at $50. If the price turns down from this level but does not fall below $38, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $50. If that happens, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could climb to $70.\par \par \uc2 The overbought level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the rally is overheated in the near term, and a consolidation or correction is possible. The bears will have to pull the price below $38 to seize control.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-shirks-us-pce-inflation-win-bitcoin-buyers-42k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price shirks US PCE inflation win as Bitcoin $42K buyers step in}}}\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the 20-day EMA ($0.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/8d68685f-0529-4b69-8914-fa57fdfabc2b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA on Dec. 21 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels. If bears tug the price below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.08) and subsequently to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel and maintain the price above the $0.10 to $0.11 resistance zone to gain the upper hand. The pair is likely to pick up momentum above $0.11 and surge toward $0.16.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($6.89) on Dec. 20 and soared above the $7.90 resistance on Dec. 21, indicating a continuation of the up move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/a6d4f909-2841-43dd-acdf-5a7c83f1fd24.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are unlikely to give up easily and will try to pull the price back below $7.90 and trap the aggressive bulls. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could witness long liquidation. The pair may then drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $7.90, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That increases the possibility of a rally to $10, where the bulls are likely to face strong selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) rose and closed above the 20-day EMA ($14.87) on Dec. 21 after repeated failed attempts, indicating that the bulls are on a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/7587e8d0-7925-49d9-beac-8272f3576cea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USDT pair could rise to $16.60 and thereafter retest the 52-week high at $17.32. If bulls overcome this resistance, the pair will resume the uptrend. The next target on the upside is at $20.35.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the overhead resistance, it will indicate that bears remain sellers on rallies. The pair could then extend its stay inside the large range between $12.85 and $17.32 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvZTc0YTBkMWYtMTRkNC00MTY4LWJlMGItNzZmZWM3YzgzMDAyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240105ejcm000eh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
