ly, an upward trajectory may extend to $0.6907, presenting strategic levels for potential profit-taking.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, should XRP yield to \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pressure and descend below the pivot point, it may encounter immediate support at $0.5819. A breach of this support level could trigger a further decline, potentially leading the price to $0.5541. These levels represent critical points that could influence market dynamics in the coming sessions.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Based on the on-chain metrics provided by IntoTheBlock, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  remains an attractive prospect for \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors, with the In-the-Money ratio standing at a robust 54%, indicating the percentage of holders currently in profit.\par \par \uc2 Noteworthy performance was observed in the last month, with Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) surging by an impressive 57%. According to the latest data from \uc2 TradingView\uc2 , the coin is currently experiencing price fluctuations within the range of $0.5870 to $0.6090.\par \par \uc2 Examining the technical indicators, both the Relative Strength Index (RSI) at 63.38 and the Stochastic %K at 63.33136 suggest a state of neutrality in the trend, creating a potential opportunity for an upward movement. Simultaneously, the Momentum indicator at $0.050651 is signaling a buy action, adding to the positive sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages further reinforce the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook across various time frames. The current price positioning above the 10-day Simple Moving Average (SMA) at $0.595304 and the 10-day Exponential Moving Average (EMA) at $0.593573 indicates a continuation of the upside momentum. Likewise, the 100-day SMA at $0.587650 and the 100-day EMA at $0.592098 underscore a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance in the longer term. Investors and traders may find these indicators supportive of a positive trajectory for Cardano in the foreseeable future.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 The prevailing configuration of technical indicators strongly favors a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). There is a notable possibility that, by maintaining its position above the pivot point of $0.591913, the coin could extend its upward trajectory to reach $0.667644. Furthermore, the subsequent upside target is projected to be at $0.755218.\par \par \uc2 However, in the event of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario materializing, Cardano might experience a decline with a potential downside target at $0.504339. A further descent could lead the coin to the subsequent downside target at $0.428608. At these levels, traders may need to readjest their stop loss targets.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 As the year concludes, investors are eyeing assets like \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) for the year ahead. \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) has achieved key milestones in global expansion that could contribute to its bullishness while Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) presents an attractive prospect with a robust technical layout. Both of these coins offer interesting opportunities to watch out for, but investors should always keep in mind the need to closely monitor the dynamics of the market and adjust their strategies accordingly.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231221ejcl000mb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOT, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,570 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Crypto's Santa Claus rally appears to be in full effect as Bitcoin and altcoins chase after new year-to-date highs.\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets are buzzing with the possibility of the spot Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) exchange-traded fund seeing the light of the day in January. K33 Research analysts said in a Dec. 19 report that the recent ETF updates about \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and ARK Invest agreeing to a cash-creation setup for their funds signals that an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-approval-nailed-on-january-k33-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approval is \u8220\'20\'1Cnailed\u8221\'20\'1D for January}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  co-founder \uc2 Michael Saylor\uc2  said in an interview with \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  that the approval of the spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cmay be the biggest development on Wall Street in 30 years.\u8221\'20\'1D The ETF and the Bitcoin halving in April, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spot-etf-biggest-wall-street-development-30-years-michael-saylor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are expected to lay the stage for}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Ca major bull run for the asset class\u8221\'20\'1D in 2024.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/069baae2-c82f-44e6-a139-9b47417ce4f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Continuing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  narrative, Grayscale CEO \uc2 Michael Sonnenshein\uc2  said in a CNBC interview that the spot \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2  will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-30-trillion-market-community-sentiment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 open the market}}}\uc2  to \u8220\'20\'1Cabout $30 trillion worth of advised wealth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins break above their recent local highs, or will higher levels attract sellers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dipped below the 20-day exponential moving average ($41,760) on Dec. 18, but the bears could not sustain the lower levels, indicating strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/e27f1535-a4a1-4966-9cf2-a5c02d3ad8f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the downtrend line on Dec. 19, but the bears sold at higher levels. However, renewed buying on Dec. 20 has pushed the price above the immediate resistance at $43,500. This increases the likelihood of a rally above the 52-week high at $44,700. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could surge to $48,000 and eventually to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down sharply from $44,700, it will suggest that the sellers remain active at higher levels. The bears will have to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA to accelerate selling and challenge the solid support at $37,980.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the strong support at $2,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/466a4616-4cce-4783-8240-f7fddb4c60e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to sustain the price below $2,200 indicates buying at lower levels. The flattish 20-day EMA ($2,210) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the ETH/USDT pair to $2,332 and then to $2,403. Sellers are expected to defend this zone with vigor. On the downside, the 50-day SMA ($2,091) remains the key level to keep an eye on. A break below it may result in a fall to $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) fell below the moving averages on Dec. 18 but quickly changed direction, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9484e2a3-cf55-45a7-9205-1243738d66e1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive zone indicate that bulls have the edge. If buyers sustain the price above $260, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern. A break and close above the neckline will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, having a pattern target of $333.\par \par \uc2 The immediate support on the downside is at the moving averages and below that at $223. A drop below this level may sink the pair to $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip in XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) near the strong support of $0.56 on Dec. 18, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9e59c0df-ed23-4813-a1ef-9ad785cc2e3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to drive the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rise to $0.67, where the bears will try to vigorously defend the level. If the price turns down from $0.67, the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are trying to take charge. A drop below the crucial support of $0.56 could open the downside to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong uptrend. The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($69.77) on Dec. 18, pushing the price above the resistance at $79.50.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/e3f5579a-7c72-45c2-9c21-9b73bb1e1fb1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Although the upsloping moving averages indicate advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the RSI warrants caution. The bears will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA to trigger stops of several traders, pulling the pair down to the 50-day SMA ($59.51) and subsequently to $50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers sustain the price above $80, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the rally to $100.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on Dec. 18, as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/d54a76ae-fb4b-410a-a812-71a2dc3af016.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to overcome the minor barrier at $0.62 to challenge the 52-week high at $0.68. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance, but if buyers kick the price above it, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to $0.78.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside move, they will have to quickly drag the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair could plummet to the breakout level of $0.46, likely attracting buyers.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are not allowing Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) price to maintain below the 20-day EMA ($0.09), indicating solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/35d2ca88-9138-42a9-908b-c6083b6fc664.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, suggesting a range-bound action in the near term. The DOGE/USDT pair may swing between the 50-day SMA ($0.08) and $0.11 for a while.\par \par \uc2 If buyers want to seize control, they will have to propel the price above $0.11. That could start the next leg of the uptrend to $0.16. Alternatively, a drop below the 50-day SMA will suggest advantage to bears, plunging the pair to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-btc-price-attempts-44k-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin dominance bounces back as BTC price attempts $44K breakout}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a rebound off $38, indicating that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ab31d9d7-9a6f-41af-9d59-2c7006fe7299.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($34.71) suggests advantage to buyers, but the overbought levels on the RSI caution that a consolidation or correction is possible in the near term. Sellers are expected to fiercely defend the overhead resistance at $45.33, but if the hurdle is cleared, the next stop could be $50.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a break and close below $38. That opens the door for a drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below the 20-day EMA will signal that the uptrend may have ended in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been finding support at the 20-day EMA ($6.61), indicating that the bulls continue to buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/6c9dca3a-8913-4316-b76d-fa274e76aafe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price toward the overhead resistance at $7.90, where they are likely to encounter strong selling by the bears. If buyers overcome the resistance, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $10.\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to sell the rallies from the current level and tug the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the selling could accelerate, and the pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($5.74).\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the large range between $12.85 and $16.60 for the past few days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/623bf033-3e5c-4bd6-b647-b25e73bd3d30.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just above the midpoint, indicating that the sellers have a slight edge. If the price sustains below the moving averages, the LINK/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $12.85.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price rises above the 20-day EMA ($14.80), it will suggest that the bulls are trying to gain the upper hand. The pair may rise to $15.58 and later to $16.60. If the price turns down from this resistance, it will indicate that the pair may extend its range-bound action for some more time.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvMWE1YzY0ODItMmUxMi00ZWVmLTg0YTQtY2FhZmU4OTJmYmJhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020240109ejck0003j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
