ict that Ethereum (ETH), the pioneering smart contract platform, will outperform Bitcoin by 2024. This can happen after a significant EIP-4844 upgrade takes effect, potentially bolstering efficiency for Ethereum (ETH) through reduced transaction costs and subsequently boosting its adoption rate.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) currently fluctuates between $1841 to $2199. Its 10-day moving average stands at $2292, while the 100-day moving average is at $1838. The support levels are identified at $1272 and $1630, with resistance levels standing at $2347 and $2705.\par \par \uc2 With the EIP-4844 upgrade, Ethereum (ETH) investors anticipate a catalytic price surge to the range between $3,400 and $3,800 in early 2024. Though potential market corrections may come to the surface, those efficiency improvements that we expect will predominantly impart a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Navigating Through Market Fluctuations\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/solana-sol-investors-target-70-will-the-altcoin-break-this-barrier"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana (SOL)}}}\uc2  experienced a significant price surge following its integration with major exchanges like \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  and \uc2 Binance\uc2  (BNB) which notably expanded its market presence. Effectively, \uc2 Solana\uc2 's SPL tokens are currently trading on these platforms.\par \par \uc2 The Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) price range is currently between $42.09 and $74.4. The 10-day moving average is at $71.17 and the 100-day moving average is at $38.88. Token has a support level at $24.89 and faces resistances at $85.34 and $115.56.\par \par \uc2 All the recent developments and integrations hint at a positive outlook for Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), nevertheless, one should vigilantly observe their ongoing influence on the Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) market performance and ascertain whether the recent gains are really sustainable.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT): Defying Market Expectations\par \par \uc2 Despite unlocking a significant portion of its tokens, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/must-have-cryptos-to-buy-before-the-year-ends"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT)}}}\uc2  has displayed remarkable resilience with its price surging to a six-month high. In defying the typical \b \highlight22\uc2 market reaction\b0 \highlight\uc2  to an influx in token supply, this trend stands out as exceptional.\par \par \uc2 The current price range for Aptos (APT) is between $6.08 and $8.16. Its 10-day moving average is at $8.27 and the 100-day moving average is at $6.36. Aptos (APT) has support levels at $3.11 and $5.19, as well as resistance levels at $9.35 and $11.43.\par \par \uc2 Regardless of the potential for escalating supply pressure, the recent performance of Aptos (APT) indicates a robust market interest. This enthusiasm may persist in propelling its price upwards, however, vigilant monitoring of market dynamics remains imperative.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP): Charting a Historic Bull Flag\par \par \uc2 Historically, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/its-critical-hour-for-ripple-xrp-which-path-will-shape-its-near-term-direction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  has formed its largest bull flag to date \u8211\'20\'13 this formation is significant, mostly because altcoin has consistently performed below its all-time high of $3.84.\par \par \uc2 The Ripple (XRP) price fluctuates between $0.538 and $0.711. The 10-day moving average is at $0.64, and the 100-day moving average is at $0.567. Support levels are at $0.298 and $0.471, with resistance being at $0.815 and $0.988.\par \par \uc2 The bull flag formation suggests a potential for the Ripple (XRP) price\u8217\'20\'19s strong upward movement, however, one should consider a myriad of external factors including the resolution of ongoing regulatory challenges.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Riding the \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wave\par \par \uc2 In just 14 days, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has surged by an impressive 75% \u8211\'20\'13 this upward trajectory aligns with the broader \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend that we are now witnessing across the whole crypto market.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price hovers between $0.443 and $0.696. The 10-day moving average is at $0.647 and the 100-day moving average is at $0.483. Altcoin has support levels at $0.038 and $0.291, as well as resistance levels at $0.798 and $1.052.\par \par \uc2 The recent performance of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) looks promising, however, one can better understand its future potential by considering the broader market trends and on-chain metrics.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Spearheaded by Ethereum (ETH), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), Aptos (APT), Ripple (XRP), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and the innovative ScapesMania, the cryptocurrency landscape stands resilient in the face of economic challenges. With its anticipated EIP-4844 upgrade, ETH is poised to potentially outshine Bitcoin through enhancing its own transaction capabilities and market stature; SOL and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  have demonstrated impressive growth, capitalizing on the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum in the crypto market; despite a significant token release, APT has remarkably defied market expectations with its price resilience; and the historic bull flag formation of XRP signals potential for substantial upward movement, even though the asset itself remains subject to various market and regulatory dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231215ejcf0012y\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/15: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,654 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins risk breaking down of their near-term supports, starting a deeper correction.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally has been taking a breather for the past few days but its strong rally in 2023 has not gone unnoticed. A survey of United States financial services companies by crypto firm Paxos showed that 99% of the firms were putting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-under-greater-focus-99-of-companies-paxos-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as much or more focus on crypto projects}}}\uc2  this year as compared to previous years.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are increasingly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin and the crypto space in 2024. Bitwise senior research analyst Ryan Rasmussen made {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-80k-stablecoin-growth-bitwise-invest-crypto-prediction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ten predictions for the crypto industry in 2024}}}\uc2  in an X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post on Dec. 13. He believes Bitcoin will soar to $80,000 in 2024 and \u8220\'20\'1Cmore money will settle using stablecoins than using Visa.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4e078511-072d-47a9-b32b-75bcba5ed62b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Along with crypto-specific issues, expectations of rate cuts by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  in 2024 are adding to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. Arthur Hayes, the former CEO of crypto exchange BitMEX, reiterated his \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view on crypto in an X post on Dec. 14. He said that the fiat was \u8220\'20\'1Ca filthy piece of trash\u8221\'20\'1D and there was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-excuse-not-to-long-crypto-arthur-hayes-repeats-1m-btc-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 no reason not to be long crypto}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 What are the vital support levels that could arrest the fall in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been stuck between the downtrend line and the 20-day exponential moving average ($41,221) for the past few days. This tightening of the price action suggests that a range breakout is possible in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/653edc5b-331a-4193-932b-b661876c43c9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bulls are aggressively booking profits. That could sink the BTC/USDT pair to the 50-day simple moving average ($38,050). Buyers are expected to fiercely defend this level.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price bounces off the 20-day EMA and pierces the downtrend line, it will signal that the bulls remain in control. The pair could rise to the 52-week high at $44,700 and if this level is cleared, the next stop is likely to be $48,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the $2,200 support on Dec. 13, but the relief rally is facing selling near $2,332. This suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/73602e4a-74c6-4b0d-a86d-ba9ca7b4721c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is slowing down. Sellers will try to strengthen their position by pulling the price below $2,200. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could tumble to the 50-day SMA ($2,049) and later to the solid support at $1,900.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price once again rebounds off $2,200, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the likelihood of a rally to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are struggling to push BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $260, but a minor positive is that they have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/3819a8e2-2053-49ec-9d37-6a76ae502b41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The gradually upsloping 20-day EMA ($240) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers. If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will again attempt to drive the price to the neckline of the inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price dips below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then slump to the strong support at $223, indicating a range-bound action between $223 and $260.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears at the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/7b8d1294-a610-4def-a971-a19f736dc39a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flat 20-day EMA ($0.63) and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If the price closes below the moving averages, the XRP/USDT pair could slide to $0.56. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could yank the pair to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the moving averages, the pair will again attempt to rally above $0.67. If that happens, the pair could surge to $0.74. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($66) on Dec. 13 and rose above the overhead resistance at $78 on Dec. 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/b252904d-73dd-4d7f-952e-066d210cb633.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the breakout, the SOL/USDT pair is likely to jump to the psychological level of $100. The upsloping moving averages signal advantage to the bulls but the negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  cautions that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 The crucial support to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA. A break and close below the 20-day EMA could hit the stops of several short-term traders. That may start a pullback to the 50-day SMA ($55).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.51 on Dec. 11 and surged above $0.65 on Dec. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/21af35f3-0b8c-4a29-be47-cd70d1c237af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If buyers maintain the price above $0.65, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could reach $0.70 and subsequently $0.78. However, the risk of a correction looms large as the \uc2 RSI\uc2  has been trading in the overbought territory for the past several days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a drop below $0.61. That may start a pullback toward the 20-day EMA ($0.51). This remains the key level to watch out for because a break below it will indicate a trend change in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Dec. 13 but the bulls are finding it hard to push the price above the $0.10 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/aa2977bc-e25c-4ed3-afd9-0c4b179adc46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the selling could intensify and the DOGE/USDT pair may slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.08). This level may act as a support but if broken, the pair may decline to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that buyers hold the edge. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy the dips. That will increase the likelihood of a rally to $0.11.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-dollar-4-month-low-bitcoin-trader-predicts-10-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US dollar hits 4-month low as Bitcoin trader predicts 10% drop to come}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $34.36 on Dec. 13, indicating that the buyers are not waiting for a deeper correction to buy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/b355aaae-ee67-4ed3-8ca3-50676736fd3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the price above the overhead resistance of $42.89. If they can pull it off, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend. The next target objective on the upside is $50 and then $70.\par \par \uc2 The risk to the upside is that the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is trading in deeply overbought levels. That suggests the pair is vulnerable to a correction or consolidation in the short term. If the price turns down from $42.89, the pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($30.40).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $7.90 on Dec. 14, but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/04f174c1-24c4-4a00-9b5d-f37b42a6ce46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The repeated failure of the bulls to clear the overhead hurdle may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. Although the bulls purchased the dip on Dec. 14, they could not sustain the higher levels. Renewed selling on Dec. 15 is threatening to sink the DOT/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($6.43).\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the sentiment remains positive. The bulls will then again try to propel the pair to $7.90. The short-term trend will turn \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a break below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near $0.89 since Dec. 12, but the bulls have failed to drive the price above the resistance. This suggests that the bears are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/db6b3886-60f8-42e1-b9a3-410d602ed926.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.84) is the important support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that lower levels are being bought. That will improve the prospects of a rally above $0.89. If this resistance is overcome, the MATIC/USDT pair could soar to $1.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls have given up in the short term. That may start a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.78) and thereafter to the solid support at $0.70.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvNjAzNzdiY2EtNTYyYi00ZTk2LTg4ODEtZjM1YTczM2UyYTY4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231215ejcf000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
