of the year. The entire market is reacting to some big economic cues, like the Fed hinting at cutting interest rates and the US consumer price index staying put. Along with some serious money coming in from big-time investors, this good news has given Bitcoin and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\uc2  a nice boost. ETH, in particular, is doing well, almost making up for its earlier losses, now flirting with the $2,300 mark.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Altcoins}}}\uc2  are having their moment too, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/crypto-whales-shift-holdings-cardano-ada-and-solana-sol-surge-pullix-plx-emerges-as-top-contender"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano}}}\uc2  (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) shooting up by more than 30% this past week, thanks to the whales snapping it up while the smaller players are cashing out. This has got everyone talking about the long-awaited altseason. And then there is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/analysts-foresee-ripple-xrp-to-achieve-this-key-milestone-by-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple}}}\uc2  (XRP) whose investors are hoping it will boost its already impressive 60% annual growth when its legal tussle with the SEC wraps up in 2024. Amid all this action, there is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=XRPADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA), a new kid on the block in its presale phase. It is a neatly put-together gaming ecosystem with a transparent, award-winning team behind it. MANIA is all about giving power to the players and making sure everyone benefits. And with some tempting presale discounts and bonuses, the project already has a lot of people excited about what is to come.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: Your Gateway to Exceptional Tokenomics\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Binance Drops Ripple (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Amid Legal Woes\par \par \uc2 In the midst of the altcoin surge, Binance has decided to trim down their menu, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/notice-regarding-the-removal-of-selected-liquidity-pools-on-binance-liquid-swap-2023-12-22-a2eaf4566af94cf98e0af790cb56d436"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ditching a bunch of products}}}\uc2  linked to both Ripple (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). Kicking in on December 22, this big move means delisting of some familiar liquidity pools like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /ETH, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT, XRP/BNB, XRP/BTC, and XRP/ETH. It is all part of their plan to make trading smoother and more efficient, but let's be real, it is not just about streamlining. Binance is under some serious heat from the big guns in the USA, with both the DOJ and the SEC keeping a close eye on them.\par \par \uc2 This year has been a rollercoaster for the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest crypto exchange, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/binance-faces-record-breaking-penalty-as-doj-seeks-4-billion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a whopping $4.3 billion fine}}}\uc2  from the DOJ and their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/binance-chief-cz-to-sign-off-after-4b-settlement-with-doj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CEO stepping down}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/binance-founder-changpeng-cz-zhao-released-on-175m-bond-sentencing-expected-in-february"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 facing trial}}}\uc2 . They are under strict orders now to keep things transparent and monitor their operations closely. Some legal experts, like former SEC agent John Reed Stark, are even whispering that Binance might not make it through this storm.\par \par \uc2 Even despite {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/judge-approves-deal-between-binance-cz-and-us-doj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 settling things}}}\uc2  with the DOJ, Binance still has the SEC to contend with: it seems like the watchdog's lawsuit is marching on, independent of what has already happened. It is a big deal, not just for Binance, but for everyone in the crypto game, especially for those who are into altcoins like Ripple (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) is currently cruising in a tricky spot, trading between its first support level at $0.5373 and the initial resistance at $0.7121. It's an interesting time for XRP, what with the whole altcoin scene buzzing and Binance\u8217\'20\'19s actions affecting its market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BITSTAMP%3AXRPUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The fact that Ripple (XRP) is hanging between its 10-day and 100-day Simple Moving Averages (SMA) at $0.6405 and $0.5675, respectively, suggests a delicate balance \u8211\'20\'13 it's kind of walking a tightrope between short-term optimism and long-term caution. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) sitting at a middling 51.45 and the Average Directional Index (ADI) barely making a murmur at 15.4 hint that XRP isn't quite ready to pick a clear direction just yet.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Next Price Action \u8211\'20\'13 What Indicators Say?\par \par \uc2 If the bulls take the reins and Ripple (XRP) manages to leap over the $0.7121 fence, we could be looking at a nice run up to the $0.8178 mark, or even dreaming big with a dash towards $0.9926. A bit of good news from the legal side or some tailwinds from the overall altcoin lovefest could give it the boost it needs. The MACD at 0.0047 is just poking its head above water and there's a tiny bit of Momentum building at 0.01032, so there's a whiff of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  vibes in the air. But XRP will need more than a gentle push to really break free and fly high.\par \par \uc2 Now, if things take a southward turn and Ripple (XRP) trips below that $0.5373 support, it might find itself on a slippery slope down to $0.4683 or, in a worst-case scenario, plunging to the depths of $0.2935. This kind of drop could be sparked by some not-so-great news from its ongoing legal drama or if the market tide turns against altcoins. And with Binance pulling a few XRP products off the shelf, that's not exactly a confidence booster. The Commodity Channel Index (CCI) at 39.87 isn't screaming 'buy' either, and with the ADI so low, it is like Ripple (XRP) is stuck in a bit of a no-man's-land.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) recent moves in the altcoin rally are pretty interesting when you dive into the numbers. Right now, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is dancing between the closest support at $0.442 and resistance at $0.697.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SMAs tell a story of optimism: the 10-day one sits at $0.646, indicating that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has been on an uptick, but the 100-day one at $0.486 is like a safety net showing there is solid ground below. The RSI at 60.05 is flirting with 'getting too hot' territory, but it is not there yet. And the Stochastic %K at 67.15 backs this up, saying \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not overdoing it.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Next Price Action \u8211\'20\'13 What Indicators Say?\par \par \uc2 Now, if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) decides to put on its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  hat and jumps over that $0.697 barrier, it could set its sights on the next big leap to $0.8. The ADI at 26.55 is kind of whispering that the trend is not super strong, but the CCI at 48.88 suggests there is still room to run without tripping over. And with the MACD at 0.022, there is a hint of momentum that could give \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  the push it needs to finally hit the most ambitious target at $1.055. The Momentum is there, albeit just a smidge at -0.006, but it might be enough to keep the party going, especially with everyone buzzing about the altseason and the asset's recent price bump.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, if Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) hits a bump and tumbles below $0.442, we might see it take a slide towards the second support at $0.29. The ADI not being too high is like saying the party might not last, and if the RSI dips below 50, it's like a signal that the mood's changing. Plus, with Binance shaking things up by cutting \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  products as well, it adds a bit of drama that could sway the market mood, maybe nudging Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) towards those lower support levels. In this scenario, the 100-day SMA could be the hero, stepping in to stop the fall.\par \par \uc2 Closing Thoughts\par \par \uc2 The recent 30% surge of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), sparked by the actions of major investors, has further fueled conversations about the much-awaited altseason. With much more modest gains, Ripple (XRP) is navigating through its own challenges, but investors are keeping a keen eye on its potential growth post-legal settlements. Amid these developments, Binance's decision to streamline its offerings by delisting certain \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  and XRP products adds an extra layer of complexity to the market dynamics: while the future for altcoins like Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Ripple (XRP) seems promising, it is tinged with a sense of caution as the evolving regulatory landscape and market reactions continue to shape their journey.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231215ejcf000jh\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Altcoins\par \b \uc2 Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ), Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) and Polkadot (DOT) soar \u8212\'20\'14 Is it altseason?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Nancy Lubale \par \uc2 1,158 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 