ysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana's (SOL)}}}\uc2  positive outlook is reinforced by its ability to sustain momentum above the critical support level of $65, indicative of a robust and lasting \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. On-chain metrics further underscore this optimism, revealing a consistent increase in the number of active Solana-based addresses since early November. As of December 13th, this figure has climbed to 579.48K. The growing interest in \uc2 Solana\uc2  reflects a broadening usability and reliability of the network.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, \uc2 SOL\uc2  is trading between $71 and $72. The majority of technical indicators are pointing towards an uptrend in unison. The neutrality of the \uc2 RSI\uc2  indicator at 64 suggests that the coin still has some scope for upside maneuvers before it reaches the overbought zone. This same neutrality is supported by the Stochastic %K at 77. Meanwhile, the Momentum at 1.3779 and the MACD Level at 0.9809 indicate a buying action.\par \par \uc2 The analysis of moving averages also suggests a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  tone. The 10-day EMA is at $70.9635, while the 10-day SMA is at $70.8188, indicating a possibility of a short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  run. The longer-term perspective is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well, with the 100-day EMA standing at $69.4810 and the 100-day SMA at $69.8626.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 The strong positivity in most technical indicators points to a high possibility of a further increase in \uc2 SOL\uc2 . If this holds true and the coin maintains its \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum above $70, it will pave the way higher towards the immediate resistance at $82.0378. A break of this level, in turn, will lead the coin to higher levels near $89.1889.\par \par \uc2 However, given the neutral stance of some oscillators, including the RSI and Stochastic, one cannot rule out the possibility of a minor correction. In case \uc2 SOL\uc2  fails to hold above $70 and starts moving in a downward trajectory, it may encounter immediate support at $63.4331. The next downside target can be found at $51.9795.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par \uc2 Based on data from IntoTheBlock, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  shows promising signs for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook. The In/Out of the Money ratio stands at 58%, suggesting that the majority of holders, at the current price, are in profit and are unlikely to part ways with their assets anytime soon. Adding to the optimistic picture is the Bid-Ask Volume Imbalance indicator, boasting a solid 7.87%, indicating a prevailing volume at the bid price.\par \par \uc2 As of the latest update, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is dancing between $65 and $66. Mirroring \uc2 SOL\uc2 , both the Relative Strength Index at 60 and the Stochastic %K at 47 hover in neutral territory, hinting at some potential upside. Simultaneously, the Momentum indicator at \u8722\'22\'120.007598 is signaling a buy action.\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are painting a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  picture across various time frames. The 10-day EMA at $0.651939 and the 10-day SMA at $0.652151 point towards a rising trend in the short term. Similarly, the longer-term perspective remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with the 100-day EMA at $0.592368 and the 100-day SMA at $0.587852.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 With the good vibes from the technical indicators, it looks like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  quotes are gearing up for a ride to the top. The first stop on this upward journey is set at $0.696801, and if things go really well, we might even see the price shooting up to a cool $0.798593.\par \par \uc2 While the outlook is optimistic, it's essential to remember of the inherent market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The possibility of a temporary pullback should not be overlooked. In the event of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario unfolding, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) quotes could experience a retracement, finding support at the immediate level of $0.545069. A more pronounced decline below this threshold might initiate testing the resilience of the lower support at $0.443277.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The positive mood in the overall crypto market sets the stage for potential growth in major cryptocurrencies. Specifically, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) seem poised for strong upward movements in the days ahead and the longer term, thanks to favorable technical indicators. While some oscillators are showing neutrality, the position of moving averages for both coins suggests a solid \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend. Nonetheless, traders should always remain watchful for potential retracements and keep an eye on the ever-evolving market conditions.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231214ejce000um\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , DOT, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,628 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are trying to rebound off strong support levels, suggesting demand at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has failed to rebound sharply following the fall on Dec. 11, suggesting selling pressure on relief rallies. Glassnode data shows that short-term holders (STHs), entities holding Bitcoin for 155 days or less, sent $1.93 billion worth of Bitcoin to exchanges on Dec. 11 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sodlers-dump-4b-two-days-btc-sales-18-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $2.08 billion on Dec. 12}}}\uc2 . The last time single-day selling crossed the $2 billion mark was way back in June 2022. This shows that speculators are in a hurry to dump their holdings.\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels are attracting buyers. Trading resource Material Indicators suggested that \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional sized\u8221\'20\'1D bids could be seen but added that it was unclear if it was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buy-the-dip-sell-the-rip-btc-price-levels-to-watch-bitcoin-taps-42-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulation or a short-term trading opportunity}}}\uc2  with dips being purchased and rallies being sold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1810334d-d956-4954-88a9-c1cb8d6f0693.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Marcel Pechman analyzed derivatives data and said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-derivatives-data-shows-traders-aiming-for"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin remains on track to hit $50,000}}}\uc2  despite the recent correction. He added that chances of \u8220\'20\'1Ccascading liquidations\u8221\'20\'1D were low as the correction seems to have been \u8220\'20\'1Cprimarily driven by the spot market.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important support levels on Bitcoin that are likely to hold? Could altcoins also start a relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been holding above the 20-day exponential moving average ($40,870), but the bulls have failed to start a strong relief rally. This suggests hesitation to buy at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/f174ddc6-874b-4bbf-8df1-922aef7f5efc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The negative divergence on the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) suggests that the positive momentum could be slowing down. That puts the 20-day EMA at risk of breaking down. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could plummet to the 50-day simple moving average ($37,707).\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $44,700. This level is expected to witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears. If the buyers prevail, the pair could soar to $48,000.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) shallow bounce off the strong support at $2,200 on Dec. 12 suggests a lack of demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0a0a9dd9-2746-4d44-b75a-2f8171e4b9bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to build upon their advantage by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($2,192). If they sustain the lower levels, the selling could accelerate, and the ETH/USDT pair could tumble to the 50-day SMA ($2,029).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rises above $2,250, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair will then try to retest the 52-week high at 2,403. A rally above this resistance could start the next leg of the uptrend to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) price action has formed an inverse head-and-shoulders pattern, which will complete on a break and close above the neckline near $275.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ad4c01d5-802c-488a-9ea2-19b1c39e3b2d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($238) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. The price could reach the neckline, where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense. If bulls overcome this barrier, the BNB/USDT pair could start a new up move toward the pattern target of $333.\par \par \uc2 Any dip from the current level is likely to find support at the moving averages. A break below the moving averages will suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. The pair may then tumble to the vital support at $223.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to stall XRP\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) pullback at the 50-day SMA ($0.62) on Dec. 11, but they could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.63).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/b90c1908-ec1a-4824-ad4a-9f9b84a07623.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The selling resumed on Dec. 13, and the price fell below the 50-day SMA. Sellers will try to tug the price to the critical support at $0.56. This level is likely to witness solid buying by the bulls. The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Buyers will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat after they push the price above $0.67. The XRP/USDT pair could thereafter climb to the overhead resistance at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($64.46) on Dec. 11, but the bulls could not sustain the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9a505458-7d65-4bce-bfa2-1355a4895049.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears sold near $72 and again pulled the price to the 20-day EMA on Dec. 13. The negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. If the price plunges below the 20-day EMA, the selling could accelerate, and the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($53.73).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, it will indicate that the bulls continue to defend the 20-day EMA with vigor. The pair may then rise to $78.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is consolidating its gains between $0.65 and the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.51, indicating that dips are being purchased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/7b8b4d99-f88b-4c19-8f73-1c989f575541.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. The bulls will again try to shove the price above $0.65. If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could start the next leg of the uptrend toward $0.70 and then $0.78.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to yank the price below $0.51 and the crucial support at the 20-day EMA ($0.47).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance of $0.11 on Dec. 11 and dipped to the 20-day EMA ($0.09) on Dec. 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9117cf06-1018-4ce6-94b6-9a680f607e2f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to overcome the obstacle at $0.11. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.14 and later to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.08) and subsequently to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-cardano-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Why is Cardano price down today?}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls propelled Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $38 on Dec. 11 and 12, but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/d0aec096-9335-4184-9f9b-2e353e8e4685.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 That resulted in a pullback on Dec. 13, but a positive sign is that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $34.36. Buyers have again pushed the price above $38. If the rebound sustains, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the high at $42.89.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price fails to remain above $38, it will suggest that bears continue to view the rallies as a selling opportunity. A drop below $34.36 may open the downside target to the 20-day EMA ($28.22).\par \par \uc2 Polkadot price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rally stalled just below the overhead resistance of $7.90 on Dec. 9, indicating profit-booking by short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/61793810-1a4e-467e-96de-e29f3b1846f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AdotUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($6.19) on Dec. 11, but the bulls could not overcome the barrier at $7.36. That suggests bears are active at higher levels. Sellers will attempt to pull the DOT/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA, which remains the key level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 A bounce off the 20-day EMA indicates that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the hurdle at $7.90. On the contrary, a break below the 20-day EMA could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($5.35).\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) rise above $0.89 on Dec. 8 was short-lived as the bears pulled the price back below the level on Dec. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/7520a3f3-330e-465c-8793-6b93a76c67ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers tried to push the price back above $0.89 on Dec. 12, but the bears held their ground. Sellers are trying to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.83). If they do that, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction toward $0.70.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the short term if the price turns up sharply from the current level and rises above $0.89. That will indicate solid buying at lower levels. The pair may then climb to $0.95 and subsequently to $1.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvM2RmNTg5ZjEtZGZjOS00Yzg4LWEzYjQtMGM3OTcwNjQzNjc5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231213ejcd000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
