\par\par \b \uc2 Charts Suggest Ripple (XRP) Could Rally 85%, But Pullix (PLX) & Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ) Could Surge Higher\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 634 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 December 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) on the Way To $33}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Set For 580% Price Surge}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Final Thoughts}}}\par \par \uc2 According to renowned analysts, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  could see an 85% increase in the coming weeks. However, Cardano and Pullix have been predicted to see an even higher price growth in the coming weeks. Keep reading to learn more about ERC20 tokens.\par \par \uc2 Market Analyst AlanSantana Forecasts 85% Rally for XRP (XRP)\par \par \uc2 Market analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/lamatrades1111/status/1734278435801862334?ref_src=twsrc%5Egoogle%7Ctwcamp%5Eserp%7Ctwgr%5Etweet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alan Santana recently discussed}}}\uc2  the potential price movements of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP). According to his analysis, the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  price could increase ranging from 85% to 120%, depending on its correction path. On the TradingView platform, Santana explored two possible correction scenarios for the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  coin.\par \par \uc2 He emphasized that the ongoing positive trend and market wave would be the main factors driving the increase in prices. Looking forward, Santana considered the six-month outlook for the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  price. He suggested that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  price could range between $0.73 and $0.94, similar to the highs observed in July.\par \par \uc2 Santana introduced two potential retracement scenarios. The first one envisioned the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  coin dropping to approximately $0.51 before rising 85%. In the second correction path, XRP could decline to around $0.43. This would lead to a 120% rally.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) on the Way To $33\par \par \uc2 A well-known market expert, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/TylerSCrypto/status/1733286733788107151?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Tyler Strejilevich, has suggested}}}\uc2  that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) might experience a significant increase in the coming weeks. The last time the Cardano coin displayed such a positive weekly trend was in November 2020.\par \par \uc2 The Cardano price increased by a whopping 6,000% over the next 66 weeks, as Strejilevichpointed out. Cardano might reach $33.55 in the next 66 weeks if we see a similar pattern following the positive trend.\par \par \uc2 As a result, the Cardano coin may reach the expected price of $33.55 by March 15, 2025. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has fluctuated between $0.398945 and $0.631526 on the weekly chart with a 32.0% gain. The token technical indicator is currently \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  action.\par \par \uc2 Pullix (PLX) Set For 580% Price Surge\par \par \uc2 Pullix (PLX) has unveiled a new trading platform set to revolutionize crypto trading. The platform seeks to put an end to the days of slow transactions, large fees, and long processing times. Pullix's platform addresses these prevalent concerns with the DeFi market and alsooperates a user-friendly platform.\par \par \uc2 To protect users' assets, the exchange has implemented strong security infrastructure including cold storage and multi-signature wallets. Pullix's approach to passive revenue production via its native PLX token is also a key aspect.\par \par \uc2 Users can contribute to the liquidity of the exchange platform. They will receive a fixed interest rate ranging from 8% to 18% in exchange. This feature ensures that users have a consistent stream of money. It also enhances the platform's ability to enable market-making. As a result, the PLX token is critical in unlocking the potential for passive income generation.\par \par \uc2 Luckily, PLX tokens can be purchased at a rate of $0.042 per token. Notably, the presale tokens are limited in quantity. Besides, experts in the DeFi market foresee a potential increase of 580% in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 Final Thoughts\par \par \uc2 The ERC20 tokens \u8211\'20\'13 \uc2 Ripple\uc2 , Cardano, and Pullix are a must-have for investors, given the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  predictions for analysts. Traders and crypto enthusiasts looking for a low-priced token with potential can go for Pullix.\par \par \uc2 For more information regarding Pullix\u8217\'20\'19s presale see links below:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pr.pullix.io/11qsxm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Visit Pullix}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linktr.ee/pullix"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join The Pullix Communities}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231213ejcd000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Buy the dip, sell the rip? BTC price levels to watch as Bitcoin taps $42K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,026 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bulls see a welcome bounce to counter the BTC price dip as traders line up key price levels to watch.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) faces an uphill struggle to reignite its uptrend after its biggest one-day losses of 2023.\par \par \uc2 The largest cryptocurrency continues to claw back lost ground after falling to lows of $40,200 after the Dec. 10 weekly close, the latest data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscription.cointelegraph.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/4b1819ea-aac6-4054-80af-88aa524f19ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour chart. Source: \uc2 TradingView\par \par \uc2 With BTC price action taking a break from relentless gains \u8212\'20\'14 one which many argue was overdue \u8212\'20\'14 new key support and resistance levels are coming into play.\par \par \uc2 The coming days are already set to offer plenty of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/300m-crypto-long-liquidations-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 potential \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  triggers}}}\uc2 . United States macro data releases begin on Dec. 12, with the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  interest rate decision and commentary from Chair \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  following a day later.\par \par \uc2 The stage is set for a showdown that may involve more than crypto markets.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at some of the popular BTC price lines in the sand now on the radar for traders and analysts as Bitcoin narrowly preserves the $40,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Bollinger Bands: BTC bounced \u8220\'20\'1Cwhere it was supposed to\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While painful for late longs, the 7.5% BTC price dip which followed the weekly close offered a form of reset for frantic crypto markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  has now dropped 7.5% today, which would be the single biggest 1-day drop in 2023.\par \par \uc2 It has overtaken the drop in March during the banking collapse; -6.2%, bottomed out at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 Also dropped -7.2% in August when Bitcoin bottomed out at $26,000. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/WFYiyURO3J"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/WFYiyURO3J}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 James Van Straten (@jimmyvs24) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/jimmyvs24/status/1734295809926070325?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 This was needed, consensus agrees, as unchecked upside typically results in a violent reaction the longer it continues.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CVery overextended, so a pullback was due,\u8221\'20\'1D \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2 , creator of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bollinger-bands-how-to-use-in-crypto-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bollinger Bands}}}\b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  indicator, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/bbands/status/1734330370710175904"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  in a reaction on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CStopped right were it was supposed to. That doesn\u8217\'20\'19t happen too often. Now we look to see if support can hold.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/2dc46995-5b58-4765-844e-786087bb1f46.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart with Bollinger Bands data. Source: \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2 /TrendSpider\par \par \uc2 Bollinger referred to Bollinger Bands data, with an accompanying chart showing, among other things, the forcefulness of the latest upside within the context of broader recent BTC price strength.\par \par \uc2 On daily timeframes, the dip took Bitcoin straight to the middle band within the Bollinger channel, making the correction something of a textbook move and cause for optimism going forward.\par \par \uc2 The air is getting a bit thin up here, but all we see as of now are signs of strength. We are outside both the daily and weekly BBs with no divergences. The last controlling formation was the 2 bar reversal at the middle BB completed on 21 Nov. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTCUSD&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTCUSD}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/B4ZU3vpTvV"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/B4ZU3vpTvV}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 \uc2 John Bollinger\uc2  (@bbands) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/bbands/status/1732157248812789982?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 5, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Bollinger warned of increasingly constrictive conditions the week prior, which could be a warning over a local top in advance.\par \par \uc2 Large Bitcoin buyers may play \u8220\'20\'1Cbuy the dip, sell the rip\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Looking at the behavior of large-volume traders, some commentators see encouraging signs after the open interest flush at the hands of the dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1734276265249505566/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Uploading}}}\uc2  a print of BTC/USDT order book liquidity on the largest global exchange \uc2 Binance\uc2  overnight, trading resource Material Indicators revealed a new band of support at $38,500.\par \par \uc2 While lower than both $40,000 and this week\u8217\'20\'19s bottom, Material Indicators suggested that \u8220\'20\'1Cinstitutional sized\u8221\'20\'1D bids could now be returning \u8212\'20\'14 but there could be a caveat.\par \par \uc2 Accompanying analysis concluded that \u8220\'20\'1Cit\u8217\'20\'19s not yet clear whether they are legitimately starting to accumulate at these levels or just buying dips and selling rips.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAfter all, we have a Fed Rate Hike decision coming this week and # JPow\u8217\'20\'19s speeches are typically good for some \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D it added.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/2efb4529-fb48-4563-b386-40b06caa322c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT order book data for \uc2 Binance\uc2  (Dec. 11). Source: Material Indicators/X\par \par \uc2 Continuing on Dec. 12, popular trader Skew likewise considered the odds of manipulation among larger players.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSeeing a bit of change in the mindset of large spot players whom were actively chasing price before,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/52kskew/status/1734430888895864996"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  X followers about the Binance order book.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCurrent mindset seems to be buy the dip & sell the rip till bid depth & liquidity improves for large capital to return.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/2ab08e43-f4a0-440a-a9a3-73ee29927188.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT order book data for \uc2 Binance\uc2  (Dec. 12). Source: Skew/X\par \par \uc2 Skew put the key BTC price areas to watch at $38,000\u8211\'20\'13$40,000 and $44,000\u8211\'20\'13$45,000, respectively.\par \par \uc2 Analyst: Bitcoin will greet yearly close in \u8220\'20\'1Cnew range\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In terms of major support, popular trader Ali additionally noted the range around $38,000 as a formidable barrier against major downside.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-11-spx-dxy-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 12/11: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , DOGE, AVAX}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn case of a deeper correction, Bitcoin finds solid support between $37,150 and $38,360. This zone is backed by 1.52 million addresses holding 534,000 $BTC,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ali_charts/status/1734359407394254963"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showed}}}\uc2  alongside data.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAlso, watch out for two resistance walls that could keep the BTC uptrend at bay: one at $43,850 and another at $46,400.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/251e529a-74c1-47e0-ae50-48e5e748aaf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin support and resistance volume data. Source: Ali/X\par \par \uc2 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, founder and CEO of MN Trading, meanwhile flagged a floor zone slightly lower at $36,500.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, he believes, should end 2023 in a \u8220\'20\'1Cnew range.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crucial levels to hold for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  are, on higher timeframes, $36,500-38,000.\par \par \uc2 With this correction, we'll see bounces coming from $39,500-40,000 back to the $42K+ mark. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is likely going to create a new range before the end of the year. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/bmQIREzEW8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/bmQIREzEW8}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe (@CryptoMichNL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1734298254584496603?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 11, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvMTkzMjE2NDMtZjcwMy00MmQxLWI0MmQtMDE3MTIzYzkyMjRlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231212ejcc0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/11: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,686 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are trading down, but price corrections are a part of every healthy bull market.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) closed last week with gains of 9.55%, but started the new week on a weak note, falling near $40,500. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/300m-crypto-long-liquidations-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sharp correction in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  also caused liquidations in several altcoins. According to CoinGlass data, cross-crypto long liquidations for Dec. 11 were more than $300 million.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall does not change the trend in Bitcoin and altcoins, as corrections are a part and parcel of any uptrend. Generally, vertical rallies are followed by sharp pullbacks, which shake out the weaker hands and allow long-term investors to buy more at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/06c3f8e4-7180-403c-85db-79098340d5d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The corrections are unlikely to stretch longer due to several \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  catalysts in 2024. Analysts expect one or more Bitcoin exchange-traded funds to receive regulatory approval in January, which could be a game changer. That will be followed by Bitcoin halving in April, and finally, expectations of a rate cut by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  could boost risky assets. \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  anticipates the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/federal-reserve-2024-rate-cut-cperfect-catalyst-btc-halving"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fed to start cutting rates}}}\uc2  in the third quarter of 2024.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels that could arrest the fall in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully held the S&P 500 Index (SPX) above the breakout level of 4,541 for the past several days. This suggests that the buyers are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/695443c5-0513-44b1-b4e3-c93f1583cfa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day exponential moving average (4,531) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers pierce the overhead resistance at 4,650, the index could pick up momentum and surge to 4,800.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plunges below the 20-day EMA. That will indicate aggressive selling at higher levels. The index may then tumble to the 50-day simple moving average (4,393).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) bounced off the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of 102.55 on Nov. 29, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/55469ecc-854a-4f1d-8a3f-ec973838ace8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The relief rally has reached the 20-day EMA (104), where the bears are mounting a stiff defense. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to dip much below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 There is a minor resistance at 104.50, but if this level is scaled, the index could rise to the 50-day SMA (105). The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a range formation in the near term. The strong support on the downside is at 102.46.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s tight consolidation near $44,700 resolved to the downside on Dec. 11. The failure to resume the up-move may have attracted selling by the traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/87562f27-46c2-4492-bf5f-2e627de062ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the price rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($40,708), as seen from the long tail on the candlestick. Buyers will once again try to shove the BTC/USDT pair above $44,700, but the bears may not give up easily. The negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  cautions that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is slowing down.\par \par \uc2 If the price skids below the 20-day EMA, the correction could deepen to the breakout level of $37,980. This level is likely to attract solid buying by the bulls. On the upside, a break and close above $44,700 will indicate that the bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $2,403 on Dec. 9 and plunged below the breakout level of $2,200 on Dec. 11. This suggests that the bulls are rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/b4769a11-2f72-41b6-8869-851fbb0c9161.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed a negative divergence on the \uc2 RSI\uc2 , indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum is weakening. Still, the bulls are trying to vigorously defend the 20-day EMA ($2,186).\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current level, the bulls will again try to resume the uptrend by pushing the ETH/USDT pair above $2,403. If they do that, the pair could rally to $2,500 and later to $3,000.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be invalidated if the price closes below the 20-day EMA. That may deepen the correction to the 50-day SMA ($2,012).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) witnessed an outside-day candlestick pattern on Dec. 11, indicating a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/dd5fd919-488b-4433-8579-8d8615acae27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels. If the price maintains above $239.2, the BNB/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and soar to $265. This level may prove to be a difficult hurdle to cross, but if the buyers succeed, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 The trend will turn in favor of the bears if they sink and sustain the price below $223. The pair may then slump to the pivotal support at $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the $0.67 resistance on Dec. 8, but the bulls could not build upon this breakout on Dec. 9. This suggests selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/84cb1b92-14e2-47b8-a06f-d2cf016ccc0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls again tried to drive the price above $0.67 on Dec. 10, but the bears held their ground. This started a sharp pullback, which dipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.62) on Dec. 11. If the price closes below the 50-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level, it will signal buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to overcome the obstacle at $0.67. If they do that, the pair may travel to $0.74, where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling at the overhead hurdle of $78. The failure to scale this level may have started the pullback on Dec. 11.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/6648bef1-54d1-4769-9501-7c1dfcb073fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair is finding support at the 20-day EMA ($63), indicating that lower levels continue to attract buyers. If bulls sustain the rebound, the pair could retest the high at $78. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a potential rally to the psychological level of $100.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to drag the price below the 20-day EMA. That may start a deeper correction toward the crucial support at $51.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-bitcoin-price-dip-40k-bear-trap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is the Bitcoin price dip toward $40K a bear trap?}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance of $0.60 on Dec. 9 and 10, but they could not maintain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1b9fe55d-d65c-430c-bbb7-905e1499affc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The up-move of the past few days propelled the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought zone, indicating that the rally was overextended in the near term. That may have tempted short-term bulls to book out on their positions, which started the pullback on Dec. 11.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is trying to find support at the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $0.51. If the level holds, buyers will again try to push the price to the local high at $0.65. On the other hand, a break below $0.51 could sink the pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.45).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are posing a strong challenge to Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rally at $0.11, as seen from the long wick on the Dec. 11 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/9f209c84-01ec-4201-992a-b5b1abbacbc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price can pull down to the 20-day EMA ($0.09), which is an important level to watch out for. A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. That increases the possibility of a break above $0.11. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair may jump to $0.15.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a drop below the 20-day EMA will suggest that traders are aggressively booking profits. The pair may then extend the decline to the 50-day SMA ($0.08).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been in a strong uptrend for the past several days. Buyers easily cleared the barrier at $31 on Dec. 9 and reached $38 on Dec. 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1353a2fb-e335-44b8-b303-f0e2324c86bb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The vertical rally pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, signaling that a correction or consolidation is possible in the near term. The price pulled back on Dec. 11, indicating that the short-term traders may be booking profits.\par \par \uc2 If buyers do not allow the price to slip below $31, it will increase the likelihood of a rally above $38. The AVAX/USDT pair could climb to $46 and later to $50. Instead, if the price turns down and plummets below $31, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($25.85).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvNTIxMzJiYjAtNTY4MC00Y2NiLWE3ODQtZjNlMzhjZTk3N2M4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231211ejcb0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
