oin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  saw a dramatic drop to about $40,500, but it's bounced back a bit, hovering over $42,000. This shift has caused a stir, especially with nearly $300 million in long positions getting wiped out. The anticipation surrounding the potential approval of the first US spot Bitcoin ETFs and speculation about possible interest rate cuts by the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  (Fed) have both played a role in this year's momentum for cryptocurrencies. With key events like the US inflation data release and the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s policy meeting on the horizon, the market is rife with suspense, leading to a wary eye on the potential for further dips.\par \par \uc2 Amidst this broader market correction, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/altcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins}}}\uc2 , including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/ethereum"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ), and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), which were partying hard last week, are now nursing a bit of a hangover, with the top 100 digital assets index dropping by 4% \u8211\'20\'13 the most significant decline since late November. However, it's not all doom and gloom in the crypto world: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ADASOL"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2  (MANIA), a cleverly crafted presale project in the gaming world, offers a hopeful perspective. As big economic events are on the horizon, it shines a light on the innovative spirit of digital finance, blending the DAO governance and tech smarts with the pro team and big dreams. Having the player-first approach and exciting presale perks, MANIA could be the next big thing in the space where anything can happen.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: Fusing Cutting-Edge Tech with Community Strength\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain fu