}\uc2  underlies the token's renewed prominence in the cryptocurrency market. Furthermore, the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) ecosystem has recently seen over $100 million influx, boosting its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total value locked}}}\uc2  (TVL) to $361 million, which surpasses major networks, including Bitcoin, and reflects its growing influence in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi}}}\uc2  domain.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 Technically, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is navigating between its first support level at $0.442 and the first resistance level at $0.698. The coin's price hovers slightly below the 10-day Simple Moving Average (SMA) of $0.581, but comfortably above the 100-day SMA of $0.433, indicating a positive medium-term outlook.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The Relative Strength Index (RSI) at 54.62 suggests a neutral sentiment, neither overbought, nor oversold. However, the Stochastic %K at 29.457 leans towards oversold territory, hinting at potential buying opportunities. The Average Directional Index at 46.956, paired with a slightly negative Commodity Channel Index of -34.271 and a marginal MACD level of 0.026, portrays a market in consolidation, awaiting clear directional cues.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  case, should Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) maintain its current momentum and break past the $0.698 resistance, the pathway opens towards the $0.801 and potentially the $1.057 mark, aligning with its recent uptick in trading volume and crowd interest. Such a move would likely be supported by sustained positive developments within the Cardano ecosystem, including its expanding range of DeFi solutions. Conversely, in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook, if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  fails to hold above the $0.442 support, it could lead to a retest of lower levels at $0.289 or even $0.033. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn might be influenced by broader market sentiment or a shift in investor confidence.\par \par \uc2 Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ): Defying Odds with \uc2 DeFi\uc2 's Return\par \par \uc2 Recently, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) has achieved new local highs, buoyed by sustained buying interest from whale addresses. The rally pushed \uc2 SOL\uc2  past the critical $60 mark, gaining momentum as it soared above $65, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/solana-sol-fires-up-with-price-surge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mirroring}}}\uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends of Bitcoin and Ethereum. This rally peaked near $78 before the asset experienced a slight pullback. This surge in price not only marked the token's recovery from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2022/12/solana-sol-investors-hit-hardest-after-ftx-collapse-orbeon-protocol-orbn-and-cardano-ada-strong-hedges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTX collapse}}}\uc2 , but also indicated a rebound from the losses incurred during the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2022/05/market-crumbles-as-lfg-moves-to-defend-ust-peg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terra debacle}}}\uc2 . The resurgence is partly attributed to the DeFi traders flocking back to the Solana ecosystem, particularly towards platforms like Kamino, and the anticipation surrounding the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/jito-airdrop-gives-225m-worth-of-free-tokens-to-solana-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 airdrop}}}\uc2  in Jito tokens adding to the appeal of Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) among investors.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 From a technical standpoint, \uc2 SOL\uc2  is trading between its first support level at $42.09 and the first resistance level at $72.33. The asset's SMAs provide a mixed sentiment with the 10-day one at $67.04 suggesting a short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend, while the 100-day one at $36.77 indicates a longer-term recovery phase.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=COINBASE%3ASOLUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The RSI at 61.49 leans towards overbought conditions, whereas the Stochastic %K stands high at 76.74, hinting at potential overextension. The ADI at 52.8 confirms the strength of the current trend, and the CCI at 110.78 underscores the burgeoning buying pressure. Moreover, the MACD level at 5.47 reflects the ongoing positive momentum.\par \par \uc2 Solana (SOL) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 In a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario, \uc2 Solana\uc2  (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ) could break past its immediate resistance at $72.33, aiming for the next target at $85.38. A sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend could even see it challenge the most distant barrier at $115.62, particularly if the anticipated airdrop and continuous DeFi engagement fuel investor enthusiasm. Conversely, in a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn, \uc2 SOL\uc2  might retreat towards its first support level at $42.09. A break below this defense line could see a further slide to the second threshold at $24.9, should the broader market sentiment sour or the anticipated developments in the \uc2 Solana\uc2  ecosystem fail to materialize or disappoint the market expectations.\par \par \uc2 Final Words\par \par \uc2 As the crypto sector navigates through its latest correction, the spotlight shines on the resilience and potential of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and Solana (\uc2 SOL\uc2 ). Despite the overall market's ups and downs, the journey of these tokens is filled with both promise and perils: \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  teeters between cautious optimism and the potential for new highs, contingent on the positive momentum within its ecosystem; and \uc2 SOL\uc2 , while exhibiting strength, also signals the need for caution against overextension in the crypto landscape where \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and external factors can swiftly change the game.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231211ejcb000ji\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Is the Bitcoin price dip toward $40K a bear trap?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Allen Scott \par \uc2 599 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The price of Bitcoin is finally pulling back after failing to break $44,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price finally witnessed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/why-is-bitcoin-price-down-today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a significant 7% pullback}}}\uc2  on Dec. 11 as multiple {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-levels-bitcoin-whales-lure-market-42k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicators flashed sell signals}}}\uc2  and traders booked profits. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ability to hold above $42,000 will determine whether this crash is a buy-the-dip opportunity or a general market reversal.\par \par \uc2 Short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  or big trend reversal?\par \par \uc2 The sharp BTC \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  observed on the daily chart corresponds with a sudden 6.5% drawdown and over $300 million long liquidations across the cryptocurrency market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ac9f1521-d83e-4a4a-9ec5-8cd992c7a3f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hr candle chart. Source: \uc2 Bitstamp\par \par \uc2 Zooming to the longer 1-day candle timeframe, however, this movement appears as a minor retracement in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-prepare-next-crypto-bull-market-5-simple-steps"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more extensive \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  trend}}}\uc2  established over the past few months. Moreover, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 relative strength index (RSI)}}}\uc2  has retreated into neutral territory below 70.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1e3fecc2-026e-4fc1-a1fe-8c44354a216b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart. Source: \uc2 Bitstamp\par \par \uc2 Last week\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-6-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-avax-link-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-6-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -doge-avax-link-ton}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-6-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-avax-link-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 analysis confirmed the strong uptrend}}}\uc2  that Bitcoin has been in, with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/early-bull-market-bitcoin-price-1st-ever-weekly-golden-cross"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 significant momentum observed}}}\uc2  after the price breached the $40,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 This context suggests that the recent dip could be a short-term fluctuation within a continuing upward trend rather than a general trend reversal, though more downside or sideways actions should not be ruled out for the days ahead.\par \par \uc2 Key BTC price levels to watch\par \par \uc2 As noted earlier, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-levels-bitcoin-whales-lure-market-42k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 important levels to watch include}}}\uc2  $31,860, $28,050, and $25,200, which have been significant since 2021.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dominance-likely-top-btc-price-eyeing-45k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin dominance threatens \u8216\'20\'18likely top\u8217\'20\'19 despite BTC price eyeing $45K}}}\par \par \uc2 Therefore, the fact that the BTC price has not approached these levels and the recent uptrend has been strong enough to surpass minor resistance levels with ease supports the argument that the current price action is within the bounds of a healthy correction rather than a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend reversal.\par \par \uc2 Healthy corrections in a bull market\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/market-correction-vs-bear-market-key-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/explained/market-correction-vs-bear-market-key-differences-explained}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/market-correction-vs-bear-market-key-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Corrections are considered a normal part}}}\uc2  of every upward trend. They are typically seen as healthy for the market because they allow for consolidation and can {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-11-15-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-matic-link-ton"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shake out weak hands}}}\uc2 , as demonstrated by the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid-November.\par \par \uc2 If followed by a strong bounce, the current drop would indicate that the market is still in a positive trend and traders are buying the dip.\par \par \uc2 Hence, the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 price drop\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be viewed in the context of the longer-term trend, and it seems more indicative of a temporary dip within a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  phase rather than a complete trend reversal, at least so far.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/af456e68-78bb-454d-bd2a-79d54f9611ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC price drawdown from all-time high. Source: Glassnode\par \par \uc2 But, one must also consider that previous Bitcoin bull markets have all seen pullbacks of well over 20%, as shown above by the long drawdown wicks during each bull market phase.\par \par \uc2 In other words, Bitcoin could still drop much further without halting the overall uptrend. However, its ability to hold above $42,000 will further strengthen the argument that this was just a short-term dip and sentiment remains overall \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvZDE