\par\par \b \uc2 ChatGPT Names 3 Cryptocurrencies Set to Explode Before Christmas\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 833 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 December 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania: A Rising Star in the Crypto World}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ): A Resilient Contender}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH): The Whale's Choice}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP): Gearing Up for a Major Leap}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Conclusion}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is currently experiencing a dynamic phase, with significant movements among various players including Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Ethereum (ETH), Ripple (XRP), and the emerging {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ChatGPTNames"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The halt in Bitcoin's (BTC) rally is giving way to altcoins like Ether (ETH) and \uc2 Solana\uc2  to surge to new heights. This shift in market dynamics suggests a growing interest in alternative cryptocurrencies, setting the stage for potentially explosive growth as we approach Christmas.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania: A Rising Star in the Crypto World\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now \u8211\'20\'13 Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): A Resilient Contender\par \par \uc2 Recently, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/cardanos-ada-bullish-symphony-investors-wonder-can-the-music-last"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  received a significant update to its wallet. This update, introducing key changes and fixes; enhancing overall functionality and user experience, proves crucial in maintaining Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) relevance: it bolsters competitiveness amidst the ever-evolving crypto market.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price range currently fluctuates between $0.303 and $0.586, with a 10-Day Moving Average of $0.412 and a 100-Day Moving Average of $0.303. The support levels are at $0.106 and $0.231, while resistance levels are found at $0.481 and $0.606.\par \par \uc2 The recent wallet update, combined with consideration of historical price patterns, suggests potential for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). Yet amidst an intensely competitive market it grapples to sustain momentum, its future hinges on two factors: consistent innovation and continuous user acquisition.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH): The Whale's Choice\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/ethereum-eth-looking-ready-to-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum (ETH)}}}\uc2  has been a standout performer in the recent market rally. A dormant whale has resurfaced, moving a significant amount of Ethereum (ETH) to an exchange. This activity indicates heightened interest and potential liquidity movements in the Ethereum (ETH) market.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) price range is currently between $1841 and $2346. The 10-Day Moving Average is at $2203, and the 100-Day Moving Average is at $1793. Ethereum (ETH) faces resistance at $2347 and $2705, with support levels at $1272 and $1630.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum (ETH) position as a leading cryptocurrency suggests continued growth potential, especially with increasing institutional interest. However, large whale movements could lead to \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , requiring cautious optimism from traders.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP): Gearing Up for a Major Leap\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) edges towards surpassing BNB in market capitalization, a sign of increasing investor confidence in Ripple (XRP).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/12/ripple-xrp-beats-68-of-altcoins-but-sees-december-bull-run-waver-whats-the-catch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  price range is between $0.538 and $0.711. The 10-Day Moving Average is at $0.625, and the 100-Day Moving Average is $0.558. Support levels are found at $0.298 and $0.470, with resistance levels at $0.815 and $0.988.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  future of Ripple (XRP) potentially outpacing BNB suggests promising prospects, however, its growth trajectory may face impacts from market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and regulatory challenges. The coin's long-term prospects appear positive due to its adaptability and burgeoning market presence.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The impending closure of the year ushers in a flurry of activity in the cryptocurrency market, highlighting potential from several key players. Specifically Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Ethereum (ETH), Ripple (XRP), and emerging newcomer ScapesMania spearhead this dynamic shift.\par \par \uc2 With its innovative approach, ScapesMania is carving out a niche; promising a bright future as it gears up for an official listing. Meanwhile, leveraging a recent wallet update, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) reinforces its position: resilient and ever-evolving in the market. Furthermore, Ethereum (ETH), drawing significant whale activity, maintains its preferred choice status among seasoned investors, striking a balance between growth potential and market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Reflecting burgeoning investor confidence despite potential regulatory headwinds, Ripple (XRP), on the edge of surpassing BNB in market capitalization, is preparing for a significant leap.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231210ejca000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Why is the crypto market up today?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Kyle White \par \uc2 875 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins see record inflows as trading volumes and a marketwide rally reflect improving \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is up today as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) and numerous altcoins rallied higher. The price breakout resulted in the total market cap reaching a year-to-date high of $1.59 trillion on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/7163dbdf-40a8-4afb-9841-e4c698a53886.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto performance map. Coin360\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s examine three major factors influencing today\u8217\'20\'19s crypto market rally.\par \par \uc2 Risk assets respond to this week\u8217\'20\'19s jobs data\par \par \uc2 The crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s price gains in the past 24-hours follow the \uc2 U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics\uc2  employment report. The report beat expectations, with the unemployment rate recording lower than the forecast of 3.9% by 0.2%.\par \par \uc2 The strong employment report has led analysts to push back the expectation of interest rate cuts.\par \par \uc2 JUST IN: Interest rate futures shift from showing rate cuts beginning in March 2024 to May 2024 after jobs report.\par \par \uc2 Prior to the November jobs report, markets saw a 60% chance of rate cuts beginning in March 2024.\par \par \uc2 Odds of rate cuts beginning in January 2024 fell from 16% to 6%.\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/hFYFLVP5xv"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/hFYFLVP5xv}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 The Kobeissi Letter (@KobeissiLetter) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KobeissiLetter/status/1733139724485734569?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 December 8, 2023}}}\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty in the market is potentially boosting sentiment for the crypto market, according to Austin Alexander the co-founder of LayerTwo Labs,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s also important to put Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s performance against the backdrop of a broader economic situation that feels less and less certain. There\u8217\'20\'19s a tremendous amount of geopolitical uncertainty at the moment, and then there\u8217\'20\'19s the issue of massive debts taken on by the United States and a number of other developed economies. As a result of these issues, Bitcoin increasingly is regarded as an alternative asset that offers a hedge. We saw evidence of this during the banking crisis that started in March when Bitcoin actually soared.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The improvement in sentiment is also reflected by the Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-this-week-fear-26k-key-5-things"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fear and Greed Index}}}\uc2 , which shows \u8216\'20\'18greed\u8217\'20\'19 up 6 points, hitting a monthly high.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/785d1afd-f750-4527-bfef-6cd3ae1222c6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin Fear & Greed Index. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 Institutional investor inflow to crypto hits a record high\par \par \uc2 The first sign of institutional interest in crypto outside of Bitcoin started on Nov. 9, when \uc2 BlackRock\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s plans for a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-enters-race-spot-ethereum-etf-nasdaq-filing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spot Ether}}}\uc2  exchange-traded fund (ETF) were confirmed through a 19b-4 form filing submitted to the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). After the confirmation, Ether price surged 12.2%, outperforming Bitcoin for the first time in months.\par \par \uc2 On Dec. 8, \uc2 VanEck\uc2  predicted that quarter one of 2024 will see a U.S. recession at the same time as a spot \b \highlight22\uc2 ETF approval\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While they do not believe Ether (ETH) will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-reach-high-fourth-quarter-2024-binance-lose-leadership-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overtake Bitcoin price}}}\uc2 , this scenario may bring in over $2.4 billion in the first quarter alone.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-will-drive-adoption-in-2024-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 growing institutional investor}}}\uc2  interest is improving sentiment across the market. Institutional investor inflows into the crypto market suggest that Ether\u8217\'20\'19s outperformance is not just a one-off event and could continue in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Despite the SEC continuing to delay spot ETF applications, they are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-technical-details-spot-crypto-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 actively discussing}}}\uc2  key technical details with applicants.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/hong-kong-game-company-90m-btc-eth-china-uae-cbdc-deal-asia-express/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HK game firm to buy $100M crypto for treasury, China/UAE CBDC deal: Asia Express}}}\par \par \uc2 Over the last 10 weeks, there was a total of $1.76 billion in inflows, which is the highest on record since October 2021. The record inflows also produced net flows of Ether, hitting $10 million for the first time this year. The inflows are not limited to Bitcoin and Ether, with \uc2 Solana\uc2  seeing $143 million flow from institutional investors in 2023.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/c716640a-ae94-47ac-9920-a4cf82e407a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market inflows by asset. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Total value locked and trading volumes spike\par \par \uc2 The positive sentiment in the crypto market is rippling throughout the ecosystem. Bitcoin and altcoin market trading volume reached $44.1 billion on Nov. 9. Although the high for daily trading volume in December was $37.6 billion on Dec. 6, it remains above September levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/cc75e124-4452-4f33-958e-930aaa650097.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market trading volume. Source: Newhedge\par \par \uc2 Trading volume is not the only metric that remains elevated. On Dec. 4, the total value locked ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/what-is-total-value-locked-tvl-in-crypto-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TVL}}}\uc2  ) in DeFi platforms hit a multi-month high, reaching its highest level since June 3. The TVL increase to $52.35 billion marks a 3.53% increase over a 24-hour period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/fcced84a-9047-4f64-82d7-98c36de90a95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market TVL. Source: DefiLlama\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/early-bull-market-bitcoin-price-1st-ever-weekly-golden-cross"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Early bull market\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin price preps 1st ever weekly golden cross}}}\par \par \uc2 There is optimism surrounding the increase in volume and TVL, which helped break November\u8217\'20\'19s 2-year losing streak. December has mirrored November\u8217\'20\'19s performance since 2015 and is witnessing 14.67% gains on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/e1a01086-22b2-4433-99b0-3344dddce187.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin returns by month. Source: Newhedge\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin and altcoins still have overhanging {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jp-morgan-ceo-jamie-dimon-hypocrite-crypto-criminals-shut-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risk events}}}\uc2  that could impact the price, the increasing institutional interest and improved trading volumes are strong indications the bear market may have ended.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMTAvYTYzMzIzMGQtM2Y5YS00NzQ5LThiYWItMDE3YzRiOTQzNWEwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231208ejc8000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, MATIC\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,674 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s brief pullback to $43,500 this week appears to have not altered the possibility of a rally to $48,000 in the near term.\par \par \uc2 This week Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) price saw a shallow pullback, but the intra-day rally to the $44,000 level is an indication that the bulls are not hurrying to close their positions. Data from the popular HODL Waves metric shows that investors who purchased Bitcoin between December 2020 and December 2021 have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hodl-waves-2020-bull-market-buyers-supply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sitting on their coins}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Investors have not been selling into strength because they anticipate higher levels in the future. Asset manager \uc2 VanEck\uc2  said in its crypto predictions for 2024 that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-reach-high-fourth-quarter-2024-binance-lose-leadership-vaneck"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin would make a new all-time high}}}\uc2 , buoyed by the \u8220\'20\'1Cpolitical events and regulatory shifts following a U.S. presidential election.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1bfae91b-08d3-4b14-993d-5e013f95e8f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally of the past few days has also attracted investors to select altcoins, such as Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ). Research firm Santiment remains positive on the prospects of Bitcoin. It said on Dec. 7 that if FUD increases, Bitcoin could surge to $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin find buyers at lower levels and resume its charge to $48,000, or will the action shift to altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $44,500 on Dec. 5, indicating profit-booking by short-term traders. Pullbacks are usually shallow in strong uptrends and do not last long because the bulls eagerly buy the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/462fb3eb-d4be-40c2-b65c-a2b2ea96a374.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $44,500, it will signal the start of the next leg of the journey toward $48,000. Sellers are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $44,500, the first support on the downside is at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $41,862. If this level cracks, the BTC/USDT pair may plunge to the 20-day exponential moving average ($39,868). Buyers will have to defend this level if they want to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum intact.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the breakout level of $2,200 on Dec. 6, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that buyers are attempting to flip $2,200 into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/70c9c4f4-4afa-4675-a4eb-af0a933c2cd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern when it broke out of $2,200. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup has a target objective of $3,400. However, it is unlikely to be a straight dash higher. Sellers will try to halt the advance near $2.500 and again at $3,000.\par \par \uc2 The critical support zone for the downside is between $2,200 and the 20-day EMA ($2,147). If the price skids below this zone, it may trap several aggressive bulls, resulting in long liquidation. That could start a steep correction toward $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) remains stuck inside the $223 to $239 range, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/cbf1b41e-d53d-4357-bb03-f861f752be02.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($233) and will try to overcome the barrier at $239. If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair is likely to pick up momentum and jump toward the overhead obstacle at $265. A break and close above this level will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  inverse head-and-shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 This optimistic view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below $223. That could sink the pair to the critical support at $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on Dec. 6, signaling that lower levels are being purchased. The bulls will next try to push the price above $0.67.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/a5cc4b16-ab6f-460b-bae5-c66632194e18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the sellers are unlikely to give up easily. They will try to mount a stiff resistance at $0.67. If the price turns down from the current level, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to find support at the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the rebound off the 20-day EMA rises above the barrier at $0.67, the XRP/USDT pair is likely to reach $0.74. This level may prove to be a difficult hurdle to cross.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.61) if they want to regain control.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  turned up on Dec. 7 and broke above the 52-week high at $68.20. This indicates the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5990dedf-d7b6-433a-8818-f7f3d6a4f2cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally above $68.20 invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  H&S pattern, which is a positive sign. This attracts buying from the bulls who may have been sitting on the sidelines and short-covering by the aggressive bears. There is a minor hurdle at $78, but if it is scaled, the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair could surge to $100.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to get back into the game, they will have to yank the price below the 20-day EMA ($60). The next stop on the downside is at $51.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano has been on a roll since closing above the $0.40 resistance on Dec. 4. Buyers pushed the price above $0.46 on Dec. 7 and followed that up with another move higher above $0.52 on Dec. 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0ca5e289-b48e-47af-95e8-da8636dc5f23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The next level to watch out for on the upside is $0.60, but the overbought level on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  suggests a minor correction or consolidation is possible in the near term. If bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it increases the possibility of a rally to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair turns down from the current level, it is likely to find support at $0.52 and again at $0.46. A slide below this support will clear the path for a possible decline to the 20-day EMA ($0.41).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) skyrocketed near $0.11 on Dec. 6 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/fe2c5427-ee44-4652-afb7-8b7256c41968.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor advantage in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to remain below $0.10. This suggests that every little dip is being purchased. The bulls will again try to catapult the price above the $0.11 resistance. If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could soar to $0.14 and later to $0.16.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a drop below the 20-day EMA ($0.09). That will indicate profit-booking by short-term traders. The pair may then drop to $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-deaths-crypto-market-adoption"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s many deaths: Is crypto market past \u8216\'20\'18point of no return?\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been facing resistance near $28, but the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that bulls remain in control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/1954097b-ef29-4716-85c0-2ee841475df2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to resume the uptrend and kick the price to the overhead resistance at $31. This level is likely to attract aggressive selling by the bears. The overbought levels on the \uc2 RSI\uc2  also point to a near-term risk of a correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 The first support on the downside is at $24.69. If this level cracks, the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may fall to the 20-day EMA ($22.37). Buyers are expected to fiercely protect this level because the next support is much lower at $18.90.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) took support at the 20-day EMA ($15.04) on Dec. 7, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/44d628cd-00be-4a0c-91ad-6e4be6c85dc8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls continued their buying on Dec. 8, pushing the price above the overhead resistance at $16.60. If buyers sustain the breakout, it will indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The LINK/USDT pair could jump to $18.30 and subsequently to $19.50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and closes below $16.60, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. That will enhance the prospects of a drop below the 20-day EMA. The pair could then tumble to $13.\par \par \uc2 Polygon price analysis\par \par \uc2 Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.89 and $0.49 for the past several days. The bulls are trying to drive the price above the overhead resistance and start a new uptrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/07d4fbfe-9299-4db3-a5e0-bf3070648c0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AmaticUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.80) has started to turn up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the overbought territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers push the price above $0.89, the MATIC/USDT pair could reach the psychological level of $1. This level may again offer stiff resistance to the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $1 but rebounds off $0.89, it will indicate that bulls remain in command. That could increase the possibility of a rally to $1.20. The bears will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat if they sink and maintain the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.75).\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvN2UzMmE1NjktOWZmNS00ZjVmLWE4NzYtMDY3ODQ2ZTkxZDhhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231208ejc8000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
