\par\par \b \uc2 Dubai's  \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset \highlight\uc2  Surge: Bitrue\u8217\'20\'19s Recap of the 2023 Cardano Summit\b0\par\par\uc2 Laurie Dunn \par \uc2 457 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 December 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Tier-1 centralized \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bitrue.com/home"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitrue}}}\uc2  was one of the leading sponsors and participants in the 2023 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://summit.cardano.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano Summit}}}\uc2 , which took place between Nov 2nd and 4th at Dubai's Grand Hyatt Hotel.\par \par \uc2 In recent months, Emirates has become home for tech startups, \uc2 Web3\uc2  investments, R&D, as well as several prominent \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges such as Binance.\par \par \uc2 With 20+ community-led events globally, a thousand attendees, 150 speakers, and industry partners making Cardano Summit one of the most respected conferences in the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  calendar, 2024 was another success following Switzerland in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Among other specialists, Bitrue\u8217\'20\'19s CSO Robert Quartly-Janeiro delved into the future of centralized exchanges as part of a panel discussion at the Pitch Arena stage. Robert joined the debate on the future of CEXs in the Web3 market. The panel, titled "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tdQ5VYTrgBo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New Horizons: The Future of Exchanges}}}\uc2 ," explored the evolving landscape of \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchanges.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe supportive environment and clear regulatory frameworks that gave Dubai the status of a crypto hub will develop further as industry leaders such as Cardano deploy professionals and investment into the UAE. Now it\u8217\'20\'19s important to focus on where it will bring the alternative investment asset class, and the projects around it, in the next 1-2 years,\u8221\'20\'1D said Robert.\par \par \uc2 During the summit, Bitrue reengaged with the Cardano Foundation, new projects for potential listings, partners, things to invest in via Bitrue Ventures, and the wider Cardano community, reflecting the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s position as a top 10 exchange for trade volume and a vocal proponent of the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  ecosystem.\par \par \uc2 "It's incredibly valuable to have companies like Bitrue discussing the future of digital assets and Web3 by sharing the pathways they are using to make a vision reality," said Sandro Kn\u246\'00\'F6pfel, Head of Financial & Regulated Institutions at Cardano Foundation.\par \par \uc2 As a long-standing supporter of Cardano, in 2019, Bitrue became one of the first exchanges to list \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , making the token one of the first investable assets via Bitrue\u8217\'20\'19s Power Piggy offering, and invested alongside Cardano in the EX wing riders. In 2021, the exchange helped Cardano's decentralization by delegating 1 million \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  to various liquidity pools, an important step in Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s development.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this year, Bitrue became the first \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange to list and support Cardano-based native assets and added \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a base currency to facilitate trading activities on their platform. The two organizations continue to look at ways of supporting Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s initiatives and plans.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This article is provided for informational purposes only. It is not offered or intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, financial, or other advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231208ejc800105\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, \uc2 AVAX\uc2 , LINK, TON\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,682 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins saw some profit taking, but lower levels are likely to entice bulls and dip buyers.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been on a tear, rising more than 10% this week. This shows that traders are urgently scrambling to buy Bitcoin as they anticipate the price to rally further. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-beneficiary-crypto-funds-notch-10-week-streak-coinshares"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors have pumped in more than $1.44 billion}}}\uc2  into Bitcoin investment products in the past ten weeks.\par \par \uc2 The expectation is that the approval of a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) will attract huge investments. Animoca Brands CEO Robby Yung, while speaking at the Next Block Expo conference in Berlin, said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-halving-btc-etf-hype-driving-price-up-2024-nbx-berlin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin ETFs could generate a potential income}}}\uc2  of \u8220\'20\'1C$10 to $12 billion.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/80ab0b89-5118-4a84-b8ca-ac948a201986.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While long-term investors have been accumulating Bitcoin, the short-term holders (STHs) holding coins for 155 days or less have been busy booking profits in December. CryptoSlate research and data analyst James Van Straten, while sharing a Glassnode chart on X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ), said that STHs in profit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-short-term-holder-sales-5b-profit-taking-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent roughly $5 billion worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  to exchanges in the first four days of December.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin continue its up-move and reach $48,000, or will profit-booking set in? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been in a strong uptrend. The momentum picked up after the bulls catapulted the price above $40,000. The minor resistance at $41,160 has been cleared with ease.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/5ab6eada-5022-421c-b4db-7be18a19b8a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days has sent the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) into deeply overbought territory. This usually starts a correction or consolidation, but the bulls are in no mood to slow down. Buyers will try to drive the BTC/USDT pair to the target objective at $48,000, which is likely to act as a formidable resistance.\par \par \uc2 Any dips from the current level are likely to find support at the 20-day exponential moving average ($39,0803). A break below this level will be the first sign that the traders are rushing to the exit. That may signal the start of a short-term corrective phase.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) long tail on the Dec. 5 candlestick shows that the bulls thwarted attempts by the bears to yank the price back below the breakout level of $2,200.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/8aca35ad-5f81-48af-8195-019dab640249.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in command. The break above $2,200 has completed an ascending triangle pattern, which may start a rally to $2,500 and then to $2,950.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the bears will try to pull the price below $2,200 and trap the aggressive bulls. The ETH/USDT pair could then slide to the 20-day EMA ($2,104). A break and close below this support could open the doors for a fall to the 50-day SMA ($1,940).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to defend the moving averages, but the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) could rise to $239.20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/0dff6169-6d34-4327-a5a4-a35eb591e259.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($232) and the RSI just below the midpoint signals a balance between buyers and sellers. If the price turns down sharply from $239.20, the range-bound action may continue for some more time.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, a break above $239.20 will tilt the advantage in favor of the bulls. The BNB/USDT pair could then climb to the overhead resistance at $265. Sellers will seize control if they pull the price below $223. That could start a decline to $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to shove XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) back below the 20-day EMA ($0.62) on Dec. 4 and 5, but the long tail on the candlestick shows solid buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/ff268232-4d03-42f5-aa63-0fd7a0fa5321.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will strive to kick the price to $0.67, while the bears will try to stall the up-move at that level. On the way down, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will improve the prospects of a rally to $0.74. Sellers will try to defend this level aggressively and keep the XRP/USDT pair stuck inside the range between $0.56 and $0.74 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to drag the price back below the moving averages and challenge the support at $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in an uptrend. The bears tried to pull the price below $59 on Dec. 5, but the bulls held their ground. This shows that the bulls are trying to flip the level into support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/377e5b61-ec42-4d0f-8105-c361a391dfd4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to strengthen their position further by pushing the price above $68.20. If they do that, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head-and-shoulders pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as the early bears rush to cover their positions, causing a short squeeze. That could thrust the \uc2 SOL\uc2 /USDT pair toward $100.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down sharply from $68.20, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could dive to $51.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) closed above the $0.40 resistance on Dec. 4, indicating that the uncertainty of the past few days resolved in favor of the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/bffd9a09-ea77-468a-aab7-d57568a8ec99.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is likely to climb to $0.46, where resistance may set in. If the price turns down from this level but does not fall below $0.40, it will enhance the prospects of an upside breakout. The pair may then skyrocket to $0.52.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of weakness will be a drop below $0.40. That will indicate that markets have rejected the higher levels. The bears will further gain strength if they tug the price below $0.38. The pair may subsequently tumble to $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is in an uptrend. The bulls pushed the price above the minor resistance of $0.09 on Dec. 4 and followed it up with a move above the $0.10 resistance on Dec. 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/c7e961f5-7a84-4c07-9459-83c2932818c0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the \uc2 RSI\uc2  deep into the overbought territory, increasing the risk of a short-term pullback or consolidation. If buyers do not allow the price to slip below $0.09, the likelihood of a rally to $0.11 increases.\par \par \uc2 The bears are expected to defend the $0.11 level with all their might because if cleared, the DOGE/USDT pair could surge to $0.16. Conversely, if the price turns down and skids below $0.09, the pair may oscillate inside the large range between $0.11 and $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-up-170-since-ecb-last-gasp-16-4-k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin is up 170% since the ECB called its \u8216\'20\'18last gasp\u8217\'20\'19 at $16.4K}}}\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($21.29) on Dec. 4, indicating that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/fd84a760-df63-4b80-8c2a-2f2fe6a9b008.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying continued on Dec. 5, and the bulls propelled the price above the overhead resistance at $24.69. This clears the path for a potential rally to $28.50 and thereafter to $31. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to prevent the upside move, they will have to yank the price back below the breakout level of $22. Such a move may trap the aggressive bulls, resulting in long liquidation. The AVAX/USDT pair could then fall to $18.90.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the overhead resistance of $16.60 for the past few days, indicating that the bulls are holding on to their positions as they expect an upside breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/a395ab59-4983-43cf-92a9-e6d1bee8bb1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($14.79) is sloping up, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is above 60, indicating a high possibility of an upside breakout. If $16.60 is scaled, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the LINK/USDT pair could reach $18.30.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the upside, they will have to quickly drag the price below the 20-day EMA. That could sink the pair to the 50-day SMA ($13.05). This level is again likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($2.39) for the past few days, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/52fdf2a3-abe6-40ec-b7a2-06b2587ef7aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If the price slips below the 50-day SMA ($2.30), the TON/USDT pair could slump to $2.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to drive the price above the $2.52 to $2.59 resistance zone to gain the upper hand. If they succeed, the pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  ascending triangle pattern, which has a target objective of $3.58.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvMTc0MDM5ZDktYjBjNi00Yjg5LWIzYWMtMTQwYzU0NmFjNzdiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231206ejc6000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
