pportunity to access multi-million dollar properties at luxury locations and get passive income. Traditionally, this asset class was only locked to the elite as people needed millions of dollars in upfront capital to get access to a full house, villa, or hotel. With Everlodge, they will get fractionalized and split into smaller pieces, all of which are worth $100. This way, anyone can diversify their holdings. Everlodge as a platform will also introduce AI elements to the industry by enabling a tool that can predict future geographical locations in which properties can explode in value.\par \par \uc2 This tool is used as a prediction system for undervalued markets and can see which markets can blow up in emerging locations but it is only available to token holders. During Stage 7, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pr.everlodge.io/1on0ax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ELDG }}}\uc2  trades at just $0.025 but can spike as high as 100x at launch.\par \par \uc2 For more information about Everlodge (ELDG) please visit their website.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231205ejc5000ru\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
