 of these altcoins, thus painting an optimistic outlook.\par \par \uc2 Ride The Wave Of Innovation With ScapesMania\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=optimism"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click here}}}\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now \u8211\'20\'13 Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Navigating Through Market Challenges and Opportunities\par \par \uc2 IntoTheBlock's report reveals a unique market situation that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) currently experiences: merely 35% of its holders really profit, which stands in stark contrast to other leading blockchain protocols. Thus, despite recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trends, potential challenges may loom for Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) investors.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/sec-challenges-slow-ripple-xrp-and-cardano-ada-as-a-rising-token-targets-exceptional-gains-right-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has identified the key resistance level at $0.38. Substantial 7.19 billion Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) tokens create this point of acquisition, indicating an impressive barrier to potential upward movement. Tha Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price analysis shows a trading range between $0.303 and $0.428, with the 10-day Moving Average at $0.383 and the 100-day Moving Average at $0.291.\par \par \uc2 The future of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) appears to pivot on the breaking of its initial barrier at $0.38. A successful surpassing of this threshold could potentially diminish resistance, thereby amplifying profits for holders. Nevertheless, the market sentiment veering towards caution might be indicated due to the small percentage of the current profit-holders in Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP): A Glimmer of Hope Amid Legal Challenges\par \par \uc2 Currently, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/whispers-from-the-sec-is-ripples-stealthy-session-set-to-surge-xrp-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP)}}}\uc2  enters a pivotal phase as it grapples with an ongoing legal dispute against the SEC. Speculation among the Ripple (XRP) investors and followers has surged following a recent confidential meeting held by the SEC. Should this case find resolution, it may serve as a significant turning point for Ripple (XRP), influencing its legal position along with \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and market dynamics.\par \par \uc2 Ripple (XRP) price range is currently between $0.538 and $0.711. The 10-day Moving Average stands at $0.613, and the 100-day Moving Average is at $0.55. Ripple (XRP) has support levels at $0.298 and $0.47, with resistance levels at $0.815 and $0.988.\par \par \uc2 The future of Ripple (XRP) is intimately intertwined with the result of its legal duel against the SEC. So, a favorable resolution might catalyze an eminent surge in investor confidence and market value. Nonetheless, we cannot overlook two substantial hurdles: firstly, there is a pending $700 million fine threatening Ripple; and secondly, ongoing legal ambiguities pose formidable challenges ahead. The Ripple (XRP) market's future price \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and unpredictability also stem from whale movements.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC): Struggling to Keep Pace with Market Leaders\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) has been flagged by traders for its underperformance compared to Bitcoin. Despite signs of recovery in the crypto market, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) performance remains a concern, with a notable decline against Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) current price range is between $64.19 and $75.7. The 10-day Moving Average is at $70.03, and the 100-day Moving Average is $66.61. Support levels for \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) are at $47.47 and $58.98, with resistance levels at $81.98 and $93.49.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) future seems to be in a precarious position. While there are signs of a potential short-term reversal from \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment, its significant underperformance against Bitcoin raises concerns.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 The crypto market stands at a crossroads and its major altcoins, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Ripple (XRP), \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) and ScapesMania, are not an exception. Each encounters unique challenges and opportunities: Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) grapples with profitability; legal battles plague Ripple (XRP); performance issues beset \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC); all while an encouragingly promising start characterizes ScapesMania's journey thus far. A confluence of factors, including market dynamics, \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  and regulatory developments, will shape the future trajectory of these cryptocurrencies \u8211\'20\'13 they are not merely passive observers, but active participants that drive change through technological advancements and hold potential to redefine the landscape of digital finance.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231202ejc20002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 12/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \uc2 SOL\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 208 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 December 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins entered the month of December with a significant show of strength. Cointelegraph explores what's behind the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied about 9% in November, with $38,000 proving to be a difficult obstacle to cross. Coinglass {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/today"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  shows that in the past five years, Bitcoin rose only in 2020, but the extent of the rise at 46.92% was impressive.\par \par \uc2 Entering into the new year, several analysts are \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Bitcoin. 28 research note, \uc2 Standard Chartered\uc2  said that the possibility of the earlier-than-expected approval of spot Bitcoin exchange-traded funds could boost the price of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-etf-165-btc-price-gain-2024-standard-chartered"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to $100,000 before end-2024}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-12/aca794be-5d23-4a3b-8f19-ec72ba990a2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Galaxy Digital CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  also sounded upbeat about Bitcoin while speaking to Bloomberg on Nov. Additionally, the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  cutting rates may act as a further trigger that could send Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-settlement-positive-for-cryptocurrency-industry-mike-novogratz"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price near the all-time high}}}\uc2  by this time next year.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin sustain above $38,000 and clear the path for a rally to $40,000, or will bears again play spoilsport?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-12-1-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-sol-ada-doge-ton-link-avax"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Read more}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjMtMTIvMWQ5ZDY5YzAtZWQ5Yi00M2E4LWI3YjQtNjMwZmIxODU3M2YyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231201ejc1000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
