\par\par \b \uc2 SEC Challenges Slow Ripple (XRP) and Cardano ( \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 ), As a Rising Token Targets Exceptional Gains Right Now\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 1,374 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Step App (FITFI): Make Money from Rewarding Runs}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) Technical Analysis Ahead of Confidential SEC Meeting}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Technical Analysis Amidst Hoskinson\u8217\'20\'19s Critiques of the SEC}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#bs-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Closing Thoughts}}}\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is playing a game of push-and-pull this week with its total cap nudging down to $1.43 trillion, the move hinting at a slight retreat in an otherwise upward trend that's been building since mid-October. Bitcoin, the bellwether of the crypto domain, witnessed a sell-off from above $38,400, echoing the market's indecision: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/bitcoin-first-stop-40000-with-target-of-48000-going-into-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 brushing against highs}}}\uc2 , but not quite breaking through and steering clear of a steep fall. The real litmus test for BTC is staying above $36,700 as falling below could cement $38,000 as a tough resistance level.\par \par \uc2 In this cautious environment, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) are stuck in a bit of a rut, hovering under $0.65 and $0.4, respectively. They mirror each other in performance, with both recording a 3% dip over the last week. In contrast, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://step.app/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=https://step.app/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=XRPADAFITFI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Step App}}}\uc2  (FITFI) is making waves, not just holding its ground, but surging with a 2% weekly and a remarkable 28% monthly increase, outperforming XRP and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  alike. The project\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/november-sparks-step-app-fitfi-stepn-gmt-and-sweat-economy-sweat-who-will-spearhead-the-move-to-earn-christmas-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 success}}}\uc2  in the move-to-earn arena, backed by a stable economy, attractive returns, a spotless reputation, and even {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/beyond-celebrity-favor-for-dogecoin-doge-and-stepn-gmt-an-unseen-crypto-contender-emerges-for-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nods from celebrities}}}\uc2 , raises an intriguing question: is FITFI gearing up to take a leading position in the altcoin race?\par \par \uc2 Step App (FITFI): Make Money from Rewarding Runs\par \par \uc2 Imagine a world where your daily run or walk not only boosts your health, but also your virtual wallet. With Step App, your regular jog can net you anywhere from 5$ to 50$ per session! As the first move-to-earn application that empowered fitness with AI-assisted workouts, Step sets a new standard in the FitFi realm. Bolstered by its stable economy and lucrative ROI for users, the project caters to health enthusiasts and crypto fans alike, regardless of their experience with \uc2 Web3\uc2 . Injecting a burst of star-studded excitement, Step App basks in the glowing endorsements of legendary athletes like Usain Bolt, propelling its esteemed market reputation to even greater acclaim.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://go.step.app/3RmvqS8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Transform Your Steps into Tangible Rewards with Step App}}}\par \par \uc2 In Step, managing your earnings is effortless and subscriptions are available to further personalize your in-app experience and amplify rewards. Here, the magic lies in the FITFI and KCAL tokens \u8211\'20\'13 central to the app\u8217\'20\'19s vibrant, contest-filled community and its continuous innovation, they hold potential for appreciation over time. Whether it's upgrading your workout gear with KCAL or unlocking exclusive features with FITFI, these tokens are ready to enhance your fitness journey. In the run-up of 2024, Step is gearing up to unveil even more exciting features and airdrops, ensuring that both the community and the value of its tokens keep thriving.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=CRYPTO%3AFITFIUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Step App (FITFI) is currently in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/investors-ponder-buying-the-dip-in-shiba-inu-shib-and-filecoin-fil-yet-an-unexpected-altcoin-hints-at-outshining-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exhilarating phase}}}\uc2  of its market adventure, nestled just above a supportive cushion at $0.006239 and is eyeing an exciting leap towards the resistance at $0.0098465. This dynamic positioning teases a vibrant market with potential for significant shifts. The 10-day SMA has perched at $0.007207, whispering of a quietly optimistic trend, while the 100-day SMA at $0.006746 suggests a deeper, more anchored \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment. The MACD has taken a minor dip to -0.000153, and the RSI at 43.51 indicates a slightly cooling, yet hopeful investor interest. These are thrilling times for Step App (FITFI), and the current technical indicators are the pulse of a story unfolding in this action-packed market landscape. Right now, the impending conclusion of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptorank.io/price/stepapp/vesting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the FITFI public vesting}}}\uc2  on January 26 is stirring up excitement, as enthusiasts and investors alike are keen to see how it will turbocharge the app's journey, especially with the anticipated rollout of new features and big plans for 2024.\par \par \uc2 Step Up Your Game \u8211\'20\'13 Join Now!\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) Technical Analysis Ahead of Confidential SEC Meeting\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is in the spotlight this week, hovering between its key support at $0.4988 and resistance at $0.6612. The intrigue around the XRP price movement comes amid some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/ripple-xrp-and-cardano-ada-teeter-on-the-brink-of-a-major-rally-again-whats-different-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 headline-worthy developments}}}\uc2 , while the \uc2 U.S. SEC\uc2 's closed-door meeting today, though not directly linked to \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), has the community on tenterhooks. This event is another link in the chain of the ongoing legal face-off between \uc2 Ripple Labs\uc2  and the SEC. With a February 2024 deadline looming for the legal proceedings, the air is thick with anticipation. XRP is facing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/the-fair-price-of-ripple-xrp-should-be-much-higher-researchers-said"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a massive $770 million fine}}}\uc2  for transactions labeled non-security on secondary markets, yet the talk of a settlement is dividing expert opinion.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BITSTAMP%3AXRPUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Technically, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) is sitting on the fence. The 10-day SMA at $0.6101 nudging just above the 100-day SMA at $0.5498 suggests a hint of bullishness, but it's subtle. The MACD is barely there at 0.0004 and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is at 47.01, both showing the market holding its breath, not ready to swing in either direction. This technical standoff mirrors the uncertainty rippling from the SEC's corridors, leaving the fate of XRP hanging in the balance.\par \par \uc2 On the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  side, a favorable turn in the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) legal battles could see altcoin breaking through resistance at $0.6612, with sights set on higher targets at $0.7225 and $0.8849. However, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outcome, clouded by legal woes, could see it sliding towards lower supports sitting at $0.3976 and $0.2351.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis Amidst Hoskinson\u8217\'20\'19s Critiques of the SEC\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is grabbing the market\u8217\'20\'19s attention, but not just for its market moves \u8211\'20\'13 \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 , Cardano's founder, is stirring the pot with his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/the-cardano-ada-price-could-hit-1-while-scapesmania-crypto-presale-passes-875k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 frank criticism of the SEC}}}\uc2 . He's openly challenging the regulator's decision to label \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a security while Bitcoin seemingly gets a free pass. Hoskinson isn't just grumbling \u8211\'20\'13 he's seriously questioning the fairness in how cryptocurrencies are treated, especially irked by what he sees as a preferential treatment for BTC. His pointed remarks about potential biases in regulatory practices and concerns about the Bitcoin network\u8217\'20\'19s vulnerabilities are sparking lively debates among crypto enthusiasts.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 In the trading world, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is navigating a narrow path, caught between support at $0.362 and resistance at $0.407 \u8211\'20\'13 a scenario that hints at the market in limbo. The SMAs \u8211\'20\'13 both the 10-day at $0.381 and the 100-day at $0.378 \u8211\'20\'13 reinforce this sense of equilibrium. The MACD at -0.002 and the RSI of 39.82 are giving off neutral to slightly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  vibes, suggesting traders are playing a waiting game, watching for a decisive move.\par \par \uc2 For the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario to unfold, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  should break past $0.407, which will open the door to higher levels at $0.426 and $0.471. This leap would need a boost from positive market news or a shift in regulatory winds. Conversely, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  turn would see altcoin dipping below $0.362, potentially sliding towards lower supports at $0.336 and $0.291. Such a downturn could be spurred by negative updates or increasing pessimism around the SEC's stance.\par \par \uc2 Closing Thoughts\par \par \uc2 The crypto market is in a state of flux, with major players like Bitcoin showing mixed signals \u8211\'20\'13 climbing, yet cautiously. Step App (FITFI) stands out, thriving with its unique move-to-earn concept, steady tokenomics and celebrity support, contrasting with the stucking performances of \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) and Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). Both altcoins are facing their own SEC-related challenges, with the legal tussles of XRP creating suspense and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  founder\u8217\'20\'19s concerns about regulatory fairness. These scenarios paint a picture of the crypto market that's lively, but also cautious, though the rise of Step App (FITFI) adds a dash of excitement to this mix.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231130ejbu000um\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
