ility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and even the chance of hitting a new record high soon. These changes show more and more people are getting interested in Bitcoin, investing in it, suggesting they think its future looks pretty good.\par \par \uc2 Likewise, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://scapesmania.io/?utm_source=cryptodaily&utm_medium=mmedia&utm_campaign=ADA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA)}}}\uc2  is emerging as a presale project to watch, promising seemingly predictable patterns. Its presale success, surpassing $875K, indicates a growing interest in new and innovative crypto projects.\par \par \uc2 ScapesMania (MANIA): A Promising Project with Community Focus\par \par \uc2 While some are facing an uncertain future, the trajectory of a presale project is far easier to predict. ScapesMania (MANIA) is a well-balanced, meticulously designed project that acts as a gaming ecosystem. Through DAO governance, backers will be able to influence and benefit from a multi-billion-dollar industry. A wide range of features paired with the best technology, a professional team, and a long-term, highly ambitious vision can make ScapesMania the next big thing in crypto. Presale discounts and stage bonuses only add to the project's appeal.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live Now - Join Now for a Chance to Benefit with MANIA\par \par \uc2 Backed by an award-winning developer crew, ScapesMania stands for transparency: every member\u8217\'20\'19s social media profile is public. The project can achieve this not just by bringing big innovation to the game, but by putting its community front and center. Driving customer engagement and making sure that everyone benefits through great tokenomics and generous rewards is what makes ScapesMania the project with a bright future ahead.\par \par \uc2 Presale is Live, Learn More About Major Benefits\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Founder Confronts SEC\par \par \uc2 Recently, Cardano's founder {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/cardano-founder-charles-hoskinson-eyes-partnership-with-kraken"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Charles Hoskinson}}}\uc2  has been vocal in criticizing the \uc2 US Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) for classifying Cardano as a security while exempting Bitcoin. Hoskinson's beef with the SEC isn't just a whim, he seriously questions their fairness when it comes to treating cryptocurrencies differently and seems pretty peeved about Bitcoin getting special treatment. He voiced his annoyance over what he saw as bias and irregularities in the regulatory tactics, casting doubt on Bitcoin's decentralization and implying that singling out a handful of groups could trigger a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2021/10/bitcoin-concentration-could-result-in-51-percent-attack-study-finds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 51% attack on the Bitcoin network}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Analysis\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/fair-price-for-cardano-ada-should-be-around-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  has exhibited a mix of \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals in its recent technical analysis. The Relative Strength Index (RSI) at 54.13 suggests a neutral market sentiment, neither overbought nor oversold. The Stochastic %K at 45.91 also aligns with this neutrality, indicating no clear directional momentum. However, the Average Directional Index (ADI) at a low 16.79 points to a lack of strong trend in either direction. On the moving averages front, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is hovering around its 10-day Simple Moving Average (SMA) of $0.3857 and its 200-day SMA of $0.3829, suggesting a potential consolidation phase. The proximity of these averages indicates a critical juncture where \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could either break out or face resistance.\par \par \uc2 In terms of support and resistance levels, the immediate support and resistance levels for \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  are found at $0.3372 and $0.4247, respectively, with the next support and resistance levels at $0.2934 and $0.4685. The path \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  takes in the short run hinges heavily on these key price points.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Prediction\par \par \uc2 Looking at Cardano's (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price performance, the coin has shown a year-to-date increase of 57.15% and an impressive 827.81% over the past five years. This historical performance sets a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  backdrop, suggesting that if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintains its momentum and breaks past the immediate resistance level of $ 0.4247, it could target the next resistance at $0.4685. If this \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend continues, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could potentially hit the $1 mark, possibly within the next year, especially if it consistently breaks past key resistance levels and gains broader market acceptance.\par \par \uc2 On the flip side, if \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  faces selling pressure and breaks below its immediate support level of 0.3372, it could test the next support at $0.2934. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario could be triggered by broader market downturns or negative news specific to the Cardano ecosystem. Investors should also consider the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  oscillating within its current range, especially if the market continues to exhibit mixed signals. In either scenario, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price performance will likely be influenced by both its technical indicators and broader market trends.\par \par \uc2 Final Words\par \par \uc2 With all the huge capital flowing into crypto and the regulatory hurdles popping up, everyone's eyes are locked on what's next for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/tag/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2 . \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 's chances to hit that crucial threshold of $1 hinges on its solid past showings and the continual advancements happening in its ecosystem. But, even with all the excitement around the potential of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), it's essential to remember that market unpredictability and legal unknowns can throw a wrench in the works \u8211\'20\'13 something \uc2 Charles Hoskinson\uc2 's run-ins with the SEC clearly illustrate. When it comes to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , stay grounded and ready for the rollercoaster ride of potential ups and downs. Ultimately, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  price journey towards or away from the $1 milestone will be a testament to the resilience and adaptability of the Cardano network in the crypto world experiencing a vital and effervescent period.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231130ejbt0000m\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,640 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are struggling to rise above their respective overhead resistance levels, signaling a short-term correction, which is likely to be bought.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is trying to sustain above the overhead resistance of $38,000 for the second consecutive day and start the next leg of the uptrend. The excitement among market observers may have increased after the \uc2 United States Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC) delayed its decision on the applications of \uc2 Franklin Templeton\uc2  and Hashdex exchange-traded funds.\par \par \uc2 Bloomberg ETF analyst James Seyffart speculated in a X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/spot-bitcoin-etf-january-approvals-possible-analysts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the SEC may have taken this step}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cto line every applicant up for potential approval by the Jan. 10, 2024 deadline.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While many analysts believe that the ETF listing will be a watershed moment for Bitcoin, Genesis Trading head of derivatives Joshua Lim cautioned in a X post that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buy-the-rumor-sell-the-news-bitcoin-etf-tradfi-sell-off"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 traditional finance investors have already bought the rumor}}}\uc2  and may exit the trade close to the ETF announcement when retail tries to get in.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/6705c9cd-41da-47ed-960c-1a6e153010ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the macroeconomic conditions in early 2024 may limit the downside. \uc2 Pershing Square Capital Management\uc2  CEO and founder \uc2 Bill Ackman\uc2  said in an interview with \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-games-warning-btc-price-40k-us-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve will cut rates sooner}}}\uc2  than people expect. He anticipates rate cuts to start in Q1 instead of the market expectations of the middle of the year.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins witness a shallow correction before resuming their uptrend?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin again rose above the $37,980 resistance on Nov. 28, but the bulls could not achieve a close above it. This shows that the bears are fiercely defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/409f932b-8aa8-44ae-acf7-9926a5cd12df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it. If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($36,820), the possibility of a rally to $40,000 improves. This level may act as a significant hurdle.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the up-move, they will have to quickly pull the price below the 20-day EMA and the uptrend line. That could start a decline to the solid support at 34,800. A strong bounce off this level may keep the BTC/USDT pair inside the large range between $34,800 and $38,000 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) again found support at the 20-day EMA ($2,006) on Nov. 27 and 28, indicating that the bulls view the dips as a buying opportunity.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fe5b9afd-5ced-4097-9244-590737684956.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to face stiff resistance in the zone between $2,137 and $2,200, but if buyers do not give up much ground, it will increase the possibility of a rally above $2,200. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair will complete a large ascending triangle pattern. That could start a new uptrend, with a pattern target of $3,400.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will signal that the bears are trying to get back in the game. The pair may then slump to the 50-day SMA ($1,853).\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to yank BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) below the $223 support on Nov. 27, but the bulls did not relent. This suggests demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7fa9a744-4985-4a7a-a007-c9e54c56d559.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to force the price above the 20-day EMA ($235) to start a meaningful recovery. The BNB/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $265, where the bears may again offer a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. That will enhance the prospects of a fall below $223. If this level gives way, the pair may collapse to $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the moving averages for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/08cfdcbf-f627-4b9c-b835-55815289e521.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The slightly downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.61) and the RSI near the midpoint do not indicate an advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If buyers kick the price above the 20-day EMA, the XRP/USDT pair may rise to $0.67. Instead, if the price turns down sharply from the 20-day EMA and skids below the 50-day SMA ($0.58), it will signal that bears are trying to seize control. The selling could accelerate further if the pair plunges below $0.56.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($54.71) on Nov. 28, indicating that the sentiment remains positive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f28661d5-d984-4881-90b9-eab7eed25a15.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will try to push the price above the immediate resistance at $62.10. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could climb to the local high at $68. The bulls will have to overcome this obstacle to invalidate the head-and-shoulders pattern. The failure of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign. That may start a sharp rally in the pair to $85.\par \par \uc2 The $51 level remains the key support on the downside. A break and close below this level could start a deeper correction toward the 50-day SMA ($42.25).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) slid to the 20-day EMA ($0.38) on Nov. 27, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that lower levels are being aggressively bought.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0881d940-fcef-4636-84f7-64d111ade543.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The higher lows of the past few days improves the prospects of an upside breakout. If the bulls shove the price above $0.40, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could pick up momentum and climb to $0.42 and later to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Time is running out for the bears. If they want to make a comeback, they will have to tug the price below the 20-day EMA. That may hit stops of short-term traders and the pair may fall to the solid support at $0.34.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been repeatedly taking support at the 20-day EMA ($0.08), indicating that lower levels are being purchased.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/73ca8fc4-7cdc-427b-94f0-b0325cb160d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. Buyers will try to propel the price to $0.09 and next to $0.10, where they are likely to encounter selling by the bears.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 20-day EMA remains the key level to watch out for. If this level crumbles, the DOGE/USDT pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) and subsequently to the crucial support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sofi-technologies-cease-crypto-services-december-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SoFi Technologies to cease crypto services by Dec. 19}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been trading above the 20-day EMA ($2.37) for the past few days, but the bulls are struggling to push the price to $2.59. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e7bafe2c-b9d4-449d-b904-797080f2bfb5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to gain the upper hand by yanking the price below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, the TON/USDT pair could decline to the psychological level of $2 and then to $1.89.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the first hurdle is at $2.59. If buyers surmount this resistance, the pair could rally to $2.77. Sellers may offer stiff opposition in the zone between $2.77 and $2.90, but if bulls do not allow the price to dip below $2.59, a new uptrend to $4.03 could begin.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) again found support at the 20-day EMA ($14.07) on Nov. 28, indicating that the bulls are vigorously guarding this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/d6aff777-39a1-44c5-84ce-6f46527d19b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USDT pair is likely to face selling at the $15.40 mark as the bears have successfully held this resistance during three previous attempts. If the price turns down from $15.40, it will increase the likelihood of a drop to $12.83.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive the price above $15.40, the pair may challenge the local high at $16.60. The up-move could resume, and the pair may reach $18.30 if this level is surpassed.\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($19.35) on Nov. 28, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fde92ca0-39a3-4c8e-a31b-a3cb48611e0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to overcome the resistance at $22 to strengthen their position. The AVAX/USDT pair may then rise to $24.69. Sellers are likely to mount a strong defense at this level because if this resistance is taken out, the pair could travel to $28.50 as there is no major resistance in between.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $22, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. The advantage will tilt in favor of the bears if they sink the pair below $18.90.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/b6457b11-7869-44b6-b34c-df0c7c696e61.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231129ejbt0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
