ially strengthen \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) market position significantly. In conjunction, these technologies form an innovative blend that provides a comprehensive offering for financial services, thus heralding increased adoption of XRPL.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Pioneering Research and Development\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) has celebrated significant research milestones, particularly in recent times. The platform's unwavering commitment to academic rigor manifests notably: Input Output Global boasts a robust library of nearly 200 groundbreaking research papers.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) current price range is between $0.253 and $0.318. The 10-Day Moving Average is at $0.381, and the 100-Day Moving Average is $0.288. Support levels are found at $0.150 and $0.214, while resistance levels are at $0.343 and $0.408.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) continuous evolution, evident in its frequent research updates and technological enhancements, strategically situates it for potential growth within the blockchain sector. Moreover, as Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) recently delves into Artificial Intelligence (AI) - exemplified by the beta launch of Girolamo chatbot. It signals a more expansive scope of innovation extending beyond mere Blockchain Technology application. The future success of the platform, however, hinges on two crucial factors: first, how effectively they can apply their research; second, and equally important, how well their evolving technologies are received by the market.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC): Navigating Through Market Fluctuations\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/could-polygon-matic-be-your-best-crypto-bet-for-2023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Polygon (MATIC)}}}\uc2 , the native token of the Polygon layer-2 blockchain, has been experiencing a downward price trend as of November 2023. The launch of Polygon 2.0, an upgrade aimed at making the layer-2 solution more efficient and liquid, initially led to a price surge. However, the price of Polygon (MATIC) has since been on a downward trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) price journey began in 2019 and saw a peak of $2.92 during the 2021 crypto bull run. However, it experienced a decline in mid-2022, falling to around $1 and at times even to $0.50. Developments like zkEVM led to a brief resurgence in August, pushing the price to $1. The price of Polygon (MATIC) in 2023 has been a mix of ups and downs, with a peak of $1.52 in February but facing a downturn following regulatory challenges and market corrections.\par \par \uc2 The future trajectory of Polygon (MATIC) is uncertain, with its price currently following a downward trend due to market corrections. Despite this, the strong fundamentals of the Polygon (MATIC) blockchain and the recent upgrades suggest a potential for recovery.\par \par \uc2 Stellar (XLM): Soaring High\par \par \uc2 In just a span of 24 hours, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/10/expert-insights-on-monero-xmr-ripple-xrp-stellar-xlm-litecoin-ltc-chainlink-link-should-you-hold-or-sell-now"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Stellar (XLM)}}}\uc2  notably declined from $0.1227 to $0.116: a significant drop indeed. However - and this is worth noting despite its brevity - over the past 30 days, the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  has achieved an impressive feat of managing modest gains; specifically clocking in at 2.73%.\par \par \uc2 The initial target prices are set between $0.38 and $0.42, indicating a potential growth of over 220% from its current price of $0.1164. This projection is based on the Fibonacci Circle 1.414, which is currently acting as a strong support level for Stellar (XLM).\par \par \uc2 Analyzing this, we find the bold prediction: Stellar (XLM) price will potentially surge by 3,006% to a staggering $3.5 - an aspect that stands out remarkably. Yet it remains essential; such predictions are speculative and vulnerable to market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  along with external factors. Stellar (XLM) success hinges primarily on two factors - the maintenance of key support levels and how effectively they can leverage technological advancements for adoption, gauged by the overall market response.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), Polygon (MATIC), Stellar (XLM) and ScapesMania exemplify the diversity and potential within the fluctuating cryptocurrency market. Their trajectories underscore this sector's variability; as sub-$1 cryptocurrencies, they represent unique opportunities and challenges.\par \par \uc2 With strategic partnerships fueling its momentum, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) emerges as a leader. Meanwhile, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) persists in innovation through rigorous research and development. Despite market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Polygon (MATIC) stands firm on solid fundamentals, which is an indication of resilience, while technical indicators suggest significant growth potential for Stellar (XLM). As a new entrant, ScapesMania attracts attention: it employs an innovative approach evidenced by its successful presale.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231128ejbs000xe\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\par \b \uc2 The end of an era for \uc2 Binance\uc2 , troubles for Kraken: Law Decoded\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By David Attlee \par \uc2 760 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s the end of an era for \uc2 Binance\uc2  and the beginning of another court battle for Kraken. All this and other major news in \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  in this week\u8217\'20\'19s Law Decoded newsletter.\par \par \uc2 Last week, the legal drama featuring the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest crypto exchange and United States law enforcement {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-timeline-settlement-us-government"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ended with a plea deal}}}\uc2 . \uc2 Binance\uc2  and Changpeng \u8220\'20\'1CCZ\u8221\'20\'1D Zhao {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-binance-changpeng-zhao-pleads-guilty-violating-anti-money-laundering-requirements-wsj"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have admitted violating}}}\uc2  U.S. Anti-Money Laundering laws, agreeing to pay $4.3 billion in fines. CZ resigned as CEO of \uc2 Binance\uc2  as part of the deal. \uc2 Binance\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s former head of regional markets outside the U.S., \uc2 Richard Teng\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-richard-teng-ceo-amid-changpeng-zhao-s-forced-departure"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 is the new CEO}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Cardano founder \uc2 Charles Hoskinson{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-ceo-downfall-end-era-charles-hoskinson"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reflected on the plea deal}}}\uc2  news, calling it \u8220\'20\'1Cthe end of an era.\u8221\'20\'1D In Hoskinson\u8217\'20\'19s opinion, entrepreneurs must comply with regulations or develop permissionless protocols that can\u8217\'20\'19t be regulated. Hoskinson warned that the world is changing and that entrepreneurs will no longer be able to get by using centralized systems while simultaneously not complying with regulations. This is because \u8220\'20\'1Cthe United States has a financial regime that basically has been weaponized,\u8221\'20\'1D and this regime will not allow entrepreneurs to open up markets that let \u8220\'20\'1Cthe enemies of America to basically trade and do things.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Kraken, another major crypto exchange, has been dragged into {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-sues-kraken-for-securities-laws-violations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 another legal fight}}}\uc2  with the \uc2 U.S. Securities Exchange Commission\uc2  (SEC). In a complaint filed in a San Francisco federal court, the SEC claimed that Kraken has been operating a platform that unlawfully facilitated the buying and selling of cryptocurrencies since 2018. Additionally, the SEC alleged Kraken\u8217\'20\'19s business practices and \u8220\'20\'1Cdeficient\u8221\'20\'1D internal controls saw the exchange commingle up to $33 billion worth of customer assets with its own. The SEC said this resulted in a \u8220\'20\'1Csignificant risk of loss\u8221\'20\'1D for its clients. Kraken founder {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-jesse-powell-slams-sec-warns-us-crypto-firms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jesse Powell called the action}}}\uc2  an \u8220\'20\'1Cassault on America\u8221\'20\'1D and called the SEC the U.S.\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Ctop decel.\u8221\'20\'1D Powell even warned other companies to depart the country.\par \par \uc2 No bail for \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\par \par \uc2 FTX\uc2  founder and convicted fraudster \uc2 Sam Bankman-Fried\uc2  will remain behind bars after failing to convince a U.S. appellate court that he should be freed while his legal team appeals his conviction. The U.S. Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit said Bankman-Fried\u8217\'20\'19s previous attempts to tamper with two witnesses while on pretrial release were a major reason behind rejecting his request. \u8220\'20\'1CWe have reviewed the Defendant-Appellant\u8217\'20\'19s additional arguments and find them unpersuasive,\u8221\'20\'1D the court said. Bankman-Fried\u8217\'20\'19s legal team also argued that the district court failed to consider a less restrictive alternative to detention.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/court-rejects-sam-bankman-fried-release-bid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  discusses spot Bitcoin ETFs with the SEC\par \par \uc2 Representatives from \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  and the Nasdaq met with the SEC to discuss the proposed rule allowing the listing of a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund, or ETF. \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  presented how the firm could use an in-kind or in-cash redemption model for its iShares \uc2 Bitcoin Trust\uc2 . It\u8217\'20\'19s unclear how SEC officials responded to the two proposed models or if they intend to approve a spot BTC ETF after numerous delays and rejections. Many reports have suggested the SEC could be nearing a decision on a spot BTC ETF for listing on U.S. markets. If approved, it would be a significant move toward mainstream \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 . SEC officials also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-meets-sec-to-discuss-bitcoin-trust"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 met with Grayscale representatives}}}\uc2  on Nov. 20 in the firm\u8217\'20\'19s bid to list a \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-sec-spot-bitcoin-etf-discussion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par \uc2 Tether and \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  won\u8217\'20\'19t resist a Freedom of Information Law request from U.S. media\par \par \uc2 Tether and \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  have jointly agreed to drop initial opposition to a Freedom of Information Law (FOIL) request lodged in New York by some high-profile news publications. A statement from the Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) stablecoin issuer and cryptocurrency exchange shared with Cointelegraph notes that it is committed to transparently sharing information following a FOIL request from CoinDesk earlier in 2023. Tether and \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  will not appeal against the FOIL request put forward by journalists, including Zeke Faux, Shane Shifflett and \b \highlight22\uc2 Ada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Hui, whom they accuse of exhibiting \u8220\'20\'1Ccertain behaviors.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The ongoing FOIL request relates to Tether and \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  reaching an agreement with the New York Attorney General in February 2021. As initially reported by CNBC, the agreement involved paying an $18.5 million fine to settle a two-year-long legal dispute regarding the alleged commingling of $850 million of client and corporate funds.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-bitfinex-agree-drop-opposition-foil-request"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Continue reading}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/04f6b089-012d-4110-bd1a-cdbeb9281b0e.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231127ejbr000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/27: SPX, DXY, BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, LINK\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins may enter a short-term corrective phase as bulls take money off the table.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has started the week on a negative note. The failure of the bulls to pierce and sustain above the $38,000 resistance has given a small window of opportunity for the bears to try and make a comeback. Strong selling has pulled the price below $37,000 on Nov. 27.\par \par \uc2 However, lower levels are likely to attract buyers as the bulls will want to maintain the momentum going into the final month of the year. The bears are likely to have other plans as they will attempt to deepen the correction. That could boost \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last few days of November as both the bulls and the bears try for a monthly closing in their favor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e468aad1-6102-4494-9882-f4fc9e2c9019.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While near-term uncertainty remains, Rich Dad Poor Dad author Robert Kiyosaki {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/robert-kiyosaki-bitcoin-gold-silver-investment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reiterated his long-term \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  view on Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , gold and silver in a X (formerly \uc2 Twitter\uc2 ) post on Nov. 26. He cautioned investors to get out of fiat money, calling it a \u8220\'20\'1CFAKE money system.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and altcoins bounce off their respective strong support levels, or will the bears prevail? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts to find out.\par \par \uc2 S&P 500 Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The S&P 500 Index (SPX) continued its northward march higher after skyrocketing above the downtrend line. This indicates strong demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/98baaf77-4242-4a58-9aa9-c394837055b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SPX daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ASPX"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) into the overbought zone, indicating that a minor correction or consolidation is possible in the near term. The 20-day exponential moving average (4,448) is the crucial level to watch out for on the downside.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from this level, it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders view dips as a buying opportunity. That enhances the prospects of a break above 4,650.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a fall below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the bulls are losing their grip. The index may then slump to the 50-day simple moving average (4,346).\par \par \uc2 U.S. Dollar Index price analysis\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Dollar Index (DXY) attempted a recovery from the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of 103.46 on Nov. 21, but the bears were in no mood to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/ece2c39c-4691-40b8-b7ce-f77ccd98c45b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DXY daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=TVC%3ADXY"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers stalled the relief rally at 104.21 on Nov. 22 and are trying to sink the price toward the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of 102.55. The downsloping 20-day EMA (104.54) and the RSI near the oversold zone indicate that bears are in command.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the correction may be over. The index may then attempt a rally toward the stiff resistance at 106.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price action of the past few days is forming an ascending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close above $38,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/710eb233-5152-4e19-87e3-2cfbd94737d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the $38,000 resistance is scaled, the BTC/USDT pair may climb to $40,000. This level may again act as a roadblock, but if cleared, the pair may rise to the pattern target of $41,160.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below the uptrend line to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That may open the doors for a fall to $34,800. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest a range-bound action between $34,800 and $38,000. The bears will gain the upper hand on a break and close below $34,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) surged close to the overhead resistance of $2,137 on Nov. 24, but the bulls could not overcome this barrier. That may have led to profit-booking, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/eaa678fc-a1c8-4d2f-b746-dab7f52b3eb8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to tug the price below the 20-day EMA ($1,998). If they can pull it off, the ETH/USDT pair may fall to $1,904. A break below this support will complete a double-top pattern. This reversal setup could start a deeper correction to the 50-day SMA ($1,834).\par \par \uc2 Instead, if the price snaps back from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that lower levels continue to attract buyers. The pair may then climb to the overhead resistance zone between $2,137 and $2,200. Buyers will have to ascend this zone to complete a large ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rejection at the 20-day EMA ($237) on Nov. 23 indicates that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/609a3522-c3aa-46f0-865a-2144d0a5f0ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure and have pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($229). The BNB/USDT pair could next slide to the solid support at $223 and below it to $219. Buyers are likely to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $240 to suggest that the selling pressure is reducing. That may start a rally to $255 and later to the major resistance at $265.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.58) on Nov. 22 but hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($0.61). This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the 20-day EMA into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/b123ee8e-066e-4329-8bff-411418b7ad8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Sellers will try to sink the price below the 50-day SMA and challenge the vital support at $0.56. If this level is breached, it will suggest that bears are back in command. The XRP/USDT pair may then gradually collapse to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level or $0.56 and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the pair may continue to oscillate inside the large range between $0.56 and $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the immediate resistance at $59 on Nov. 26, indicating that the bears are trying to halt the relief rallies at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/9a5a4f5d-0acb-4959-a374-49d7f14e54f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to strengthen their position further by pulling the price below the 20-day EMA ($53). The SOL/USDT pair will complete a head-and-shoulders pattern if it breaks below the neckline at $51. That could start a steep correction to the 50-day SMA ($40) and thereafter to the pattern target of $34.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to have other plans. They will try to arrest the decline near $51. If the bounce off this level rises above $59, it will indicate that bulls are back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat. The pair may then retest the local high at $68.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-40k-record-hash-rate-5-things-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price eyes $40K amid record hash rate \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) failed to break above the overhead resistance of $0.40 in the past three days. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e6dc1577-3848-4123-beb5-a6d979099722.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the 20-day EMA ($0.37), which is likely to attract buyers. If the price bounces off this level with vigor, it will signal that the trend remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to overcome the obstacle at $0.40. If they succeed, the pair may soar to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the 20-day EMA cracks, the pair may slump to $0.34. Buyers are expected to guard this level because if it gives way, the pair may reach the 50-day SMA ($0.32).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to yank Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on Nov. 26, but the bulls purchased the dip as seen from the long tail on the candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7377c294-5929-4eb6-ba15-ec0b13808504.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price above the $0.08 resistance on Nov. 27, but the long wick on the candlestick shows solid selling at higher levels. If the price dips below the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could slump to the 50-day SMA ($0.07).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest demand at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to kick and sustain the price above $0.08. If they do that, the pair may pick up momentum and surge toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on Nov. 26, but the bulls failed to build upon the momentum. This may have attracted selling, which pulled the price below the downtrend line on Nov. 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f08ebb81-a277-41c4-a74f-2649e08dba8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=OKX%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($14) remains the key support to watch out for in the near term. If the price sinks and sustains below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are attempting a comeback. The LINK/USDT pair could then decline to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $12.83.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. That will enhance the prospects of a rally to the overhead resistance of $16.60.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3681407a-3792-4ead-b68c-048b83aae458.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231127ejbr000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
