ew wave of enthusiasm. This strategic maneuver not only amplified the trading volume for Optimism (OP), but also signified its peak level within the previous three months. This development has elicited a significant 50% increase in the price of Optimism (OP) over the last 30 days.\par \par \uc2 The current price range of Optimism (OP) lies between $1.207 and $1.531, reflecting a healthy market response. The support levels are identified at $0.695 and $1.019, providing a safety net against potential market downturns. On the flip side, the resistance levels at $1.667 and $1.991 pose challenges for the Optimism (OP) price\u8217\'20\'19s upward movement.\par \par \uc2 Looking ahead, the future of Optimism (OP) appears promising, buoyed by the recent token accumulation and positive market indicators. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend suggested by the moving averages and the robust support levels point towards a potential continuation of the upward trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT): Leaping Forward with Strategic Partnerships\par \par \uc2 Recently, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/aptos-apt-price-analysis-did-apt-react-after-sk-telecom-partnership-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aptos (APT)}}}\uc2  announced a landmark partnership with Alibaba Cloud; the aim is to introduce \uc2 Web3\uc2  functionalities in the Asia-Pacific region. The market has reacted favorably to Aptos (APT) latest strategic move, with its price range currently sitting between $5.35 and $8.1.\par \par \uc2 The 10-day moving average of Aptos (APT) is at $7.235, indicating a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment in the near term. The support levels for Aptos (APT) are established at $0.902 and $3.652, providing a solid base for its price. However, Aptos (APT) faces resistance at higher levels, specifically at $9.152 and $11.902, which it needs to breach to continue its upward trajectory.\par \par \uc2 Aptos (APT) potentially stands to gain a game-changing advantage through its partnership with Alibaba Cloud; this alliance may result in heightened adoption and integration within the APAC region. How successful \u8211\'20\'13 or not \u8211\'20\'13 these Web3 initiatives are executed will significantly influence not only their collaboration's success but also the Aptos (APT) price\u8217\'20\'19s movement; moreover, it is contingent upon how favorably markets receive these novel developments.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): Poised for a Breakthrough?\par \par \uc2 With its price poised to breach significant resistance levels, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/is-cardano-ada-poised-for-unprecedented-growth-with-community-takeover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 )}}}\uc2  is riding a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum. Escalating staking rewards, as well as burgeoning transactional activity of both new and existing network users, add further to this trend.\par \par \uc2 The current price range of Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is between $0.253 and $0.318, indicating the market which is responsive to the recent developments. The 10-day moving average stands at $0.377, showcasing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  trend in the short term. Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) support levels are identified at $0.15 and $0.214, providing a cushion against potential downturns. However, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) faces resistance at $0.343 and $0.408, which are crucial levels to surpass for further upward movement.\par \par \uc2 If the current staking dynamics persist, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) potentially reclaims higher price points: a promising future indeed. Nonetheless \u8211\'20\'13 and here's where caution must prevail \u8211\'20\'13 inherent market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and possible regulatory shifts continue to present substantial risks. If the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) price drops below critical support levels, it might encounter challenges; however, robust buy-walls could avert a significant \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversal.\par \par \uc2 Conclusion\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's growing market cap, coupled with the buzz around a potential \uc2 Bitcoin ETF\uc2 , lead a pivotal transformation in the cryptocurrency market \u8211\'20\'13 this shift primes dynamic players such as Optimism (OP), Aptos (APT), Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ), and emerging ScapesMania.\par \par \uc2 With its innovative approach and successful presale, ScapesMania carves out a niche; standing poised for growth while preparing for exchange listings. Similarly, experiencing a surge in market value and trading volume, Optimism (OP) signals \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  future potential; nevertheless, critical resistance levels lie ahead that may pose challenges. Aptos (APT) strides forward on the back of strategic partnerships, including its recent collaboration with Alibaba Cloud. Similarly, \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signs emerge from Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ): staking rewards are increasing and transactional activity is escalating \u8211\'20\'13 yet sustained growth requires conquering key resistance levels.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231124ejbo000xd\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/24: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price hit a 2023 high above $38,400 as traders place their new target north of $40,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) broke above the overhead resistance of $38,000 on Nov. 24, indicating that the sentiment is positive and bulls have kept up the pressure. Independent Reserve CEO Adrian Przelozny told Cointelegraph that the \u8220\'20\'1Cnext two years are going to be good,\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bull-market-just-getting-started-exchange-execs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market activity is likely to pick up}}}\uc2  in early 2024.\par \par \uc2 The major catalysts for next year is the Bitcoin halving in April and applications for a spot Bitcoin exchange-traded fund, some of which have a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cathie-wood-ark-spot-bitcoin-etf-amend"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 deadline for a decision in January}}}\uc2 . With two main events on the horizon, Bitcoin is likely to find buyers on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/4f34340b-dd61-4e81-8b4f-8cf0a5eee4f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-buyer-btc-price-past-38k-traders-key-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Analysts expect a retracement from $40,000}}}\uc2  in the near term. That could be one of the reasons why \uc2 Cathie Wood\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s investment firm, ARK Invest, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cathie-wood-ark-dumps-700k-gbtc-month"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has been gradually selling into strength}}}\uc2 . The firm sold about 700,000 shares of the \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) over the past month, but it is worth noting that ARK still holds more than 4.3 million GBTC shares.\par \par \uc2 Could crypto traders bulldoze their way through the overhead resistance levels in Bitcoin and major altcoins? What are the important levels to watch out for?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin pierced the stiff resistance of $37,980 on Nov. 24, but the bulls are struggling to sustain the breakout. This suggests that the bears are vigorously guarding the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/f2e98578-d59a-4bac-b725-e58c08063e4f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up, and the relative strength index (\uc2 RSI\uc2 ) is above 61, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers maintain the price above $37,980, the BTC/USDT pair could reach $40,000.\par \par \uc2 This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears, but if the buyers prevail, the pair could skyrocket to $48,000. Time is running out for the bears. If they want to weaken the momentum, they will have to sink the price below the 20-day EMA. The short-term trend will turn negative below $34,800.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line on Nov. 22, suggesting the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/ce3cf681-a305-4913-ad2c-e90151502711.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull the price back below the resistance line on Nov. 23, but the bulls held their ground. This suggests that the bulls are trying to flip the resistance line into support. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could start a northward march toward $2,200.\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as a formidable resistance, but if bulls overcome it, the pair will complete a large ascending triangle pattern. That could open the gates for a potential rally to the pattern target of $3,400.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the near term if the price turns down and plummets below the vital support at $1,900.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) jumped above $235 on Nov. 22, but the bulls could not overcome the obstacle at the 20-day EMA ($239). This suggests that bears are trying to take control.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/a4c6800a-06bd-46a9-98ab-adae5539a405.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is just below the midpoint, indicating a minor advantage to the bears. The short-term trend will turn negative on a break and close below the crucial support at $223. That could clear the path for a fall to $203.\par \par \uc2 If bulls want to prevent the downside, they will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. The BNB/USDT pair may then spend some more time inside the large range between $223 and $265.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to shove XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.62), which suggests strong buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2622de0e-b1cb-4d6e-8a5f-8d41fa96cb36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out, and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  is near the midpoint, indicating range-bound action in the short term. The XRP/USDT pair may swing between $0.56 and $0.74 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and sustains above the 20-day EMA, the pair could gradually climb to $0.67 and thereafter to $0.74. Buyers will have to overcome this hurdle to indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.56, it will signal the start of a sharper correction to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trying to break above the $59 resistance for the past two days, but the bears have held their ground. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not ceded ground to the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/7dfbc290-1c64-4f92-8859-3944bf9fc9a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($52.80) and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory suggest that bulls have the upper hand. That enhances the prospects of a rally above the overhead resistance. If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair could ascend to $68.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will strive to tug the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, the pair may drop to $48, where buyers are likely to step in.\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been swinging above and below the $0.38 level for the past few days. This shows uncertainty about the next directional move between the bulls and the bears .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5cbd5f62-99a1-47e9-82ec-9185fd09949c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The upsloping moving averages and the \uc2 RSI\uc2  in the positive territory indicate that the bulls have a slight edge. If the price rises above $0.40, it will signal the start of a new up-move to $0.42 and later to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to trap the aggressive bulls, they will have to yank the price below $0.34. That may result in a fall to the 50-day SMA ($0.31). The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may then oscillate between $0.24 and $0.38 for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been maintaining above the 20-day EMA ($0.08) for the past two days, but the rise lacks momentum. This indicates that bulls are cautious at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/8a94271f-9d88-4c30-9dde-082a7be4c0f0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Buyers will have to propel the price above $0.08 to signal strength. The DOGE/USDT pair could then surge toward the target objective of $0.10. This level may again witness a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.08, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the immediate support at $0.07. The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI just above the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/enjoy-sub-40k-bitcoin-plan-b-100k-average-btc-price-2024"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Enjoy sub-$40K Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 PlanB stresses $100K average BTC price from 2024}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Buyers are trying to push Toncoin (TON) to the overhead resistance of $2.59. The repeated retest of a resistance level tends to weaken it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/2370122b-3d25-41b7-bb5e-3de044e1f9e6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive and sustain the price above the $2.59 to $2.77 resistance zone, it will complete a cup-and-handle pattern. That could start a new uptrend to $3.28 and thereafter to the pattern target of $4.03.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the TON/USDT pair turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest that bears are fiercely protecting the level. That could result in a move down to the 50-day SMA ($2.20). A slide below this level will open the doors for a fall to $2 and subsequently to $1.89.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) is facing selling at the downtrend line, as seen from the long wick on the Nov. 23 candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/fe014aa5-eca5-43fd-ae14-33b49d284040.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls have not given up and have again pushed the price to the downtrend line. The price is stuck between the downtrend line and the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $12.83. This has resulted in a squeeze, likely resolving with a sharp move on either side.\par \par \uc2 If the price surges above the downtrend line, the LINK/USDT pair may climb to $16.60 and then to $18.30. Instead, if the price turns down and plunges below $12.83, the decline could extend to the 50-day SMA ($11.21).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has reached the overhead resistance at $22, which is an important level to watch out for. The bears are expected to defend this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/13b36b0a-c561-495b-9e10-8bf53e4bd51d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, if bulls do not give up much ground from the current level, it will increase the likelihood of a break above $22. The pair may then climb to $25 where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the 20-day EMA ($18.40) remains the key level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down and slips below this level, it will suggest the start of a deeper correction to $16. Such a move will indicate that the \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair may spend some more time inside the large range between $10.50 and $22.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/5ffc06a1-5365-4936-a33d-327eac0c92dd.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231124ejbo0008f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
