ation of \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , particularly between the price ranges of $0.368 and $0.391, where a colossal 7.51 billion tokens have been amassed. This intense concentration of holdings represents both a solid support and a risk factor; the big question now is, will the holders in this range stick around or bail out at the first sign of trouble?\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 On the technical analysis front, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is currently navigating the waters between its first support point at $0.3771 and first resistance point at $0.3862. This tight trading range is crucial, as it sits right in the thick of the recent accumulation zone. Traders are carefully monitoring the 14-day RSI, hovering around the 70% mark, signaling that \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be entering overbought territory.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Adding to the complexity, the 3-10 day MACD oscillator is stalling at $0.3916, just above the second level resistance at $0.3911, indicating one more barrier to upward movements. Meanwhile, the 3-10-16 day MACD moving average stalls at $0.3637, slightly below the third support point at $0.3679, offering a potential cushion against a downturn.\par \par \uc2 The recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  news from the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) DeFi ecosystem, particularly the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TeddySwap/status/1727906456505036884?t=FBpi3blelWHV76tO5u8xcQ&s=19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launch of TeddySwap}}}\uc2  and its integration with popular \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  wallets, is adding fuel to the fire. This growth in the DeFi sector has even led {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chain/Cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoin's TVL}}}\uc2  to surpass Bitcoin, indicating a strong interest in the Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) market. But, there's a twist: despite these positive developments, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  took a surprising downturn following its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/inspectxyz/status/1725209673224118416"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 partnership with Inspect}}}\uc2 , leaving traders and investors in a state of anticipation about its next move.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 In terms of future prospects, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario could see Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) break through $0.3862, potentially riding the wave of its recent partnership and DeFi ecosystem growth. Crypto analyst Dan Gambardello's {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/crypto-analyst-dan-gambardello-predicts-cardano-to-11-while-new-token-emerges-ripple-to-soar-40"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  prediction}}}\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  reaching $11 in the upcoming bull cycle could be underpinned by factors like the further growth of its TVL and the Vasil Hardfork upgrade. If altcoin breaches the $0.3911 resistance, the next significant levels to watch would be the third resistance at $0.3953 and the 13-week high at $0.4086, aligning with the 1-month high.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would involve Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) falling below its immediate support;.a breach below $0.3771 could see it test the second support point at $0.3729, and further weakness might push it towards the third support level at $0.3679. Such a downturn could be exacerbated if the large holders decide to exit, potentially flooding the market with a large volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  tokens and reversing recent gains.\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC): Setting Records in the Crypto Arena\par \par \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) has recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2023/11/are-cardano-ada-and-litecoin-ltc-pre-christmas-gains-against-bitcoin-a-hint-of-higher-rallies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 set a new record}}}\uc2  in the crypto world, achieving over 1 million transactions in a single day \u8211\'20\'13 this milestone not only surpasses the asset's previous records, but also exceeds Bitcoin's daily transaction volume. Adding to this momentum, the LTC network activity has seen a surge with daily active addresses nearing those of Bitcoin and far surpassing Ethereum's. In the wake of this activity, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) has also seen a substantial increase in new Ordinals inscriptions and gained further traction with Bakkt including LTC in its enhanced custody platform.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Technical Analysis\par \par \uc2 In the realm of technical analysis, \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) is currently positioned in a crucial trading zone, oscillating between the first support level at $68.37 and the first resistance point at $70.75. This narrow trading band is just below the 1-month and 13-week high of $76.9.\par \par \uc2 Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/3rzIBxxK/?symbol=COINBASE%3ALTCUSD"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 14 Day RSI is currently at 50%, indicating a neutral market sentiment. The 3-10 day MACD oscillator, stalling at $69.27, and the 3-10-16 day MACD moving average stalling at $70.97 suggest a potential hesitation in the upward momentum.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, resistance points at $71.93 and $73.13, alongside the $71.65 mark where the 9-day moving average stalls, are critical levels that could dictate the short-term trajectory of LTC. A sustained move above these thresholds could signal a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout, aligning with the positive network usage data.\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Price Forecast\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario for \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) is underscored by the potential breakout from a long-term ascending triangle pattern, as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MASTERBTCLTC/status/1727195189016732067?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1727195189016732067%7Ctwgr%5Eba7ede07166237853742c0d24cf2ea364a481447%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Feng.ambcrypto.com%2Fif-this-is-true-litecoin-might-kickstart-a-rally-in-december%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  by crypto analyst Shan Belew. A decisive move above the key resistance levels, particularly around $71 where {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/pro/futures/LiquidationHeatMap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent liquidations}}}\uc2  have caused a price correction , could see LTC challenging its 13-week high at $76.9 and possibly pushing towards the $85 mark.\par \par \uc2 However, on the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  side, if \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) fails to breach these resistance levels, a pullback could see it testing lower support levels, with the second support at $67.16 and further down at $65.99. The recent 15% decline in trading volume and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://app.santiment.net/charts?settings=%7B%22slug%22%3A%22litecoin%22%2C%22ticker%22%3A%22LTC%22%2C%22from%22%3A%222023-05-24T20%3A59%3A59.786Z%22%2C%22to%22%3A%222023-11-24T20%3A59%3A59.786Z%22%7D&widgets=%5B%7B%22widget%22%3A%22ChartWidget%22%2C%22wm%22%3A%5B%22price_usd%22%2C%22mvrv_usd%22%5D%2C%22whm%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22wax%22%3A%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22wpax%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22wc%22%3A%5B%22%2326C953%22%2C%22%23FFAD4D%22%5D%7D%5D"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MVRV ratio drop}}}\uc2  add to the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  concerns, suggesting a potential cooling off of investor interest in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bottomline\par \par \uc2 As the Christmas bull run is around the corner, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC) are grabbing headlines with their distinct paths. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently buzzing from its recent DeFi developments and a surge in market interest, finding itself at a crucial moment. It's a bit like a tightrope walker \u8211\'20\'13 will it confidently stride forward and break through the resistance, or wobble under the pressure? On the other side, LTC, riding high on a wave of record transaction volumes and growing network activity, faces its own pivotal moment. Can it leap forward, propelled by its recent successes, or take a step back amid the market's twists and turns? For both Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  (LTC), it's a time of high stakes and big possibilities.\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231124ejbo000p1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw40\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal600\pichgoal600
