\par\par \b \uc2 Crypto Analyst Dan Gambardello Predicts Cardano To $11, While New Token Emerges, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  To Soar 40%\b0\par\par\uc2 Crypto Daily \par \uc2 626 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 November 2023\par \uc2 CryptoDaily\par \uc2 CRPTOD\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2023, CryptoDaily, All rights Reserved - Provided by SyndiGate Media Inc. \par \par \uc2 Table of Contents\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardano (\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 ) Going To 11, Says Dan Gambardello}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ripple (XRP) To Soar 40%, Says EGRAG CRYPTO}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Everlodge (ELDG): Imagine Owning An Expensive Property In Miami}}}\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cryptodaily.co.uk/#ms-4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale:}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto analyst, Dan Gambardello, has recently made headlines with his \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  Cardano price forecast. The analysts have predicted that Cardano will skyrocket to $11 during the next crypto bull run. Apart from Cardano, analysts are also \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  about \uc2 Ripple\uc2  and Everlodge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pr.everlodge.io/12v4ad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Join the Everlodge presale and win a luxury holiday to the Maldives}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) Going To 11, Says Dan Gambardello\par \par \uc2 Crypto analyst {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rzFPSQ7Fe8A"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dan Gambardello has forecasted}}}\uc2  that Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) might reach $11 in the upcoming bull cycle. Such an increase would push the Cardano market cap to over $400 billion. Gambardello noted that Cardano's \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  was lagging behind Ethereum, by one cycle.\par \par \uc2 According to him, Cardano crypto surpassed $3 during its last bull run without network upgrades and high adoption. Looking ahead, Gambardello expects several factors to influence the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/cardano/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cardanovalue}}}\uc2  in the next bull market.\par \par \uc2 Some of them include the Vasil Hardfork upgrade, the growth of Cardano's TVL, and the introduction of Cardano's multi-asset ledger. CoinMarketCap data shows that the price of Cardano has fluctuated between $0.346738 and $0.406049 in the past week. Cardano price chart showed 4.1% and 48.7% on the 7-day and 30-day timeframe.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  (XRP) To Soar 40%, Says EGRAG CRYPTO\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's XRP price recently mirrored the broader market correction as it fell to $0.59 on November 18th. The \uc2 Ripple\uc2  coin has recovered to the $0.61 level. However, \uc2 Ripple\uc2  crypto is still well below its early November mark of $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Nevertheless, cryptocurrency experts like {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/egragcrypto/status/1726494793813959017?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1726494793813959017%7Ctwgr%5E00b48a93e1e78d27c58bf1d2f08ff8d36af4ccc1%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoinedition.com%2Fxrp-will-need-to-pass-0-85-before-it-can-breakout-says-analyst%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EGRAG CRYPTO are still \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  on \uc2 Ripple\uc2 's price. EGRAG CRYPTO believed that if \uc2 Ripple\uc2  could overcome the $0.83 - $0.85 crucial level, the asset could undergo a substantial surge.\par \par \uc2 Ripple\uc2  has support at three levels. They are robust support ($0.50), firm support range ($0.54-$0.55), and support threshold ($0.60). According to this analyst, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/currencies/xrp/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price of Ripple}}}\uc2  could increase by 40% and reach $0.85 in the coming months. However, he advised the \uc2 Ripple\uc2  community to be cautious.\par \par \uc2 Everlodge (ELDG): Imagine Owning An Expensive Property In Miami\par \par \uc2 Everlodge (ELDG) has become a significant player in the real estate industry. Previously, purchasing a high-value property in pricey locales such as Miami and Dubai was reserved for the wealthy. However, Everlodge's revolutionary technology has upended the status quo.\par \par \uc2 The project's goal is to combine blockchain technology and NFT fractional ownership to make luxury real estate investments more accessible to a broader audience. Its technique has enabled persons with limited resources to purchase a stake in such assets for as little as $100.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, Everlodge used blockchain technology to store property information such as titles and deeds. This was owing to the security and openness of blockchain. Furthermore, this has boosted users' confidence and trust in the site.\par \par \uc2 This has created a flexible market for fractional ownership. Apart from being a transactional token, ELDG offers added benefits like staking rewards and discounts. Presently, the price of Everlodge's token is valued at $0.025. Experts have foreseen a 30x pump in ELDG's value as it partners with property developers worldwide.\par \par \uc2 Find out more about the Everlodge (ELDG) Presale:\par \par \uc2 Website: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.everlodge.io/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.everlodge.io/}}}\par \par \uc2 Telegram: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.me/everlodge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.me/everlodge}}}\par \par \uc2 Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.\par \par \uc2 Document CRPTOD0020231123ejbn0018h\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 11/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, TON, LINK, \uc2 AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,708 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2023\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2023. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are finding buyers at lower levels but may face stiff resistance from the bears on rallies.\par \par \uc2 Traders hate uncertainty; hence, the settlement between \uc2 Binance\uc2 , Changpeng \u8220\'20\'1CCZ\u8221\'20\'1D Zhao and the \uc2 United States Department of Justice\uc2  is likely to be viewed as a positive for the cryptocurrency space. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-cz-settlement-us-doj-bullish-bitcoin-etf-crypto-community-says"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Analysts largely remained positive on the deal}}}\uc2 , but a few sounded cautious due to the Securities and Exchange Commission\u8217\'20\'19s pending lawsuit against \uc2 Binance\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and several major altcoins fell sharply on Nov. 21 following the \uc2 Binance\uc2  news but are finding support at lower levels. This suggests that traders stepped in after the initial knee-jerk reaction, and are buying at lower levels. After the initial bounce, the bulls are likely to head into stiff opposition from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/14949dee-1ac0-48f8-a618-9288a97b6b6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Buying on dips and selling on rallies results in a range-bound action as both the bulls and the bears battle it out for supremacy. Generally, a consolidation near the 52-week high is considered a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign, but traders should wait for an upside confirmation before jumping in to buy.\par \par \uc2 Will Bitcoin and select altcoins remain stuck inside a range for the next few days? What are the important levels to watch out for?\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Bitcoin below the 20-day exponential moving average ($35,948) on Nov. 21 but could not sustain the lower levels. Strong buying by the bulls pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA on Nov. 22.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/373a7356-8ddc-4fec-904b-f7273c91cddb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair has been consolidating between $34,800 and $38,000 for several days. This indicates a balance between supply and demand. A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that the 20-day EMA is sloping up, and the relative strength index (RSI) remains in the positive zone.\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above $38,000, the pair could start the next leg of the uptrend to $40,000. This level may act as a formidable resistance, but if cleared, the pair may soar to $48,000.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below $34,800, it will suggest that the traders are rushing to the exit. That may open the doors for a further decline to $32,400.\par \par \uc2 Ether price analysis\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the resistance line on Nov. 20 and slipped below the 20-day EMA ($1,957) on Nov. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/13999663-883c-4eec-a3de-8f3965010272.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AETHUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 However, the bulls had other plans. They aggressively purchased the drop below the 20-day EMA and are again trying to overcome the barrier at the resistance line. This remains a pivotal level to keep an eye on because a break above it could start a rally to $2,137 and then to $2,200.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, $1,880 is a necessary support to watch out for. If this level fails to hold, the ETH/USDT pair may start a deeper correction to the 50-day simple moving average ($1,791). That could delay the start of the next leg of the up-move.\par \par \uc2 BNB price analysis\par \par \uc2 BNB ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) witnessed a wild ride on Nov. 21, with an intraday high of $272 and a low of $224. This indicates uncertainty about the next directional move between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/0cb8946c-b4cc-4614-9baf-aac98d7ab335.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ABNBUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls did not allow the price to break below the major support at $223. That started a recovery on Nov. 22, and the bulls are trying to push the price back above the 20-day EMA ($240). If they succeed, it will signal that the BNB/USDT pair may consolidate between $223 and $265 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to sustain above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could again pull the price toward $223. A break below this support could extend the fall to $203.\par \par \uc2 XRP price analysis\par \par \uc2 XRP ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.61) on Nov. 20 and fell to the 50-day SMA ($0.57) on Nov. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/6462028c-1eab-454e-9dbb-705fb43ee02c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AXRPUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are expected to defend the support at $0.56 because a failure to do so may result in a drop toward $0.46. The slightly downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI just below the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to the bears.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. That will signal a possible range-bound action between $0.56 and $0.74 for a few days. The bulls will be back in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat after the XRP/USDT pair rises above $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Solana price analysis\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) climbed above the critical overhead resistance of $0.59 on Nov. 19, but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The bears pulled the price back below $0.59 on Nov. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/3dd37ebc-261f-4bdb-b30c-7b1fa5b485d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ASOLUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The SOL/USDT pair snapped back from the 20-day EMA ($51) on Nov. 22, indicating that the bulls are vigorously protecting the level. Buyers will again try to overcome the obstacle at $59 and challenge the local high at $68.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price once again turns down from $59, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. Sellers will then again attempt to sink the price below the vital support at $48. If this level gives way, the pair may nosedive to the 50-day SMA ($37).\par \par \uc2 Cardano price analysis\par \par \uc2 Repeated failures of the bulls to maintain Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the breakout level of $0.38 started a correction on Nov. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/bc62219b-b331-4efd-bdc1-30f0f3f87375.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AADAUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The price reached the 20-day EMA ($0.35), which is acting as a strong support. The sharp rebound off this level suggests robust buying by the bulls. It also increases the likelihood of a break above $0.39. If this level is scaled, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could increase to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 If bears want to prevent the rally, they will have to quickly drag the price below the 20-day EMA. There is a minor support at $0.34, but if it cracks, the pair may slide to the 50-day SMA ($0.30).\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($0.07) on Nov. 21, but the bears are struggling to sustain the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/bc837c0c-6352-4419-bd02-b80b7879bd3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ADOGEUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to push the DOGE/USDT pair back above the 20-day EMA. If they can pull it off, it will suggest aggressive buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.08 and start the march toward $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, the bears will try to sell the rallies and keep the price pinned below the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a potential drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.07) and eventually to the crucial support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-bounces-3-post-binance-bitcoin-bulls-step-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price bounces 3% post Binance amid call for Bitcoin bulls to \u8216\'20\'18step in\u8217\'20\'19}}}\par \par \uc2 Toncoin price analysis\par \par \uc2 Toncoin (TON) has been finding support at the 50-day SMA ($2.19), indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/8e4ac619-0005-4fb0-80f6-b4067ca3001d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TON/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3ALTCUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages remain flattish, and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a range-bound action in the short term. If the price maintains above $2.40, the TON/USDT pair may rise to $2.59.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could test the support at the 50-day SMA. If this support cracks, the pair may start a downward move to $2 and subsequently to $1.89.\par \par \uc2 Chainlink price analysis\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the immediate resistance of $15.39 on Nov. 20 and fell below the 20-day EMA ($13.63) on Nov. 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/aee7a6e7-1c32-46f0-a590-10488f9534f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AlinkUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The LINK/USDT pair rebounded back above the 20-day EMA on Nov. 22, indicating demand at lower levels. Buyers will once again try to propel the price above $15.39 and retest the overhead resistance at $16.60.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the bears are likely to have other plans. They will try to defend the $15.39 level and pull the price below the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level of $12.83. If they do that, the pair may plummet to the 50-day SMA ($10.94).\par \par \uc2 Avalanche price analysis\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) closed above the $10.52 to $22 range on Nov. 19, but the bulls could not maintain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the breakout level on Nov. 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/e6912b91-3801-4501-8d34-8ab93d6ab742.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/chart/?symbol=BINANCE%3AavaxUSDT"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($17.71) is sloping up, and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the bulls have the upper hand. Buyers will again try to propel the price above $22, and if they are successful, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The \uc2 AVAX\uc2 /USDT pair could then start its journey toward $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrarily, if the price turns down from $22, it will indicate that the bears are vigorously protecting the level. That will increase the possibility of a break below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may remain stuck inside the large range for a while longer.\par \par \uc2 This article does not contain investment advice or recommendations. Every investment and trading move involves risk, and readers should conduct their own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=90,width=840/https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2023-11/9466ec5a-3e3a-4f64-82ba-2064a972e0a3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020231122ejbm000b7\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (ADA) AND ("market reaction" OR "price drop" OR "price rise" OR "volatility" OR "bullish" OR "bearish" OR "investor sentiment" OR "regulation" OR "ETF approval" OR "crypto ban" OR "crypto adoption" OR "digital\u160\'00\'A0asset")\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\